#: data/json/lua_traits.lua
msgid "You feel relief as you step back into the light."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/lua_traits.lua
msgid "You feel a twinge of panic as darkness engulfs you."
msgstr "Karanlık seni sararken bir panik anı hissediyorsun."

#: data/json/lua_traits.lua
msgid ""
"Your fear of the dark is so intense that your trembling legs fail you, and "
"you fall to the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/lua_traits.lua
msgid ""
"Your fear of the dark is so intense that your hands start shaking "
"uncontrollably."
msgstr ""
"Karanlıktan duyduğun korku o kadar yoğun ki ellerin kontrolsüz bir şekilde "
"titremeye başlıyor."

#: data/json/lua_traits.lua
msgid ""
"Your fear of the dark is so intense that you start breathing rapidly, and "
"you feel like your heart is ready to jump out of the chest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/lua_traits.lua
msgid "It's so cluttered here..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/lua_traits.lua
msgid ""
"It's so dark and scary in there!  You can't force yourself to walk into this"
" tile.  Switch to running movement mode to move there."
msgstr ""
"İçerisi o kadar karanlık ve korkutucu ki! Bu kareye girmeye kendini "
"zorlayamazsın. Oraya gitmek için koşma hareket moduna geç."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "No style"
msgstr "Tarz yok"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'No style'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Not a martial art, this is just plain old punching and kicking."
msgstr "Bir dövüş sanatı değil, bu sadece sıradan yumruk atma ve tekmeleme."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'No style'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You decide to not use any martial arts."
msgstr "Hiçbir dövüş sanatı kullanmamaya karar veriyorsunuz."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'No style'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s enters a generic combat stance."
msgstr "%s genel bir savaş duruşuna giriyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Force unarmed"
msgstr "Zorla çırçıplak"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Force unarmed'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Not a martial art, setting this style will prevent weapon attacks and force "
"punches (with free hand) or kicks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Force unarmed'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You force yourself to fight unarmed."
msgstr "Kendinizi çırçıplak dövüşmeye zorlayın."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Force unarmed'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s decides to fight unarmed."
msgstr "%s silahsız savaşmaya karar veriyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Aikido"
msgstr "Aikido"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Aikido is a Japanese martial art focused on self-defense, while minimizing "
"injury to the attacker.  It uses defensive throws and disarms but lacks "
"offensive techniques."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You enter the hamni stance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s changes into a relaxed combat posture."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Aikido Stance"
msgstr "Aikido Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Aikido Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"By disregarding offensive in favor of self-defense, you are better at protecting.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Intermediate Aikido"
msgstr "Orta Seviye Aikido"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Intermediate Aikido' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Aikido'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"An intermediate aikido practitioner can protect themselves against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked Damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity.\n"
"+1 Block attempts, +1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Advanced Aikido"
msgstr "Gelişmiş Aikido"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Advanced Aikido' for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"An advanced aikido practitioner can protect themselves against even more opponents than normal.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, +1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Barbaran Montante"
msgstr "Barbaran Montante"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Barbaran Montante'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The Barbaran Montante originated in 16th century Spain and focuses on "
"overcoming thick armor with two handed swords and sweeping blows, "
"transferring kinetic energy through armor and into vulnerable organs and "
"bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Barbaran Montante'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You heft your weapon, stretch your shoulders, and slide into the Represa."
msgstr ""
"Silahını kaldırıyorsun, omuzlarını geriyorsun ve Represa'ya kayıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Barbaran Montante'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s rolls their shoulders and prepares to duel."
msgstr "%s omuzlarını silker ve düelloya hazırlanır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Barbaran Represa"
msgstr "Barbaran Represa"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Barbaran Represa' for martial art '{'str': 'Barbaran
#. Montante'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Sliding footwork enhances the crushing continuity of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 100% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Ricasso Step"
msgstr "Ricasso Adımı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Ricasso Step' for martial art '{'str': 'Barbaran
#. Montante'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You switch or sturdy your grip mid-step to aid your blocking.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 40% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Adım başında tutuşunuzu değiştirir veya sağlamlaştırarak blok yapmanıza yardımcı olursunuz.\n"
"\n"
"Engellenen hasar %40 Güç azaltılır.\n"
"3 tur sürer. 3 kez birikir."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Boxing"
msgstr "Boks"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Sport of the true gentleman, modern boxing has evolved from the prizefights "
"of the Victorian era.  Strength reduces blocked damage and moving increase "
"dodge skill."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You lower your chin and raise your fists to eye level."
msgstr "Çenenizi indirip yumruklarınızı göz seviyesine kaldırıyorsunuz."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares to fight with raised fists."
msgstr "%s yumruklarını kaldırarak dövüşmeye hazırlanır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Boxing Stance"
msgstr "Boks Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Boxing Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"A solid stance allows you block more damage than normal and deliver better punches.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Damage, Blocked damge reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Footwork"
msgstr "Ayak hareketleri"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Footwork' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are make yourself harder to hit by bobbing and weaving as you move.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts for 1 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Counter Chance"
msgstr "Karşılaşma Şansı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Counter Chance' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You've seen your chance. Now strike back!\n"
"\n"
"+25% Damage.\n"
"Lasts for 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Brawling"
msgstr "Dövüşme"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Brawling'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You're used to hand-to-creature fighting.  You know how to fight when "
"unarmed or with any weapon to a certain extent.  It's not stylish or "
"sporting, but it gets the job done."
msgstr ""
"Ellerinle yaratıklarla dövüşmeye alışkınsın. Silahsız ya da belirli bir "
"ölçüde herhangi bir silahla nasıl dövüşeceğini biliyorsun. Şık ya da sportif"
" değil, ama işini görüyor."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Brawling'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You grit your teeth and prepare for a good fight."
msgstr "Dişlerini sıkarak iyi bir dövüşe hazırlanıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Brawling'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s gets ready to brawl."
msgstr "%s kavgaya hazırlanır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Capoeira"
msgstr "Kapoeira"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"A dance-like style with its roots in Brazilian slavery, Capoeira is focused "
"on fluid movement and sweeping kicks.  Moving briefly enables stronger "
"techniques.  Missing an attack grants bonus damage for a short time."
msgstr ""
"Brezilya köleliğine dayanan dans benzeri bir stil olan Capoeira, akıcı "
"hareketler ve geniş tekmelere odaklanır. Kısa bir süre hareket etmek daha "
"güçlü teknikleri mümkün kılar. Bir saldırıyı kaçırmak kısa bir süre için "
"bonus hasar verir."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You begin performing the ginga."
msgstr "Ginga yapmaya başlıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s begins to rhythmically rock back and forth."
msgstr "%s ritmik bir şekilde ileri geri sallanmaya başlar."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Capoeira Stance"
msgstr "Capoeira Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Capoeira Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Capoeira'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You never stop moving while performing the ginga.  This makes you very mobile while fighting.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill, +1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Capoeira Momentum"
msgstr "Capoeira Momentum"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Capoeira Momentum' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Capoeira'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You can feel the rhythm as you move.  Not only are you harder to hit, but your kicks are even more amazing!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Enables \"Spin Kick\" and \"Sweep Kick\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane Kung Fu"
msgstr "Crane Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Crane uses intricate hand "
"techniques and jumping dodges.  Dexterity determines your damage, rather "
"than Strength; you also receive a dodge bonus move or dodge an attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You raise your leg slightly and balance like a crane."
msgstr ""
"Bacağınızı hafifçe kaldırır ve bir turna kuşu gibi dengede durursunuz."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a crane-like stance."
msgstr "%s bir turna gibi bir duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane's Precision"
msgstr "Crane'in Hassasiyeti"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Precision' for martial art '{'str': 'Crane
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your attacks strike at your opponents weakness with speed and precision instead of brute force.\n"
"Dexterity increases melee damage instead of Strength.\n"
"\n"
"Damage increased by 75% of Dexterity but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane's Flight"
msgstr "Crane'in Uçuşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Flight' for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Just like a bird, you take to the air to avoid danger.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane's Grace"
msgstr "Crane'in Lütfu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Grace' for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Much like the crane, you a quick to avoid danger.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, +1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon Kung Fu"
msgstr "Ejderha Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Dragon uses fluid movements and "
"hard strikes.  Intelligence improves your accuracy instead of Dexterity.  "
"Your attacks lead to counterattacks which disable your opponents and set "
"them up for a powerful finishing move."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You relax and patiently await conflict like the great dragon."
msgstr "Büyük ejderha gibi rahatlayarak çatışmayı sabırla beklersin."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a dragon-like stance."
msgstr "%s bir ejderha benzeri duruş alıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon's Flight"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Dragon's Flight' for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Life and combat are a circle.  An attack leads to a counter and to an attack once again.  Seek to complete this loop.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, +2 Damage.\n"
"Enables \"Dragon Vortex Block\" and \"Dragon Wing Dodge\"\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon's Knowledge"
msgstr "Ejderha'nın Bilgisi"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Dragon's Knowledge' for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You plan your attack far in advance relying on your intuition instead of your speed to strike true.\n"
"Intelligence increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Intelligence but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/MagicalNights/martialarts.json
msgid "Eskrima"
msgstr "Eskrima"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Eskrima, also known as Kali, is a Filipino martial art.  It emphasizes rapid"
" strikes with knife and baton weapons, along with a variety of improvised "
"substitutes."
msgstr ""
"Eskrima, aynı zamanda Kali olarak bilinir, Filipin kökenli bir dövüş "
"sanatıdır. Bıçak ve sopa silahlarıyla hızlı darbeleri vurgular ve çeşitli "
"doğaçlama ikameleri içerir."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You enter an open guard stance and prepare to strike."
msgstr "Açık bir bekçi duruşuna geçiyor ve saldırıya hazırlanıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s enters an open stance."
msgstr "%s açık bir duruşa geçiyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Eskrima Stance"
msgstr "Eskrima Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Eskrima Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are skilled at getting the most out of your weapons.  The term 'weapon' might be very subjective,\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/MagicalNights/martialarts.json
msgid "Fencing"
msgstr "Kılıç dövüşü"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The noble art of fencing is taught with flexible competition blades, but the"
" techniques are derived from (and applicable to) more functional examples.  "
"Skilled fencers can take advantage of blocks and feints to deliver accurate "
"strikes."
msgstr ""
"Şövalyelik sanatı, esnek yarışma kılıçlarıyla öğretilir, ancak teknikler "
"daha işlevsel örneklerden türetilmiştir (ve bunlara uygulanabilir). Usta "
"kılıç dövüşçüleri, doğru darbeler yapmak için bloklar ve aldatmalar "
"kullanabilirler."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You move into the en-garde stance."
msgstr "Savaş pozisyonuna geçiyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s moves into a fencing stance."
msgstr "%s bir eskrim duruşuna geçiyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Fencing Stance"
msgstr "Kılıç Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Fencing Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your side stance minimizes the chances you will be harmed in a combat.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/json/items/book/martial.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/martialarts.json
msgid "Fior Di Battaglia"
msgid_plural "Fior Di Battaglia"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Medieval Europe's martial techniques for fighting with polearms.  The "
"\"Flower of Battle\" places great focus on countering one's opponent and "
"knocking them down before landing a killing blow"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You hold your weapon in a firm grip, ready to block any attack."
msgstr ""
"Silahını sıkı bir tutuşla tutuyorsun, herhangi bir saldırıyı engellemeye "
"hazır."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s grips their weapon tightly."
msgstr "%s silahını sıkıca kavrıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Stand Your Ground"
msgstr "Yerinde Dur"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stand Your Ground' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di
#. Battaglia'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are stalwart and will not budge against any threat.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Block attempts, -1.0 Dodge skill, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tactical Retreat"
msgstr "Taktiksel Geri Çekilme"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tactical Retreat' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di
#. Battaglia'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You moved and nullified the effects of Stand Your Ground!\n"
"\n"
"-2 Block attempts, +1.0 Dodge skill, blocked damaged increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Judo"
msgstr "Judo"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Judo is a martial art that focuses on grabs and throws, both defensive and "
"offensive.  You are resistant to most effects that can knock you down and "
"can counter grab and takedown attacks with strong judo throw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You prepare yourself for a grapple."
msgstr "Kendini bir kavga için hazırlıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares for a grapple."
msgstr "%s bir kavga için hazırlanıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Judo Stance"
msgstr "Judo Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Judo Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your knowledge of grappling allows you to recover from knock down effects instantly.\n"
"In addition, you can counter grabs and takedown attacks with a judo throw."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Karate"
msgstr "Karate"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Karate is a popular martial art, originating from Japan.  It focuses on "
"rapid, precise attacks, blocks, and fluid movement.  A successful hit allows"
" you an extra dodge and two extra blocks on the following round."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You adopt a classic karate stance."
msgstr "Klasik bir karate duruşu alıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s adopts a classic karate stance."
msgstr "%s klasik bir karate duruşu alıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Karate Strike"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Karate Strike' for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Landing a hit allows you to perfectly position yourself for maximum defense against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Block attempts, +1 Dodges attempts, blocked damge reduced by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Karate Stance"
msgstr "Karate Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Karate Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your no nonsense stance allows you hit more accurately.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Kickboxing"
msgstr "Kickboks"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Kickboxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"A martial art that combines western boxing with elements of Karate, "
"Taekwondo, Muay Thai and Savate, particularly in the use of kicks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Kickboxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You assume a kickboxing stance and focus power into your limbs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Kickboxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a kickboxing stance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Kick stance"
msgstr "Tekme duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Kick stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Kickboxing'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You have adopted a stance which allows for greater mobility and stability.  Your hands are in a guard position with elbows forward to protect yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 25% of Strength.\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/MagicalNights/martialarts.json
msgid "Krav Maga"
msgstr "Krav Maga"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Krav Maga'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Originating in Israel, Krav Maga is based on taking down an enemy quickly "
"and effectively.  It focuses on applicable attacks rather than showy or "
"complex moves.  Popular among police and armed forces everywhere."
msgstr ""
"İsrail kökenli olan Krav Maga, düşmanı hızlı ve etkili bir şekilde etkisiz "
"hale getirmeye dayanmaktadır. Gösterişli veya karmaşık hareketler yerine "
"uygulanabilir saldırılara odaklanır. Her yerde polis ve silahlı kuvvetler "
"arasında popülerdir."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Krav Maga'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You assume a practical combat stance."
msgstr "Pratik bir savaş duruşu alıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Krav Maga'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a practical combat stance."
msgstr "%s pratik bir dövüş duruşu alıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Krav Maga Stance"
msgstr "Krav Maga Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Krav Maga Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Krav
#. Maga'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your training makes it easier to land hits and fight multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, +1 Block attempts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Leopar Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Leopard focuses on rapid, "
"strategically planned strikes.  Dexterity determines your damage, rather "
"than Strength.  Moving increases dodge skill and accuracy further; attacking"
" after moving increases damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You prepare to pounce like a leopard."
msgstr "Bir kaplan gibi atılmak için hazırlanıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a leopard-like stance."
msgstr "%s kaplan benzeri bir duruş alıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard's Strategy"
msgstr "Leopar'ın Stratejisi"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Strategy' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You fight by overwhelming your opponents with speedy strikes that are much harder to defend against.\n"
"Dexterity increases melee damage instead of Strength.\n"
"\n"
"Damage increased by 75% of Dexterity but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard's Agility"
msgstr "Leoparın Çevikliği"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Agility' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Just like a cat, you are quick, agile, and hard to pin down.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard's Stalk"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Stalk' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You proudly stalk the shadows and preparing to pounce with unrelenting fury.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy.\n"
"Enables \"Leopard's Pounce\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard's Pounce"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Pounce' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are ready.  Attack and claim your prey!\n"
"\n"
"+25% bonus to all damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_martial_arts_expansion.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/martialarts.json
msgid "Medieval Swordsmanship"
msgstr "Ortaçağ Kılıç Kullanımı"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The art of the longsword and sword & shield, preceding the later development"
" of fencing.  Designed for combat both unarmored and in armor, it includes "
"grappling as well as defensive and offensive sword techniques.  This "
"treatise compares the Italian and German traditions of medieval combat with "
"detailed step-by-step pictures."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You take on a knightly stance."
msgstr "Şövalye duruşu alıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s takes on a knightly stance."
msgstr "%s şövalye duruşu alıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Swordsman's Stance"
msgstr "Kılıçbazen Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Swordsman's Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Through chivalry and vigilance, your defense with a blade has increased.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, blocked damage decreased by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Muay Thai"
msgstr "Muay Thai"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Muay Thai'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Also referred to as the \"Art of 8 Limbs,\" Muay Thai is a popular fighting "
"technique from Thailand that uses powerful strikes.  Your strength decreases"
" blocked damage.  Blocking attacks or getting hit will increase your damage "
"and blocked damage further."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Muay Thai'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You perform a short wai khru in honor of your teachers."
msgstr "Öğretmenlerin onuruna kısa bir wai khru yapıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Muay Thai'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s performs a short war-dance."
msgstr "%s kısa bir savaş dansı yapar."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Muay Thai Stance"
msgstr "Muay Thai Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Muay Thai Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Muay
#. Thai'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Strength is everything in Muay Thai and you know how to make the most of yours.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage decreased by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/MagicalNights/martialarts.json
msgid "Ninjutsu"
msgstr "Ninjutsu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Ninjutsu is a martial art and set of tactics used by ninja in feudal Japan."
"  It focuses on rapid, precise, silent strikes.  Ninjutsu is almost entirely"
" silent and does extra damage on the first attack.  It also provides small "
"combat bonuses every time you move."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You perform a kuji-in mantra with your hands. Rin, Kai, Jin!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s performs a series of intricate hand signs."
msgstr "%s karmaşık el işaretleri serisi yapar."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Ninjutsu Stance"
msgstr "Ninjutsu Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Ninjutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your training allows you to make no noise when attacking and less noise when moving around.\n"
"\n"
"Melee and unarmed attacks generate 0 noise.  Moving generates 1/2 as much noise."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Sneak Attack"
msgstr "Sızma Saldırısı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Sneak Attack' for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"To a true shinobi, the first strike and the last strike are one in the same.\n"
"\n"
"+50% all damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Momentum Shift"
msgstr "Momentum Değişimi"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Momentum Shift' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Ninjas are training to be extremely agile and mobile.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill, Accuracy increased by 20% of Dexterity.\n"
"Last 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
msgstr "Niten Ichi-Ryu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Niten Ichi-Ryu is an ancient school of combat, transmitting a style of "
"classical Japanese swordsmanship conceived by the warrior Miyamoto Musashi."
"  Perception increases damage and reduces blocked damage.  Moving and "
"attacking reduces dodging and damage until you pause.  Pausing for a moment "
"increases Dodge skill."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You clear your mind as you prepare yourself for combat."
msgstr "Savaş için kendini hazırlarken zihnini boşaltıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s relaxes and prepares for combat."
msgstr "%s rahatlar ve savaşa hazırlanır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Niten Ichi-Ryu Stance"
msgstr "Niten Ichi-Ryu Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Niten Ichi-Ryu Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Cautious watchful eyes\n"
"measure and display your skill.\n"
"Practice makes perfect.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 50% of Perception, blocked damage reduced by 100% of Perception."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Waning Moon"
msgstr "Azalan Ay"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Waning Moon' for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-
#. Ryu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Blackened like darkness,\n"
"nightmares approach from all sides.\n"
"Flee at any cost!\n"
"\n"
"-5.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Moonlight"
msgstr "Ay Işığı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Moonlight' for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-
#. Ryu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Luck be the light,\n"
"on a dark and cloudy night\n"
"as the moon shines down\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"In-One Timing\".\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Pankration"
msgstr "Pankration"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Pankration'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Greek martial art once used by the Spartans.  It combines boxing "
"and wrestling techniques to create a brutal sport, though modern revival of "
"the art is less of no-holds-barred in nature."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Pankration'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You crouch slightly and prepare to rush forward."
msgstr "Biraz çömeliyorsun ve ileri atılmaya hazırlanıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Pankration'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s crouches slightly, ready to rush forward."
msgstr "%s hafifçe çömelir, ileri atılmaya hazırdır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Close Combat"
msgstr "Yakın Dövüş"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Close Combat' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Pankration'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You got your opponent right where you want them!\n"
"\n"
"+20% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Counter Chance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Pankration'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The enemy has presented an opening in their defense.\n"
"+10% damage.  Enables \"Close Combat\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat"
msgstr "Silat"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Pentjak Silat, of Indonesian origin, is a fighting style that covers the use"
" of short blades, bludgeons, and various staff weapons.  Fighters stay low "
"and mobile to avoid attacks, then unleash deadly critical hits."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You give a salute of respect as you prepare to combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s gives a combat salute."
msgstr "%s bir savaş selamı verir."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat Stance"
msgstr "Silat Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You try to stay loose as possible when fighting to have more chances to dodge.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat Evasion"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Evasion' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You stay low as you move, making it harder for enemies to pin you down.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts.\n"
"Lasts 2 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat Appraisal"
msgstr "Silat Değerlendirmesi"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Appraisal' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Each time you dodge an attack, you learn a bit more about your opponents' fighting style.  This allows you to make more precise attacks against them.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 15% of Dexterity.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Snake Kung Fu"
msgstr "Yılan Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Snake focuses on sinuous "
"movement and precision strikes.  Perception determines your Accuracy, rather"
" than Dexterity.  Standing still will increases your accuracy and damage of "
"your next attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You adopt a fluid stance, ready to strike like a snake."
msgstr "Sıvı bir duruş alıyorsun, yılan gibi saldırmaya hazır."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a snake-like stance."
msgstr "%s yılan benzeri bir duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Snake's Sight"
msgstr "Yılan'ın Görüşü"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Snake's Sight' for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are patient and know where to hit your opponent for the best results.\n"
"\n"
"Perception increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.  Accuracy increased by 25% of Perception but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Sōjutsu"
msgstr "Sōjutsu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Sōjutsu, \"The Way of the Spear\", is the Japanese martial art of fighting "
"with a spear.  Sōjutsu focuses on keeping opponents at a distance in order "
"to maintain advantage in combat.  Standing still gives you an extra block "
"attempt but moving will briefly increase your damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You prepare to defend against all that approach you."
msgstr "Size yaklaşan her şeye karşı savunma yapmaya hazırlanıyorsunuz."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a wide, defensive stance."
msgstr "%s geniş, savunmacı bir duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Sōjutsu Stance"
msgstr "Sōjutsu Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Sōjutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your training grants better defense while using a polearm.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempt."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Superior Positioning"
msgstr "Üstün Konumlandırma"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Superior Positioning' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You have given up your defenses for a moment to increase the damage of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -1 Block attempts.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Taekwondo"
msgstr "Tekvando"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Taekwondo is the national sport of Korea, and was used by the South Korean "
"army in the 20th century.  Focused on kicks and so it does not benefit from "
"wielded weapons.  It also includes strength training; your blocks absorb "
"extra damage and your attacks do more damage if you are not holding "
"anything."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You adopt a narrow fighting stance."
msgstr "Dar bir dövüş duruşu alıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You adopts a narrow fighting stance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Taekwondo Stance"
msgstr "Taekwondo Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Taekwondo Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Taekwondo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Using your legs to attack allows your hands to be free for better defense.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage decreased by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Unhindered"
msgstr "Engellenmemiş"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Unhindered' for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your attacks are stronger if you are not holding anything in your hands.\n"
"\n"
"+33% damage when not using a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Ellerinizde hiçbir şey tutmuyorsanız, saldırılarınız daha güçlüdür.\n"
"\n"
"Silah kullanmadığınızda +33% hasar."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tai Chi"
msgstr "Tai Chi"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Though Tai Chi is often seen as a form of mental and physical exercise, it "
"is a legitimate martial art, focused on self-defense.  Its ability to absorb"
" the force of an attack makes your Perception decrease damage further on a "
"block.  Pausing for a moment enables powerful palm strike techniques."
msgstr ""
"Tai Chi genellikle zihinsel ve fiziksel bir egzersiz biçimi olarak görülse "
"de, meşru bir dövüş sanatıdır ve öz savunmaya odaklanır.  Bir saldırının "
"kuvvetini emme yeteneği, Perception'ınızı bir blokta daha fazla hasar "
"azaltır.  Bir an duraklamak, güçlü avuç içi darbe tekniklerini mümkün kılar."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You settle into a gentle stance and prepare to defend yourself."
msgstr "Nazik bir duruşa geçiyorsun ve kendini savunmaya hazırlanıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s settles into a gentle stance."
msgstr "%s nazik bir duruşa yerleşir."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tai Chi Stance"
msgstr "Tai Chi Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tai Chi Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are focused of defense and predicting your opponents attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, blocked damage reduced by 100% Perception."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Repulse the Monkey"
msgstr "Maymunu geri püskürt."

#. ~ Description of buff 'Repulse the Monkey' for martial art '{'str': 'Tai
#. Chi'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"By perfectly positioning yourself and your opponent, you have become more accurate and can bypass your opponent's defenses.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception, gain Armor Penetration equal to 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tiger Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kaplan Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Tiger focuses on relentless "
"attacks above all else.  Your Strength determines your accuracy, and your "
"attacks do increasing damage as you continue attacking."
msgstr ""
"Beş Shaolin hayvan stilinden biri. Kaplan, her şeyden önce amansız "
"saldırılara odaklanır. Gücünüz, doğruluğunuzu belirler ve saldırılarınız "
"devam ettikçe artan hasar verir."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You clench your hands into ferocious, tiger-like claws."
msgstr "Ellerini vahşi, kaplan benzeri pençeler haline getiriyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a tiger-like stance."
msgstr "%s kaplan benzeri bir duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tiger Fury"
msgstr "Kaplan Öfkesi"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger Fury' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You attack with an endless barrage of strikes.  The more you hit, the stronger you become.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tiger's Strength"
msgstr "Kaplan'ın Gücü"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger's Strength' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You do not need defense.  You do not need a plan.  You need strength.  Strength will break your opponents' defenses and overwhelm them completely.\n"
"Strength increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Strength but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Wing Chun"
msgstr "Kanat Çun"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Wing Chun is a Chinese martial art that began by selecting the easiest-to-"
"learn effective techniques from the various Shaolin animal forms.  It has a "
"high stance, with weight entirely on the rear leg.  Wing Chun focuses on "
"sensitivity to the opponent's direction of force, and flowing around it to "
"get back to hitting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You take your stance and prepare to receive the gift of violence."
msgstr "Duruşunu alır ve şiddet armağanını kabul etmeye hazırlanırsın."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s patiently assumes a curiously pigeon-toed stance."
msgstr "%s merakla güvercin ayaklı bir duruş alıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Chain Punch"
msgstr "Zincir Yumruğu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Chain Punch' for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your punches are properly timed to give your opponent no rest from your strikes.\n"
"\n"
"-10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Chi-Sao Sensitivity"
msgstr "Chi-Sao Hassasiyeti"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Chi-Sao Sensitivity' for martial art '{'str': 'Wing
#. Chun'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You have a greater understanding of balance and technique.  This gives you a better chance to avoid your opponent's attacks.\n"
"\n"
" Dodging Skill increased by 15% of Perception.  Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Perception."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Zui Quan"
msgstr "Zui Quan"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"AKA \"drunken boxing,\" Zui Quan imitates the movement of a drunk to confuse"
" the enemy.  You gain a passive dodge bonus and accuracy bonus based on your"
" intelligence.  Moving gives you additional dodge attempts and each time you"
" dodge, you inflict more damage with your counterattack for until the end of"
" your next turn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You begin to sway to and fro with a confident swagger."
msgstr "Kendine güvenen bir tavırla ileri geri sallanmaya başlıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s stumbles as if pretending to be drunk."
msgstr "%s sarhoşmuş gibi tökezliyor."

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Zui Quan Stance"
msgstr "Zui Quan Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Zui Quan Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Others might think you stumble about at random but you know better.  Each movement is calculated to make evading harm easier.\n"
"\n"
"Dodging Skill increased by 15% of Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Advanced Zui Quan"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Advanced Zui Quan' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You have a greater understanding of Zui Quan.  Your skills at dodging and landing attacks are much better as a result.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, Accuracy increased by 15% of Intelligence."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Drunken Stumble"
msgstr "Sarhoş Düşme"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Drunken Stumble' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"With a few quick steps, you can completely change your orientation and dodge additional attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Dodge attempts.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Drunken Dodging"
msgstr "Sarhoş Kaçış"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Drunken Dodging' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Each time you dodge, your positional advantage increases against your opponents.  This makes your attacks hit harder with each successful dodge.\n"
"\n"
"Gain Armor Penetration equal to 25% of Intelligence.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Debug Mastery"
msgstr "Hata Ayıklama Ustalığı"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "A secret martial art used only by developers and cheaters."
msgstr ""
"Sadece geliştiriciler ve hileciler tarafından kullanılan gizli bir dövüş "
"sanatı."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You get ready pwn some zeds!"
msgstr "Zed'leri ezmek için hazırlanıyorsun!"

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares to cheat at martial arts!"
msgstr "%s dövüş sanatlarında hile yapmaya hazırlanıyor!"

#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Elemental resistance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Elemental resistance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"+Strength physical armor, +Dexterity acid armor, +Intelligence electricity "
"armor, +Perception fire armor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Bionic Combatives"
msgstr "Biyonik Dövüş Sanatları"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic Combatives'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Nicknamed \"Biojutsu\", "
"Bionic Combatives combines integrated weaponry, armor and augments into an "
"consolidated fighting discipline."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic Combatives'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "BEGINNING BIONIC COMBATIVES PROGRAM. INITIATING COMBAT PROTOCOLS."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic Combatives'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s starts moving with swift robotic precision."
msgstr "%s hızlı robotik bir hassasiyetle hareket etmeye başlıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Biojutsu Stance"
msgstr "Biojutsu Duruşu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Biojutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic
#. Combatives'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"void player::ApplyBiojutsuStatic() {\n"
"    blocks_left += 2;\n"
"    set_hit_bonus( get_hit_bonus() + 1 );\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"+2 Blocks attempts, +1 Accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Centipede Kung Fu"
msgstr "Sünger Böceği Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Zhang Yiaotian.  Centipede Style uses"
" an onslaught of rapid strikes.  Each attack you land increases your attack "
"speed.  Critical hits increase your damage further."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You ready yourself to attack as fast as possible."
msgstr "Mümkün olan en hızlı şekilde saldırıya hazırlanıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a centipede-like stance."
msgstr "%s bir kırkayak gibi bir duruş alıyor."

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Centipede's Frenzy"
msgstr "Yüzen Kırkayak'ın Çılgınlığı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Centipede's Frenzy' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Your attacks are a blur of hands and legs that become faster as your strike your opponents without rest.\n"
"\n"
"-4 move cost.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kertenkele Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Meng Tianxia.  Lizard Style focuses "
"on using walls to your advantage.  Standing near a wall provides a large "
"bonus to Dodge skill and moving near a wall gives a large bonus to accuracy."
"  Stronger techniques are enabled when near a wall."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You ready yourself to attack from any angle."
msgstr "Her açıdan saldırmaya hazır oluyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a lizard-like stance."
msgstr "%s bir kertenkele benzeri duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Venom"
msgstr "Kertenkele'nin Zehiri"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lizard's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Your venom is a long lasting pain that your opponents will never forget.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Cunning"
msgstr "Kertenkele'nin Kurnazlığı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lizard's Cunning' for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"By briefly scaling, leaping, or pushing off a nearby wall, you can avoid the worst of your opponents attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+3.0 Dodge skill when near a wall.\n"
"Enables \"Lizard Tail\" and \"Lizard Wall Counter\" techniques when near a wall."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Leap"
msgstr "Kertenkele'nin Atlama Yeri"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lizard's Leap' for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"By briefly scaling, leaping, or pushing off a nearby wall, can attack downward at unsuspecting opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+3 Accuracy when near a wall.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Scorpion Kung Fu"
msgstr "Akrep Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Gao Ji.  Scorpion Style is a "
"mysterious art which uses pincer-like hands and a stinger kick.  Moving "
"enables a stunning pincer attack.  Critical hits do massive damage and knock"
" your opponent back along with anyone your opponent comes in contact with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You prepare to capture and sting your foes."
msgstr "Düşmanlarını yakalamak ve sokmak için hazırlanıyorsun."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a scorpion-like stance."
msgstr "%s bir akrep benzeri duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Scorpion's Venom"
msgstr "Akrep'in Zehiri"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Scorpion's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Your venom is a constant threat that nothing can escape from.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bashing damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Scorpion's Charge"
msgstr "Akrep'in Şarjı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Scorpion's Charge' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Rush forward and catch your prey!\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Pincer Strike\" technique.\n"
"Stacks 2 times.  Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Toad Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kurbağa Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Liang Shen.  Masters of Toad Style "
"can focus themselves to protect against all attacks.  You have powerful "
"armor against physical attacks, though you will lose focus when you move.  "
"You can meditate by pausing, giving yourself more armor for a short time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You pause for a moment and focus on your invincible body."
msgstr "Bir an duraksıyorsunuz ve yenilmez bedeninize odaklanıyorsunuz."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a toad-like stance."
msgstr "%s bir kurbağa benzeri duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Toad's Iron Skin"
msgstr "Kurbağa'nın Demir Derisi"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Toad's Iron Skin' for martial art '{'str': 'Toad
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Your body is as strong as iron but only if you don't move.\n"
"\n"
"+6 bash, cut, and stab armor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Iron Skin Dissipation"
msgstr "Demir Deri Dağılması"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Iron Skin Dissipation' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Moving causes you to lose your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"-1 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 6 turns.  Stacks 6 times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper Kung Fu"
msgstr "Viper Kung Fu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"A legacy of the Five Deadly Venoms, use by Qi Dong.  Viper Style (originally"
" called Snake Style) has a unique three-part combo, which initiates on a "
"dodge, then follows up with a stunning Viper Bite and then finishes with the"
" legendary Viper Strike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You prepare to strike your foes' weaknesses."
msgstr "Düşmanlarınızın zayıf noktalarına saldırmaya hazırlanıyorsunuz."

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a viper-like stance."
msgstr "%s bir yılan benzeri duruş alır."

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper's Patience"
msgstr "Viper'ın Sabrı"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Patience' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Every snake waits for the perfect moment to strike.  Turn your opponents' mistakes into your opportunity to strike!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper's Ambush"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Ambush' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Your evasiveness has left your opponent wide open to painful bite.\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"Viper Bite\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper's Venom"
msgstr "Viper'ın Zehiri"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Your venom is a harsh reminder to never tease a predator.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turn."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/mods/MMA/mutations.json
msgid "Venom Mob Protege"
msgstr "Venom Mob Protege"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Venom Mob Protege'}
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/mods/MMA/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a pupil of the Venom Clan.  You start with one of the five deadly "
"venoms: Centipede, Viper, Scorpion, Lizard, or Toad."
msgstr ""
"Venom Klanı'nın bir öğrencisisin. Beş ölümcül zehirden biriyle başlıyorsun: "
"Kırkayak, Yılan, Akrep, Kertenkele veya Kurbağa."

