#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'marloss wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Goopy white wine, made from the fruit of the marloss."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Riesling"
msgid_plural "Riesling"
msgstr[0] "Riesling"
msgstr[1] "Riesling'ler"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Riesling'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Sparkling white wine, made from the world's noblest grape."
msgstr "Dünyanın en soylu üzümünden yapılmış, köpüklü beyaz şarap."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Chardonnay"
msgid_plural "Chardonnay"
msgstr[0] "Chardonnay"
msgstr[1] "Chardonnay'lar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Chardonnay'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "America's most popular wine, and for good reason."
msgstr "Amerika'nın en popüler şarabı ve bunun iyi bir nedeni var."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Cabernet Sauvignon"
msgid_plural "Cabernet Sauvignon"
msgstr[0] "Cabernet Sauvignon"
msgstr[1] "Cabernet Sauvignonlar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Cabernet Sauvignon'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"The heavily disputed king of red wines.  Pairs well with red meats and "
"pasta."
msgstr ""
"Kırmızı şarapların yoğun bir şekilde tartışılan kralı. Kırmızı etler ve "
"makarna ile iyi gider."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "pinot noir"
msgid_plural "pinot noir"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pinot noir'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Prized by collectors and adored by critics, it is one of the rarer and more "
"elegant wines."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "marsala"
msgid_plural "marsala"
msgstr[0] "marsala"
msgstr[1] "marsalalar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'marsala'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A wine popularly used in dishes served in Italian restaurants."
msgstr ""
"İtalyan restoranlarında servis edilen yemeklerde yaygın olarak kullanılan "
"bir şarap."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vermouth"
msgid_plural "vermouth"
msgstr[0] "vermut"
msgstr[1] "vermutlar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'vermouth'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A soft wine with a pleasant herbal flavor and aroma.  It is a common "
"cocktail ingredient, and can be used as a substitute for white wine."
msgstr ""
"Hoş bir bitkisel lezzet ve aromaya sahip yumuşak bir şarap.  Yaygın bir "
"kokteyl malzemesidir ve beyaz şarap yerine kullanılabilir."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "barley wine"
msgid_plural "barley wine"
msgstr[0] "arpa şarabı"
msgstr[1] "arpa şarapları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'barley wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A strong ale."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "whiskey"
msgid_plural "whiskey"
msgstr[0] "viski"
msgstr[1] "viskiler"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'whiskey'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A distilled grain alcohol, made from, by, and for real Southern colonels!"
msgstr ""
"Gerçek Güney kolonelleri tarafından yapılan, için ve adına damıtılmış bir "
"tahıl alkolü!"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "vodka"
msgid_plural "vodka"
msgstr[0] "vodka"
msgstr[1] "vodkalar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'vodka'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A beverage of alcohol, water, and not much else.  In America, men make "
"vodka, but in Soviet Russia, vodka makes the man."
msgstr ""
"Alkol, su ve pek bir şeyden oluşmayan bir içecek.  Amerika'da erkekler vodka"
" yapar, ama Sovyet Rusya'da vodka erkeği yapar."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "gin"
msgid_plural "gin"
msgstr[0] "cin"
msgstr[1] "cinler"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gin'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"An alcoholic beverage flavored with juniper berries.  It smells faintly of "
"berries, but mostly booze."
msgstr ""
"Ardıç meyveleri ile tatlandırılmış alkollü bir içecek.  Hafifçe meyve kokar,"
" ama çoğunlukla alkol kokar."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "rum"
msgid_plural "rum"
msgstr[0] "Rom"
msgstr[1] "Rom'lar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rum'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A distilled alcoholic beverage made from fermenting molasses.  Drinking it "
"might make you feel like a pirate.  Or not."
msgstr ""
"Fermente edilmiş melas ile yapılan damıtılmış bir alkollü içecek. Onu içmek "
"seni bir korsan gibi hissettirebilir. Ya da hissettirmeyebilir."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "tequila"
msgid_plural "tequila"
msgstr[0] "tekila"
msgstr[1] "tekilalar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tequila'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A distilled alcoholic beverage made from a succulent plant with spiky "
"leaves.  Don't eat the worm!  Wait, there's no worm in this bottle."
msgstr ""
"Dikenli yapraklara sahip bir etli bitkiden yapılan damıtılmış bir alkollü "
"içecek. Solucanı yeme! Bekle, bu şişede solucan yok."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "triple sec"
msgid_plural "triple sec"
msgstr[0] "tekli triple sec"
msgstr[1] "çoklu triple sec"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'triple sec'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "An orange flavored liquor used in many mixed drinks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "cheap wine"
msgid_plural "cheap wine"
msgstr[0] "ucuz şarap"
msgstr[1] "ucuz şaraplar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cheap wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Really cheap fortified wine."
msgstr "Gerçekten ucuz güçlendirilmiş şarap."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "strong mixed alcohol"
msgid_plural "strong mixed alcohol"
msgstr[0] "güçlü karışık alkol"
msgstr[1] "güçlü karışık alkoller"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'strong mixed alcohol'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Strong alcoholic drinks, mixed with no regard for taste."
msgstr "Güçlü alkollü içecekler, tat dikkate alınmadan karıştırılmıştır."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "weak mixed alcohol"
msgid_plural "weak mixed alcohol"
msgstr[0] "zayıf karışık alkol"
msgstr[1] "zayıf karışık alkoller"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'weak mixed alcohol'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Weak alcoholic drinks, mixed with no regard for taste."
msgstr "Zayıf alkollü içecekler, tat dikkate alınmadan karıştırılmıştır."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "fruit wine"
msgid_plural "fruit wine"
msgstr[0] "meyve şarabı"
msgstr[1] "meyve şarapları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fruit wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Cheap booze made from fermented fruit juice.  Tastes just like it sounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "brandy"
msgid_plural "brandy"
msgstr[0] "brendi"
msgstr[1] "brendiler"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'brandy'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Wine that has been distilled to a higher proof.  Great as an after-dinner "
"drink, but packs a punch."
msgstr ""
"Daha yüksek alkol oranına damıtılmış şarap.  Yemekten sonra içmek için "
"harika, ama etkisi güçlü."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Irish coffee"
msgid_plural "Irish coffee"
msgstr[0] "İrlanda kahvesi"
msgstr[1] "İrlanda kahveleri"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Irish coffee'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Sweetened coffee and whiskey topped with milk.  Start your day the closeted "
"alcoholic way!"
msgstr ""
"Sütle süslenmiş tatlandırılmış kahve ve viski.  Güne kapalı alkolik tarzında"
" başlayın!"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "atomic Irish coffee"
msgid_plural "atomic Irish coffee"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'atomic Irish coffee'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Sweetened atomic coffee and whiskey topped with milk.  This coffee cocktail "
"has been created using an atomic coffee pot's FULL NUCLEAR brewing cycle.  "
"Start your day the neo-alcoholic way!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Long Island iced tea"
msgid_plural "Long Island iced tea"
msgstr[0] "Uzun Adalı buzlu çay"
msgstr[1] "Uzun Adalı buzlu çaylar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Long Island iced tea'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A blend of incredibly strong-flavored liquors that somehow tastes like none "
"of them.  It contains no tea, but the inclusion of cola gives it a tea-like "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Son derece güçlü aromalara sahip içkilerin bir karışımı, bir şekilde hiçbiri"
" gibi tatmıyor. İçinde çay yoktur, ancak kola eklenmesi ona çay benzeri bir "
"renk verir."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "screwdriver cocktail"
msgid_plural "screwdriver cocktails"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for screwdriver cocktail
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mix of orange juice and vodka.  It's the surreptitious drunkard mechanic's"
" drink of choice."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "wild apple"
msgid_plural "wild apple"
msgstr[0] "yaban elması"
msgstr[1] "yaban elmaları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'wild apple'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Like apple cider, only with vodka."
msgstr "Elma şarabı gibi, sadece votka ile."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "rum & cola"
msgid_plural "rum & cola"
msgstr[0] "rum & kola"
msgstr[1] "rum & kolalar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rum & cola'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Suitable for tropical retreats and Canadian artists alike."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "beer"
msgid_plural "beer"
msgstr[0] "bira"
msgstr[1] "biralar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'beer'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A grain alcohol flavored with hops.  It's best served cold, in a glass, and "
"with a lime - but you're not that lucky."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "spiced mead"
msgid_plural "spiced mead"
msgstr[0] "baharatlı bal şarabı"
msgstr[1] "baharatlı bal şarapları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'spiced mead'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Well-aged honey wine, spiced with a hint of hops.  Goes down bittersweet."
msgstr ""
"İyi yaşlandırılmış, hafif hops ile baharatlandırılmış bal şarabı. Acı tatlı "
"bir şekilde geçiyor."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "dandelion wine"
msgid_plural "dandelion wine"
msgstr[0] "karahindiba şarabı"
msgstr[1] "karahindiba şarapları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dandelion wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A light and delicious wine made from dandelion flowers.  Slightly "
"effervescent, it is smooth and crisp."
msgstr ""
"Karahindiba çiçeklerinden yapılan hafif ve lezzetli bir şarap. Hafif gazlı, "
"pürüzsüz ve gevrek."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "burdock wine"
msgid_plural "burdock wine"
msgstr[0] "diken otu şarabı"
msgstr[1] "diken otu şarapları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'burdock wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A light and delicious wine made from burdock roots.  Somewhat sweet."
msgstr "Diken köklerinden yapılan hafif ve lezzetli bir şarap. Biraz tatlı."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "pine wine"
msgid_plural "pine wine"
msgstr[0] "çam şarabı"
msgstr[1] "çam şarapları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pine wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A potent wine flavored with pine resin.  Bold and pungent, its biting taste "
"and strong aroma takes some getting used to."
msgstr ""
"Çam reçinesi ile tatlandırılmış güçlü bir şarap. Yoğun ve sert, keskin tadı "
"ve güçlü aromasına alışmak biraz zaman alıyor."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "homebrew beer"
msgid_plural "homebrew beer"
msgstr[0] "ev yapımı bira"
msgstr[1] "ev yapımı biralar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'homebrew beer'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Not the finest drink you've had, but hey, it's alcohol by the gallon."
msgstr ""
"Şimdiye kadar içtiğin en iyi içecek değil, ama hey, galonla alkol işte."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "moonshine"
msgid_plural "moonshine"
msgstr[0] "ayı ışığı"
msgstr[1] "ayı ışıkları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'moonshine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Only the strongest, purest, good ol' fashioned hooch, distilled from corn "
"and sugar.  Guaranteed to make you forget about the whole Cataclysm thing, "
"or you get your vision back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "European pilsner"
msgid_plural "European pilsner"
msgstr[0] "Avrupa pilsneri"
msgstr[1] "Avrupa pilsnerleri"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'European pilsner'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A lager beer imported from Europe.  Best served cold, in a glass - but "
"you're not that lucky."
msgstr ""
"Avrupa'dan ithal edilen bir lager birası. Soğuk servis edilmesi en iyisidir,"
" bir bardakta - ama bu kadar şanslı değilsin."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "American pale ale"
msgid_plural "American pale ale"
msgstr[0] "Amerikan açık ale"
msgstr[1] "Amerikan açık aleler"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'American pale ale'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A tasty craft beer.  Best served cold, in a glass - but you're not that "
"lucky."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "India pale ale"
msgid_plural "India pale ale"
msgstr[0] "Hindistan soluk alesı"
msgstr[1] "Hindistan soluk alesları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'India pale ale'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A very flavorful microbrewed beer.  Best served cold, in a glass - but "
"you're not that lucky."
msgstr ""
"Çok lezzetli bir mikrobrewed birası. Soğuk servis edilmesi en iyisidir, bir "
"bardakta - ama bu kadar şanslı değilsin."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "stout"
msgid_plural "stout"
msgstr[0] "stout"
msgstr[1] "stoutlar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'stout'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A tasty craft beer, as dark in color as the days ahead."
msgstr "Lezzetli bir el yapımı birası, önümüzdeki günler kadar koyu renkte."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Belgian ale"
msgid_plural "Belgian ale"
msgstr[0] "Belçika birası"
msgstr[1] "Belçika biraları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Belgian ale'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A flavorful and filling beer brewed by monks in Belgium.  Best served in a "
"goblet."
msgstr ""
"Belçika'daki rahipler tarafından üretilen lezzetli ve doyurucu bir bira. En "
"iyi bir kadehte servis edilir."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "imperial stout"
msgid_plural "imperial stout"
msgstr[0] "imparatorluk stout'u"
msgstr[1] "imparatorluk stout'ları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'imperial stout'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A very flavorful beer that has been aged in bourbon barrels.  It is as black"
" as midnight on a moonless night and has the viscosity of oil.  While very "
"tasty, it also has an alcohol content on the level with wine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "strawberry surprise"
msgid_plural "strawberry surprises"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for strawberry surprise
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Strawberries left to ferment with a few other choice ingredients offer up a "
"surprisingly palatable mixture; you barely even have to force yourself to "
"drink it after the first few gulps."
msgstr ""
"Çilekler, birkaç seçkin malzeme ile fermente edildiğinde, şaşırtıcı derecede"
" lezzetli bir karışım sunar; ilk birkaç yudumdan sonra içmek için kendinizi "
"zorlamanız bile gerekmiyor."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "boozeberry"
msgid_plural "boozeberries"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boozeberry', 'str_pl': 'boozeberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"This fermented blueberry mixture is surprisingly hearty, though the soup-"
"like consistency is slightly unsettling no matter how much you drink."
