msgid "You take the %s."
msgstr "%s alıyorsun."

#. ~ Description for multivitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in pill form.  An option "
"of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause "
"hypervitaminosis."
msgstr ""
"Dengeli bir diyetin mümkün olmadığı durumlarda son çare olarak kullanılan, "
"hap formunda pratik bir şekilde paketlenmiş temel besin maddeleri. Aşırı "
"kullanım hipervitaminozise neden olabilir."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "calcium tablet"
msgid_plural "calcium tablets"
msgstr[0] "kalsiyum tableti"
msgstr[1] "kalsiyum tabletleri"

#. ~ Description for calcium tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"White calcium tablets.  Widely used by elderly people with osteoporosis as a"
" method to supplement calcium before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "kemik unu tableti"
msgstr[1] "kemik unu tabletleri"

#. ~ Description for bone meal tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Tastes horrible and is "
"hard to swallow but it does its job."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "flavored bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "flavored bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "aromatize edilmiş kemik unu tableti"
msgstr[1] "aromatize edilmiş kemik unu tabletleri"

#. ~ Description for flavored bone meal tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Due to some sweetness "
"mixed in to counteract the powdery texture and the taste of ash, it's almost"
" as palatable as the pre-Cataclysm tablets."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "gummy vitamin"
msgid_plural "gummy vitamins"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for gummy vitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in a fruit-flavored chewy "
"candy form.  An option of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible."
"  Excess use can cause hypervitaminosis."
msgstr ""
"Temel besin maddeleri, meyve aromalı çiğnenebilir şeker formunda pratik bir "
"şekilde paketlenmiştir. Dengeli bir diyetin mümkün olmadığı durumlarda son "
"çare seçeneği. Aşırı kullanım hipervitaminoza neden olabilir."

