"Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any "
"trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/apartment_survivor/TALK_NPC_apartment_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
