#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What's your story?"
msgstr "Senin hikayen nedir?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "How are things here?"
msgstr "Burada işler nasıl?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Shouldn't I be the one to ask that question?  I am Simon, I work here as a "
"cook.  Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I am an unfortunate who really needs something to eat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I am just a fellow survivor."
msgstr "Ben sadece bir hayatta kalanım."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"This is New England Church Community.  A self-sufficient group formed by "
"churchgoers.  We try to help fellow survivors as much as we can.  Enjoy your"
" stay here!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Can you give me something to eat then?"
msgstr "O zaman bana yiyecek bir şey verebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What can I buy here?"
msgstr "Burada ne satın alabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, it has been a very long time since we offered free meals.  You should"
" try joining our community if you want rations.  I wish you luck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I can pay."
msgstr "Ödeme yapabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Please, I need the food for my family."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "How do I join the community?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"You can't buy edibles here.  We currently have a shortage of them, and we "
"can't afford to give away any more.  Your money is worthless anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "It was worth a try."
msgstr "Denemeye değerdi."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Why is my money worthless?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Look, I have a family too.  I know how hard it is for you, but I've already "
"told you, rules are rules."
msgstr ""
"Bak, benim de bir ailem var. Senin için ne kadar zor olduğunu biliyorum ama "
"sana daha önce söyledim, kurallar kurallardır."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "At least I tried."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"You have to ask our leader, Helena, first.  She's the one who makes those "
"decisions.  But as I said, your chances are low, like everyone else's.  The "
"newest member joined just a long time ago."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"You have to ask our leader, Helena, first.  She's the one who makes those "
"decisions.  But as I said, your chances are low, like everyone else's.  If "
"you had found our community earlier, you could have had a higher chance to "
"join.  The newest member joined just a few days ago."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"From me?  Nothing.  But we have a tailor, herbalist and a hunter.  Go see "
"their products yourself, maybe you find something you need.  Keep in mind "
"that we don't use regular dollars here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I'll take a look."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "What do you use as money?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"You know, I used to work as a cook in a homeless shelter.  Coincidentally, "
"that's how I met the community.  They used to go there many times to help "
"the residents and preach from the Bible.  I am sure this is why my family "
"and I could join.  Also, working in the shelter taught me to cook on a very "
"low budget.  It's an even more useful skill today."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Could be better, could be worse.  But I'm not complaining.  I have "
"everything I need here: my family, a nice job and roof over my head.  I wish"
" God was as forgiving to others as to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "It's good to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"We use religious icons as our currency.  These were made before "
"<the_cataclysm>, and the name of our community is written on the back.  It's"
" a lot more handy than old-world dollars, those are basicly just "
"firestarters here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Picky Meals"
msgstr "Seçici Yemekler"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Picky Meals'}'
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Find 100 salt."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I need a supply of salt."
msgstr "Tuz ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"I know this doesn't sound important, but I am running low on salt.  We don't"
" just need it as a seasoning, it's also vital for food preservation.  Could "
"you find about 20 pounds of salt for me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't forget to tell me when you have them."
msgstr "Onları bulduğunda bana haber vermeyi unutma."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's okay, I can do without them.  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr "Sorun değil, onsuz da idare edebilirim. Yeniden düşünürsen haber ver."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  They are common in house kitchens, "
"restaurants or grocery stores."
msgstr ""
"Bakılacak çok yer var. Ev mutfaklarında, restoranlarda veya bakkallarda "
"yaygındır."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "How is the search going?  Have you found 'em?"
msgstr "Arama nasıl gidiyor? Onları bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I really apreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't worry about it, it's not that important."
msgstr "Bunun için endişelenme, o kadar da önemli değil."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Pickled Meals"
msgstr "Turşulu Yemekler"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Pickled Meals'}'
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Find 5 glass jars."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I need several glass jars."
msgstr "Birkaç cam kavanoza ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"This task is bit more serious.  I don't have enough jars to preserve "
"perishables for the future, and we can't just store everything in salt.  We "
"could do our own canning if we had some more glass jars.  I could get by "
"with 5 for now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  It'll take a load off my shoulders.  I "
"finally won't have to worry about this problem anymore."
msgstr ""
"Bu görevi kabul ettiğin için teşekkürler. Bu benim üzerimden bir yük alacak."
" Artık bu sorun hakkında endişelenmeme gerek kalmayacak."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "Fikrini değiştirirsen bana haber ver."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Glass jars are not that hard to find.  I'd look for them in residental "
"areas."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Have you found the jars?"
msgstr "Kavanozları buldun mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr ""
"Yardımın için teşekkür ederim. İşte ödülün. Yapmam gereken bir görev daha "
"var."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's not a big deal, it isn't that urgent."
msgstr "Bu büyük bir mesele değil, o kadar acil değil."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Prickled Meals"
msgstr "Turşulu Yemekler"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Prickled Meals'}'
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Find a butcher knife."
msgstr "Bir kasap bıçağı bul."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I need something sharper."
msgstr "Daha keskin bir şeye ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any butcher knives in here.  It's difficult to cut anything "
"hard without it.  It's good to have one, even though I won't use it that "
"often.  Could you get me one?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I can't cut anything with this dull knife."
msgstr ""
"Kabul ettiğin için teşekkür ederim. Bu kör bıçakla hiçbir şey kesemem."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I guess I have to cut them with my steak knife."
msgstr "Sanırım onları et bıçağımla kesmem gerekecek."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Butcher knives are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in "
"kitchens."
msgstr ""
"Kasap bıçakları bulması o kadar da nadir değil. Genellikle mutfaklarda "
"bulunurlar."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Do you have that knife now?"
msgstr "O bıçak şimdi sende mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I am grateful for the help you've done."
msgstr "Yardımın için minnettarım."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "food guard"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I'm guarding the food."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "You're back."
msgstr "Geri döndün."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "So…?"
msgstr "Yani...?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Hey!  What are you doing up here?  You are not allowed to come here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "How much food do you have in storage?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Can I borrow something from the stash?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I am sorry, I didn't know.  I'll be going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I have to go now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Me?  I am the food guard.  I've been tasked to watch over this storage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Can I borrow something from the stockpile?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Has anyone stolen from here?"
msgstr "Buradan kimse bir şey çaldı mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I am afraid you can't.  Look, we are running low on our rations, and we "
"don't want to waste even more.  Even if you just want to 'borrow' it.  Too "
"bad, we could've helped you if you had come here earlier."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I am sorry, but nobody is allowed to take anything from here.  We would like"
" to help you, but we already have enough mouths to feed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I have money."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Please, my family is starving."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "How much food do you have here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright, but just this once.  Don't tell anyone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I promise I won't tell anybody."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Are you trying to bribe me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I'd better leave."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I am sorry, but I can't help you or your family.  This is not my food, you "
"need to ask permission from someone else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I think I'll be going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"I don't know anymore.  You see, we used to have 20 crates full of non-"
"perishables.  That was months ago.  We are running out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"That information is a bit private, but you can see for yourself.  We have "
"about 20 crates full of non-perishables."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Where did all this food come from?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Well, most things you see here were brought by the original members.  You "
"know, they knew <the_cataclysm> was coming and bought everything they could."
"  They were prepared and thanks to them, so are we."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I'd like to talk about something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"You sure like asking personal questions, eh?  My story is nothing special, "
"really.  The important thing now is that I am alive and well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "How did you become a food guard?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I don't have a great appetite."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Reasonable."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Eh, being a food guard is not mentally stimulating.  It gets a bit lonely up"
" here, you know, staying here almost 24/7.  This job makes almost anyone "
"bored.  That's why I have books with me, they keep me busy for a while."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "What are you reading nowadays?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter, I can read anything.  But mystery books were almost my "
"favorite.  I wish I had more of them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I can get you some mystery novels."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Not that I know of.  I haven't seen any suspicious drops in our food supply."
"  I guess I'm doing a great at my job… or nobody is rotten enough to steal "
"from our community."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "That's good to hear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Busy While Work"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Busy While Work'}'
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Find 3 mystery novels."
msgstr "3 gizem romanı bul."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I'd like to read some mystery novels."
msgstr "Biraz gizem romanı okumak istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Hmm, that would be great!  But if you do, please bring more than just one.  "
"I could read a single novel in a day.  Could you get me… 3 mystery novels?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Just bring it to me when you have it."
msgstr "Elinde olduğunda sadece bana getir."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Nevermind then.  I hope you'll change your mind."
msgstr "O zaman önemli değil. Umarım fikrini değiştirirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I'd loot libraries and bookstores."
msgstr "Kütüphaneleri ve kitapçıları yağmalardım."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "So, have you found the books?"
msgstr "Peki, kitapları buldun mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  This will keep me busy for a while.  Please take this as a token"
" of my gratitude."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim. Bu beni bir süre meşgul edecek. Lütfen bunu "
"minnettarlığımın bir sembolü olarak al."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Could you give them to me?"
msgstr "Onları bana verebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Fine.  I can read something else."
msgstr "Tamam. Başka bir şey okuyabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Warrener"
msgstr "Tüccar"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Mr Lapin"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I raise rabbits."
msgstr "Tavşan yetiştiriyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Are you here to protect us?"
msgstr "Bizi korumak için mi buradasın?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Pleased to meet you."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I'm just trying to get by."
msgstr "Sadece geçinmeye çalışıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Heard anything about the outside world?"
msgstr "Dış dünya hakkında bir şeyler duydun mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "You look different?"
msgstr "Farklı görünüyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Anything I can help with?"
msgstr "Yardım edebileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Getting by will do for now."
msgstr "Şimdilik idare etmek yeter."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I guess it has to."
msgstr "Sanırım öyle olması gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I raise my rabbits, I seem to have more in common with them every day."
msgstr ""
"Tavşanlarımı besliyorum, her gün onlarla daha fazla ortak noktam olduğunu "
"düşünüyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Well, then…"
msgstr "O zaman…"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"People come to me to learn how to keep rabbits.  They learn and they go.  I "
"like to think I'm making the world better."
msgstr ""
"İnsanlar bana tavşan bakmayı öğrenmek için geliyor. Öğreniyorlar ve "
"gidiyorlar. Dünyayı daha iyi hale getirdiğimi düşünmek hoşuma gidiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "That sounds optimistic?"
msgstr "Bu oldukça iyimser geliyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"If I teach one hundred people how to raise rabbits, that's potentially a "
"hundred communities given food and fur before those people teach anyone "
"else."
msgstr ""
"Eğer yüz kişiye tavşan yetiştirmeyi öğretirsem, bu potansiyel olarak o "
"insanların başka kimseye öğretmeden önce onlara yiyecek ve kürk sağlayan yüz"
" topluluk demektir."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "That's the most hopeful thing I've heard so far."
msgstr "Şu ana kadar duyduğum en umut verici şey bu."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Same way you got yours, I bet."
msgstr "Senin aldığın gibi, bahse girerim."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "CRISPR?  Radiation?  Something in the water?  Maybe it was bunnies."
msgstr "CRISPR? Radyasyon? Suda bir şey mi? Belki de tavşanlardı."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "So it goes."
msgstr "Böyle geçiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "You're disgusting."
msgstr "İğrençsin."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I'm very sorry to tell you this, but you should look in a mirror."
msgstr "Bunu söylemekten çok üzgünüm ama bir aynaya bakmalısın."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Insulting people who could help you is unlikely to aid survival."
msgstr ""
"Size yardım edebilecek insanlara hakaret etmek hayatta kalmanıza yardımcı "
"olmayacaktır."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Timber!"
msgstr "Ağaç!"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Timber!'}'
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Bring five logs."
msgstr "Beş ağaç kütüğü getir."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I need 5 logs for fences."
msgstr "Çitler için 5 ağaç kütüğüne ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"I need to build fences and ditches around my rabbits.  Could you find about…"
" five logs for me?"
msgstr ""
"Tavşanlarımın etrafında çitler ve hendekler inşa etmem gerekiyor.  Benim "
"için yaklaşık... beş ağaç kütüğü bulabilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "There's a lot of places to look.  Trees are pretty common."
msgstr "Bakılacak çok yer var.  Ağaçlar oldukça yaygın."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How is the search going?  Have you found'em?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"I really appreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr "Yardımın için gerçekten minnettarım. Merak etme, boş dönmeyeceksin."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Sweets"
msgstr "Şekerlemeler"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Sweets'}'
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Find 25 blackberries."
msgstr "25 böğürtlen bul."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "I need 25 blackberries."
msgstr "25 böğürtlen ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Fruits would let me break the monotony of grains and meats."
msgstr "Meyveler, tahıllar ve etlerin monotonluğunu kırmamı sağlar."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  Otherwise I might kill a stranger for some "
"oranges.  Just kidding."
msgstr ""
"Bu görevi kabul ettiğin için teşekkürler. Aksi takdirde, bazı portakallar "
"için bir yabancıyı öldürebilirim. Şaka yapıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Find someone growing berries or an orchard."
msgstr "Böğürtlen yetiştiren birini veya bir meyve bahçesi bul."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
msgid "Have you found the fruit?"
msgstr "Meyveyi buldun mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "Yardımın için teşekkür ederim. İşte ödülün."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "Hello there.  Nice to see you again."
msgstr "Merhaba. Seni tekrar görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Who are you?  Would you like to trade?"
msgstr "Sen kimsin? Takas yapmak ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nice to meet you."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "Pleasure to see you again."
msgstr "Sizi tekrar görmek bir zevk."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "See ya."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Where might your friends be?"
msgstr "Arkadaşların nerede olabilir?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Can I stay here?"
msgstr "Burada kalabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "Can I purchase some of your wares?"
msgstr "Bazı eşyalarınızı satın alabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "How's that smoker coming along?"
msgstr "O tütsüleyici nasıl gidiyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out "
"on the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on "
"what we can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you "
"might find yourself a good deal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Making ends meet, even in the worst circumstances.  We've been camping out "
"here now, trading with whoever passes by.  If something catches your eye, "
"let me know."
msgstr ""
"En kötü koşullarda bile geçinmeye çalışıyoruz. Şimdi burada kamp yapıyoruz, "
"geçenlerle takas yapıyoruz. Eğer dikkatinizi çeken bir şey olursa, bana "
"haber verin."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"We got tired of being out on the road and decided to stay here for a bit.  "
"We've found a lot of useful stuff out and about, so if you see anything you "
"need I'll make you a deal."
msgstr ""
"Yolda olmaktan yorulduk ve burada bir süre kalmaya karar verdik. Dışarıda "
"birçok faydalı şey bulduk, bu yüzden ihtiyacınız olan bir şey görürseniz "
"size bir teklif yaparım."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "Hm."
msgstr "Hm."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"They should be around here somewhere.  We usually go out in teams to "
"scavenge, and they haven't told me about anything yet.  They might have "
"something for you to do."
msgstr ""
"Buralarda bir yerlerde olmalılar. Genellikle ekipler halinde avlanmaya "
"çıkıyoruz ve henüz bana bir şey söylemediler. Sizin için yapacakları bir "
"şeyleri olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Well, I don't see anything wrong with it.  We should have a spare bed in "
"that tent you could sleep on.  Just don't cause any trouble."
msgstr ""
"Bunda yanlış bir şey göremiyorum. Üzerinde yatabileceğin o çadırda yedek bir"
" yatak olmalı. Sadece sorun çıkarma."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"Sure!  It turned out well enough for us, and it's one of the few fresh meats"
" we can find.  I'll pay fairly for it."
msgstr ""
"Tabii! Bizim için yeterince iyi sonuçlandı ve bulabileceğimiz birkaç taze "
"etten biri. Bunun için adil bir fiyat ödeyeceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing."
msgstr "Hiçbir şeyim yok."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have nothing.  I'd best get going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid ""
"It's wonderful!  We've been preserving a lot more of what we manage to "
"scavenge so we won't have to worry about our food going bad for a while.  "
"We'd be willing to sell some of the excess, if you want."
msgstr ""
"Harika! Bulduğumuz şeylerin çok daha fazlasını koruyoruz, böylece "
"yiyeceklerimizin bozulması konusunda bir süre endişelenmemize gerek "
"kalmayacak. İsterseniz fazlasını satmaya razıyız."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I think I'll buy 10 slices.  [$20]"
msgstr "10 dilim almayı düşünüyorum.  [$20]"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "You think 20 slices would be alright?  [$40]"
msgstr "20 dilim iyi olur mu sence?  [$40]"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I'll take 50 slices of the stuff.  [$100]"
msgstr "O şeyden 50 dilim alacağım.  [$100]"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr "Bunu aklımda tutacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Who are you, and what are you doing here?"
msgstr "Sen kimsin ve burada ne yapıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Nice to meet you.  I mean no harm."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum. Zararım yok."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "What's with that guy in the tent?"
msgstr "Çadırdaki o adamla ne oluyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Want to trade?"
msgstr "Ticaret yapmak ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Oh, they're right over there, and one of us is in that tent over there.  "
"They handle any stuff we manage to scavenge, so feel free to trade for what "
"you want."
msgstr ""
"Ah, tam oradalar ve bizden biri o çadırda.  Bulduğumuz her şeyi onlar "
"hallediyor, bu yüzden istediğinle ticaret yapmaktan çekinme."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for the offer, but I don't have anything to spare right now.  One of "
"my buddies over in that tent handles stuff like this, though.  You might "
"find something."
msgstr ""
"Teklif için teşekkürler, ama şu anda verecek bir şeyim yok.  O çadırdaki "
"arkadaşlarımdan biri böyle şeylerle ilgileniyor.  Belki bir şey "
"bulabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid ""
"Well, they were the brightest of us when all hell broke loose.  They managed"
" to get us some food and weapons early on.  I guess that just kinda made "
"them the leader."
msgstr ""
"Bütün cehennem koptuğunda en zeki olanlarımız onlardı.  Başlangıçta bize "
"biraz yiyecek ve silah sağlamayı başardılar.  Sanırım bu onları lider yaptı."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"I was homeless before everything went down, just camping out here for a "
"while.  Stuck up <name_b>s shunned me for my condition, but they're all dead"
" now.  I guess I'm better off than they are."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the "
"fan, but I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"Nothing to it.  Before <the_cataclysm>, it didn't take much to find yourself"
" here.  And I guess it just made sense to stay.  We seem to be doing better "
"than most, anyway."
msgstr ""
"Hiçbir şey yok. <the_cataclysm>'dan önce, burada kendini bulmak için fazla "
"bir şey yapmana gerek yoktu. Ve sanırım burada kalmak mantıklıydı. Her "
"neyse, çoğundan daha iyi durumdayız gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid "Surviving, as I always have.  Is that what you mean?"
msgstr "Hayatta kalmak, her zaman yaptığım gibi. Bunu mu demek istiyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
msgid ""
"It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just"
" leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't "
"you?  It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Sticky Situation"
msgstr "Zor Bir Durum"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Sticky Situation'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Kill some slimes in exchange for credit with some of the traders and bring "
"back six of their slime scraps."
msgstr ""
"Bazı tüylü yaratıkları öldür ve bazı tüccarlarla kredi almak için altı tane "
"slime parçası getir."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I need some help."
msgstr "Biraz yardıma ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"We've had some trouble with slimes not far from us.  It's been hard going "
"through there with all them around, so I want you to go take care of it."
msgstr ""
"Bizim yakınlarımızda slime'larla ilgili bazı sorunlar yaşadık. Etrafta bu "
"kadar çok varken oradan geçmek zor oldu, bu yüzden senin bunu halletmeni "
"istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll be here when you get back."
msgstr "Geri döndüğünde burada olacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "No problem.  I'm sure one of us will get to it anyway."
msgstr "Sorun değil. Eminim birimiz buna ulaşacaktır."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Sure, they can be cut, but I'd say it's better to splatter them with "
"something large and heavy."
msgstr ""
"Tabii ki, kesilebilirler ama bence onları büyük ve ağır bir şeyle patlatmak "
"daha iyi olur."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Are those slimes dead yet?"
msgstr "O slime'lar öldü mü?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice.  I'll just take those off your hands.  Might be good for greasing the "
"bike chains and door hinges around here even though it is a bit… abnormal."
msgstr ""
"Güzel. Bunları senden alırım. Burada bisiklet zincirlerini ve kapı "
"menteşelerini yağlamak için iyi olabilir, biraz... anormal olsa da."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"You don't look nearly as sticky as you're supposed to.  Get back to it."
msgstr "Görünüşün olması gerektiği kadar yapışkan değil. İşe geri dön."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Did they give you the slip?  It's worse than I thought, then."
msgstr "Sana kayıplarını mı verdiler? O zaman düşündüğümden daha kötü."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Arthropod Hunting"
msgstr "Eklem Bacaklı Avı"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Arthropod Hunting'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Kill some ants and bring back ten slices of their meat in exchange for "
"credit with some of the traders."
msgstr ""
"Bazı karıncaları öldür ve bazı tüccarlarla kredi karşılığında onlardan on "
"dilim et getir."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"The last time we went out scouting we found some gargantuan ants crawling "
"around.  We thought we might see how they taste, if they could be cooked and"
" whatnot.  I want you to go kill one and bring back some of its meat."
msgstr ""
"Son keşfe çıktığımızda devasa karıncaların etrafta dolaştığını bulmuştuk. "
"Onların tadına bakmayı, pişirilip pişirilemeyeceğini görmek istedik. Birini "
"öldürüp biraz etini getirmeni istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that."
msgstr "Tamam, bunu anlayabiliyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A shotgun of some sort might work well."
msgstr "Bir tür pompalı tüfek iyi iş görebilir."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the meat?"
msgstr "Etin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice.  I'll get these cooked up.  Who knows, we might want some more in the "
"future."
msgstr ""
"Güzel. Bunları pişireceğim. Kim bilir, belki gelecekte daha fazlasına "
"ihtiyacımız olur."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "You sure?  I don't see my meat anywhere."
msgstr "Emin misin?  Etimi hiçbir yerde göremiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Ah, well.  It's no big deal."
msgstr "Ah, pekala.  Bu büyük bir mesele değil."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments"
msgstr "Yenilemeler"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 planks."
msgstr "100 tahta elde et."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"My buddies and I have decided to stay here for a while.  This is about the "
"only safe place out here, and it's kinda become our home.  Anyway, we're "
"going to build a wall.  Our old logs have provided a bunch of the wood, but "
"we still need quite a few planks.  About 100 of them.  If you could get it "
"for us, I'd be grateful."
msgstr ""
"Arkadaşlarım ve ben burada bir süre kalmaya karar verdik.  Burası dışarıda "
"güvenli olan tek yer ve biraz evimiz haline geldi.  Neyse, bir duvar inşa "
"edeceğiz.  Eski kütüklerimiz bir sürü ahşap sağladı, ama hala oldukça fazla "
"tahtaya ihtiyacımız var.  Yaklaşık 100 tane.  Eğer bizim için alabilirsen, "
"minnettar olurum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll be sure to compensate your efforts."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim.  Çabalarınızı mutlaka telafi edeceğiz."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I can understand that.  I guess I'll have to get it myself."
msgstr "Tamam, bunu anlayabiliyorum.  Sanırım kendim almak zorundayım."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Any nearby forest should have all you need.  Otherwise, you might try "
"breaking down some furniture in town."
msgstr ""
"Yakındaki herhangi bir ormanda ihtiyacınız olan her şey olmalı.  Aksi "
"takdirde, kasabadaki bazı mobilyaları kırmayı deneyebilirsiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my lumber?"
msgstr "Ahşabım var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll start right away."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim.  Hemen başlayacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I can tell you're lying.  I don't see shit."
msgstr "Yalan söylediğini anlıyorum.  Hiçbir şey göremiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. II"
msgstr "Yenilemeler Pt. II"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. II'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 150 planks."
msgstr "150 tahta temin et."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we've got the wall done, we decided to move out of these old tents."
"  We still have some leftover nails but we need more wood.  So, if you could"
" get us 150 planks, we'd be grateful."
msgstr ""
"Artık duvarı bitirdiğimize göre, bu eski çadırlardan çıkmaya karar verdik. "
"Hala biraz çivi kaldı ama daha fazla tahta ihtiyacımız var. Yani, eğer bize "
"150 tahta getirebilirsen, minnettar oluruz."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. III"
msgstr "Yenilemeler Bölüm III"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. III'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6 ropes."
msgstr "6 ip temin et."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our entrance is wide open so we're building a gate over it.  Problem is we "
"don't have any ropes.  If you could find some for us, we'll pay you."
msgstr ""
"Girişimiz tamamen açık, bu yüzden üzerine bir kapı inşa ediyoruz. Sorun şu "
"ki, hiç ipimiz yok. Eğer bizim için biraz bulabilirsen, sana ödeme yaparız."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find any rope around, one of our books should have something on"
" rope-making.  Most plants can be woven into a halfway decent rope."
msgstr ""
"Eğer etrafta hiç ip bulamazsan, kitaplarımızdan birinde ip yapımıyla ilgili "
"bir şey olmalı. Çoğu bitki, ortalama bir ip yapmak için dokunabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my ropes?"
msgstr "İplerim nerede?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. IV"
msgstr "Yenilemeler Bölüm IV"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. IV'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a wood saw."
msgstr "Bir ağaç testeresi temin et."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"We appreciate all of your help but we can't rely on everyone else to do "
"things for us.  I'd be willing to buy a wood saw of some kind from you so we"
" can cut our own wood as needed."
msgstr ""
"Yardımın için minnettarız ama herkesin bizim için bir şeyler yapmasını "
"bekleyemeyiz. İhtiyacımız olduğunda kendi tahtalarımızı kesebilmemiz için "
"senden bir tür ağaç testeresi satın almaya istekliyim."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store or lumbermill should have one"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have my saw?"
msgstr "Testereyi bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Pick what you want from our stash."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim. İstediğinizi depomuzdan seçin."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. V"
msgstr "Yenilemeler Bölüm V"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. V'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a shovel."
msgstr "Bir kürek alın."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our sanitation here has become… problematic.  We've mostly just been going "
"outside the walls to piss.  Not only is it kinda unhealthy, but the last "
"time I wandered out I almost got eaten!  So, if you'd get us a shovel, we "
"could make a latrine for ourselves.  We'll pay you fairly, as usual."
msgstr ""
"Buradaki hijyenimiz... sorunlu hale geldi. Genelde sadece duvarların dışına "
"çıkıp işiyoruz. Bu hem sağlıksız hem de en son dışarı çıktığımda neredeyse "
"yeniyordum! Yani, eğer bize bir kürek alırsanız, kendimize bir tuvalet "
"yapabiliriz. Her zamanki gibi size adil bir ödeme yapacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "A hardware store should have one lying around."
msgstr "Bir hırdavatçıda bir tane bulmalısınız."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the shovel?"
msgstr "Kürek var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We're eternally grateful to you."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim. Size sonsuz minnettarız."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "I'll do it myself, then."
msgstr "O zaman kendim yaparım."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Refurbishments Pt. VI"
msgstr "Yenilemeler Bölüm VI"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Refurbishments Pt. VI'
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a charcoal smoker."
msgstr "Bir kömür tütsüleyici alın."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Turns out that ant meat you got us wasn't actually too bad.  A little tough,"
" sure, but perfectly edible.  The problem now is we need a way of preserving"
" it.  One of those portable charcoal smokers would be really great.  Heck, "
"you might even wanna buy some."
msgstr ""
"Bize getirdiğiniz karınca eti aslında pek de kötü değilmiş. Biraz sert, "
"tabii ki, ama tamamen yenilebilir. Şimdi sorun, bunu korumanın bir yolunu "
"bulmamız gerekiyor. O taşınabilir kömür tütsüleyicilerden biri gerçekten "
"harika olurdu. Hatta belki birkaç tane almak istersiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid ""
"Maybe try a farm?  I bet those rural folks were pretty invested in "
"preserving their food."
msgstr ""
"Belki bir çiftlik deneyin? O kırsal halkın yiyeceklerini korumaya oldukça "
"yatırım yaptığını tahmin ediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal smoker?"
msgstr "Kömür tütsüleyiciniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/group_camp_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  We'll get started right away."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim. Hemen başlayacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/shelter_survivors.json
msgid "camper"
msgstr "karavan"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/shelter_survivors.json
msgid "scavenger"
msgstr "çözücü"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/shelter_survivors.json
msgid "prepper"
msgstr "hazırlayıcı"

#: data/json/npcs/homeless/shelter_survivors.json
msgid "moonshiner"
msgstr "kaçakçı"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Barry Isherwood"
msgstr "Barry Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Missing member of the Isherwood family."
msgstr "Isherwood ailesinin kayıp üyesi."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>."
msgstr "Hey, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't believe my eyes.  Please get me outta here…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've come to take you home, lets go."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey buddy, feel like talking about what you saw in that tower?"
msgstr "Hey dostum, o kulede gördüğün şeyler hakkında konuşmak ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "I'd better get going."
msgstr "Gitsem iyi olur."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think we need to talk about it, but I'm not ready yet.  Let me "
"reclaim my life for a while. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds good, Barry."
msgstr "Güzel, Barry."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I just want to go home."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't believe you are here, please take me back to the ranch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you, I thought I was dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Please god no!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "We shouldn't stay here too long, more might show up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, we'll never be able to repay you, Here's a token of my gratitude, I "
"made these suits for my family and always keep a few extra around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I don't feel saved…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell my family that I love them…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Carlos Isherwood"
msgstr "Carlos Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Jesse's husband, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge, I think you need to keep on walking, straight off this "
"property."
msgstr ""
"O rozeti görüyorum, bence yürümeye devam etmelisin, bu mülkten doğrudan çık."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello Sir, what brings you here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello Ma'am, what brings you here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm a Marshal, what are you going to do about it?"
msgstr "Evet, ben bir Marshal'ım, bununla ne yapacaksın?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, looks like you are building a forge setup."
msgstr "Merhaba, bir demirhane kuruyormuşsunuz gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you about a job."
msgstr ""
"Merhaba, Jack ve Claire bana sizinle bir iş hakkında konuşmamı önerdiler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It is coming together.  I want to make our own tools, repair our items and "
"even create some weapons and ammunition reloading."
msgstr ""
"Bir araya geliyor. Kendi aletlerimizi yapmak, eşyalarımızı onarmak ve hatta "
"bazı silahlar ve mühimmat yeniden yüklemek istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What do you need?"
msgstr "Neye ihtiyacın var?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I heard about Barry, can you tell me what captured him?"
msgstr ""
"Barry hakkında bir şeyler duydum, onu neyin yakaladığını söyleyebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It was pink and really fast, it had lots of limbs, definitely not human.  It"
" easily kept up with us when we tried to escape, horrifying stuff.  Barry "
"just dropped to the ground, and the thing swept him away."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You all just gonna leave him out there to his fate?"
msgstr "Hepiniz onu orada kaderine mi terk edeceksiniz?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We tracked it for a while, but lost the trail.  Right now we don't have the "
"resources to try to rescue him.  Chris has been trying to pick up the trail "
"again and figure out a rescue plan."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"The big item I need is an anvil, once I have that I can get a lot of repairs"
" done."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is hiking the perimeter of our land, planning some defense options."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off my farm, I won't deal with a government stooge."
msgstr "Çiftliğimden çıkmalısın, ben bir hükümet uşağıyla uğraşmam."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Go on..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is your forge operational?"
msgstr "Demirhanen çalışır durumda mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Chris?"
msgstr "Chris'i nerede bulabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find an anvil"
msgstr "Bir örs bul."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need an anvil to do advanced metal work."
msgstr "Gelişmiş metal işçiliği yapmak için bir örse ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could really use an anvil."
msgstr "Gerçekten bir örse ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You might be able to find one in a hardware store or similar."
msgstr "Bir hırdavatçıda veya benzer bir yerde bulabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to make it ourselves."
msgstr "Yine de teşekkürler, zamanı bulup kendimiz yapacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "If you can't find one, maybe you can make one for me."
msgstr "Eğer bulamazsan, belki benim için bir tane yapabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have the anvil?"
msgstr "Örsün var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will really make a difference, here's some horse armor"
" I've been working on.  Eventually I'll have the whole herd outfitted."
msgstr ""
"Bunu takdir ediyorum, bu gerçekten fark yaratacak, işte üzerinde çalıştığım "
"biraz at zırhı. Sonunda tüm sürüyü donatmış olacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "What good does this do me?"
msgstr "Bunun bana ne faydası var?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find Chris Isherwood"
msgstr "Chris Isherwood'u bul."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris hasn't come back from his latest search for Barry, I'm getting "
"concerned."
msgstr ""
"Chris, Barry için yaptığı son aramadan geri dönmedi, endişelenmeye başladım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Can you go find my son and tell him to check in with us."
msgstr "Oğlumu bulup bizimle iletişime geçmesini söyleyebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I hope he turns up soon."
msgstr "Ah, neyse. Umarım yakında ortaya çıkar."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He might be on the property somewhere, maybe by that old cabin near the "
"entrance, sometimes he camps there."
msgstr ""
"Belki mülkün bir yerindedir, belki girişteki o eski kulübenin yanında, bazen"
" orada kamp yapıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "How is the search going?"
msgstr "Arama nasıl gidiyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I was getting ready to go look myself.  Now that I have the anvil, "
"I've been working on new armor for the horses, take this prototype I made."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler, ben de kendim bakmaya hazırlanıyordum. Artık örsüm var, atlar "
"için yeni zırhlar üzerinde çalışıyordum, bu yaptığım prototipi al."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I hope he didn't meet Barry's fate…"
msgstr "Umarım Barry'nin kaderiyle karşılaşmamıştır..."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Chris Isherwood"
msgstr "Chris Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Jesse and Carlos' son, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "Ben Jesse ve Carlos'un oğluyum, Isherwood ailesinin bir parçasıyım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge.  You need to leave our land, my relatives have no fondness"
" for Marshals."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what's up?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Hi, Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your "
"uncle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending.  Is it tied to Barry's abduction?"
msgstr ""
"Daha önce Luke ile konuşuyordum, dünyanın sonu hakkında ilginç fikirlerin "
"olduğunu söyledi. Barry'nin kaçırılmasıyla mı bağlantılı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, they are always worried about us, I prefer to survey the land and try "
"to track the changes.  I'm thinking about fixing up this cabin for some "
"peace and quiet…"
msgstr ""
"Evet, her zaman bizim için endişeleniyorlar, ben araziyi gözlemlemeyi ve "
"değişiklikleri takip etmeyi tercih ediyorum. Bu kabini biraz huzur ve "
"sessizlik için onarmayı düşünüyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are restless, why not leave?"
msgstr "Huzursuz olduğunuzu söylüyor, neden gitmiyorsunuz?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of changes have you seen?"
msgstr "Ne tür değişiklikler gördünüz?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending."
msgstr ""
"Daha önce Luke ile konuşuyordum, dünyanın sonu hakkında ilginç fikirleriniz "
"olduğunu söyledi."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family is convinced that if we stay here, we'll be able to weather this "
"catastrophe.  Since technology has failed, they've doubled down on older "
"traditions.  I think we need to get out there and find some answers before "
"settling on a path."
msgstr ""
"Ailem, burada kalırsak bu felaketi atlatabileceğimize inanıyor. Teknoloji "
"başarısız olduğu için, daha eski geleneklere sarıldılar. Bence bir yola "
"yerleşmeden önce dışarı çıkıp bazı cevaplar bulmalıyız."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"In one of my longer trips looking for Barry, I saw something out in a field."
"  I didn't get close but I swear unbelievable monsters were coming out of "
"it.  It kinda shimmered, almost like it wasn't quite there.  I've been "
"tracking those monsters for a while…"
msgstr ""
"Barry'yi ararken yaptığım daha uzun bir yolculukta, bir tarlada bir şey "
"gördüm. Yaklaşmadım ama yemin ederim inanılmaz canavarlar çıkıyordu. Bir tür"
" parıldıyordu, sanki tam orada değilmiş gibi. O canavarları bir süredir "
"takip ediyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What did you find?"
msgstr "Ne buldun?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"They made their way to this weird spire like structure, I've never seen "
"anything like it, it glistened in the sun like something organic.  I think "
"they could be holding Barry there, I've seen them arrive and leave with "
"other humans."
msgstr ""
"Bu garip sivri yapıya doğru yola çıktılar, daha önce böyle bir şey görmedim,"
" güneşte organik bir şey gibi parlıyordu. Barry'nin orada tutulduğunu "
"düşünüyorum, diğer insanlarla geldiklerini ve gittiklerini gördüm."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"If you join up with me, we can go check it out, I want to see what they are "
"doing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, wildlife is more hostile and I've seen gigantic insects around, never "
"mind all these monsters.  I've also found mysterious dead spots and mutated "
"vegetation.  I don't think staying on a farm is sustainable forever, there "
"are big planet wide changes occurring."
msgstr ""
"Doğa daha düşmanca ve etrafta dev böcekler gördüm, bu canavarlardan "
"bahsetmiyorum bile. Ayrıca gizemli ölü noktalar ve mutasyona uğramış "
"bitkiler buldum. Bir çiftlikte kalmanın sonsuza dek sürdürülebilir olduğunu "
"düşünmüyorum, büyük gezegen çapında değişiklikler oluyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should leave before my family sees you."
msgstr "Ailem seni görmeden gitmelisin."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your uncle."
msgstr "Baban beni seni bulmam için gönderdi, amcanı aradığını söyledi."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, he said you had some interesting ideas about "
"the world ending."
msgstr ""
"Daha önce Luke ile konuşuyordum, dünyanın sonu hakkında ilginç fikirlerin "
"olduğunu söyledi."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
msgstr "Barry'yi gizemli yapıdan kurtar"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We need to investigate the alien encampment and try to find out what "
"happened to Barry."
msgstr ""
"Yabancı kampını araştırmamız ve Barry'ye ne olduğunu bulmaya çalışmamız "
"gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can take you to the structure, I tracked them to it."
msgstr "Seni yapıya götürebilirim, onları oraya kadar takip ettim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Awesome, I want some answers!"
msgstr "Harika, bazı cevaplar istiyorum!"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, I'll keep my eye on it, maybe I'll find a way one day."
msgstr ""
"Yine de teşekkürler, buna dikkat edeceğim, belki bir gün bir yol bulurum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I feel like we are underprepared if they see us, I marked the location for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Eğer bizi görürlerse hazırlıksız olduğumuzu hissediyorum, senin için yeri "
"işaretledim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You ready?"
msgstr "Hazır mısın?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's taller then I remember, we should look for prisoners.  I left a note "
"for my family before we left.  If we survive, the cabin should be fixed up "
"and ready for you to move in if you want to stay."
msgstr ""
"Hatırladığımdan daha uzun, mahkumları aramalıyız. Ayrılmadan önce ailem için"
" bir not bıraktım. Eğer hayatta kalırsak, kabin tamir edilip senin taşınman "
"için hazır olmalı eğer kalmak istersen."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Well it was here…"
msgstr "Buradaydı…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Claire Isherwood"
msgstr "Claire Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the matriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "Isherwood ailesinin matriği benim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is that a U.S. Marshal's badge you're wearing?"
msgstr "Üzerinde bir ABD Mareşali rozeti mi var?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello, what brings you here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what brings you here?"
msgstr "Merhaba, seni buraya getiren ne?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yes, I'm a marshal."
msgstr "Evet, ben bir mareşalim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, when would more of this stuff be ready?"
msgstr "Hey, bu şeylerden daha fazlası ne zaman hazır olacak?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, nice farm you have here."
msgstr "Merhaba, burada güzel bir çiftliğin var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack suggested I stop by and say hello."
msgstr "Merhaba, Jack beni uğramamı ve selam vermemi önerdi."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Let's trade."
msgstr "Ticaret yapalım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Around <interval>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Alright then, bye."
msgstr "Tamam o zaman, hoşça kal."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I live here with my husband, Jack.  He is working out in his shop."
msgstr "Burada kocam Jack ile yaşıyorum. O atölyesinde çalışıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You are lucky to have your family still together."
msgstr "Ailenizin hâlâ bir arada olması için şanslısınız."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Must be nice, to have the quiet place amid so much madness."
msgstr "Bunca kaosun ortasında sessiz bir yere sahip olmak güzel olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You don't need as much luck if you are prepared and work together.  We've "
"had our losses, my brother in law, Barry, was our best hunter but things are"
" so different now…"
msgstr ""
"Hazırlıklıysanız ve birlikte çalışıyorsanız, o kadar şansa ihtiyacınız yok. "
"Kayıplarımız oldu, kayınbiraderim Barry en iyi avcımızdı ama her şey şimdi "
"çok farklı…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "What happened to Barry?"
msgstr "Barry'ye ne oldu?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "A farm must be a pretty safe place these days."
msgstr "Bir çiftlik bu günlerde oldukça güvenli bir yer olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, nice to meet you.  I imagine Jack was boasting about my herbal "
"remedies, he's proud of what we've put together here."
msgstr ""
"Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum. Jack'in bitkisel tedavilerimden övündüğünü hayal"
" ediyorum, burada bir araya getirdiğimiz şeylerden gurur duyuyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "He did mention you make remedies, are they effective?"
msgstr "İlaçlar yaptığınızı söyledi, etkili mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to ask you something else…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I have always studied and made some natural remedies, but now they are more "
"essential than ever.  Who knows the next time we'll see a trained doctor.  "
"These remedies aren't always as effective, but they can do the job in a "
"pinch."
msgstr ""
"Her zaman bazı doğal ilaçlar üzerinde çalıştım ve yaptım, ama şimdi her "
"zamankinden daha önemli. Bir daha ne zaman eğitimli bir doktor göreceğimizi "
"kim bilir. Bu ilaçlar her zaman etkili olmayabilir, ama acil durumlarda iş "
"görebilirler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Some of their cows were killed before we realized what was happening, Barry "
"and Carlos went into the forest to find the predator but it was like nothing"
" they'd ever seen.  Carlos may be willing to tell you more."
msgstr ""
"Kendimizi ne olduğunu anlamadan önce bazı inekleri öldürüldü, Barry ve "
"Carlos avcıyı bulmak için ormana gitti ama gördükleri hiçbir şeye "
"benzemiyordu. Carlos size daha fazlasını anlatmaya istekli olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've always tried to live a quiet life out here, I suppose we are doing "
"better than most."
msgstr ""
"Burada sakin bir yaşam sürmeye çalıştık, sanırım çoğundan daha iyi "
"yapıyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jack and I have been together for 40 years.  He's been my anchor through all"
" of this chaos."
msgstr ""
"Jack ile 40 yıldır birlikteyiz. Bu kaosun içinde benim için bir liman oldu."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  They may have some jobs for"
" you."
msgstr ""
"Jesse ve ailesi at çiftliğinde yaşıyor. Sizin için bazı işler olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  He's may have some jobs for you if"
" you are interested."
msgstr ""
"Eddie'nin süt çiftliği yolun sonunda. Eğer ilgileniyorsanız sizin için bazı "
"işler olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off our land, you have no business here."
msgstr "Toprağımızdan çıkmalısınız, burada işiniz yok."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ask away."
msgstr "Sorun."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your husband, is he around?"
msgstr "Bana kocanızdan bahsedin, etrafta mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your daughter lives down the road?"
msgstr "Kızınız yolun aşağısında mı yaşıyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where is your brother's place?"
msgstr "Kardeşinizin yeri nerede?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 50 dandelions"
msgstr "50 karahindiba topla"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help foraging ingredients."
msgstr "Malzemeleri toplamak için biraz yardıma ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could use some fresh dandelions for the next batch of wine.  Can you bring"
" me 50 dandelions?"
msgstr ""
"Bir sonraki şarap partisi için biraz taze karahindiba lazım.  Bana 50 "
"karahindiba getirebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you, I'll put these to good use."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim, bunları iyi bir şekilde kullanacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  Maybe some other time, thanks."
msgstr "Eh, belki başka bir zaman, teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You can find them in the fields during the spring and summer months."
msgstr "Bahar ve yaz aylarında tarlalarda bulabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks.  Here's a small reward to show my appreciation for your help."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler.  Yardımın için minnettarlığımı göstermek için küçük bir ödül."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder if the wildlife ate all the greens…"
msgstr "Yaban hayatı tüm yeşillikleri yedi mi merak ediyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
msgstr "20 arı nane tohumu bul"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some seeds from the forest."
msgstr "Ormandan biraz tohuma ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 20 "
"bee balm seeds?"
msgstr ""
"Bir sonraki ekim sezonu için biraz tohuma ihtiyacımız var.  Bana 20 arı nane"
" tohumu getirebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  It's important to have a good stock before the flu season hits."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim.  Grip sezonu başlamadan önce iyi bir stok yapmak önemli."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should search through the forest, make sure to check in the underbrush "
"for beebalm and then harvest its seeds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Wow, perfect.  Here are some of my own remedies and if those don't work try "
"my other gift."
msgstr ""
"Vay, mükemmel. İşte bazı kendi ilaçlarım ve eğer bunlar işe yaramazsa diğer "
"hediyemi dene."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll have to find someone more at home in the forest…"
msgstr "Ormanda daha iyi olan birini bulmam gerekecek…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find and capture a cat"
msgstr "Bir kedi bul ve yakala"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use a barn cat to keep the mice down."
msgstr "Fareleri kontrol altında tutmak için bir ahır kedisine ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I saw some feral cats out by the old cabin.  Can you capture one for me?"
msgstr ""
"Eski kulübenin yanında bazı vahşi kediler gördüm. Birini benim için "
"yakalayabilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you!  Please hurry back!  Take this cage so you have a chance of "
"capturing one."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim! Lütfen çabuk geri dön! Birini yakalama şansın olması için "
"bu kafesi al."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I didn't want to use chemicals on these rats."
msgstr "Bu sıçanlar üzerinde kimyasallar kullanmak istemedim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Take this pet carrier; if you can get close to a cat, you can put it inside."
"  If you're having problems, try befriending it with cat food."
msgstr ""
"Bu evcil hayvan taşıyıcısını al; eğer bir kediye yaklaşabilirsen, onu içine "
"koyabilirsin. Sorun yaşıyorsan, ona kedi maması ile arkadaş olmaya çalış."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have you found a cat?"
msgstr "Bir kedi buldun mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much, I want you to have this copy of my natural remedy "
"journal.  I'll name this handsome fellow Joshua."
msgstr ""
"Çok teşekkür ederim, sana doğal ilaç günlüğümün bu kopyasını vermek "
"istiyorum. Bu yakışıklı dostuma Joshua adını vereceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Did you even bring back my cage?"
msgstr ""
"Ne?! Yalan söylüyorsun, bunu anlayabiliyorum! Kafesimi geri getirdin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh no!  I guess they are too nimble for you…"
msgstr "Ah hayır! Sanırım onlar senin için çok çevik..."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Eddie Isherwood"
msgstr "Eddie Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm a dairy farmer, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "Ben bir süt çiftçisiyim, Isherwood ailesinin bir parçasıyım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice dairy, must be tough keeping it running."
msgstr "Güzel bir süt çiftliği, işletmek zor olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come down here and meet you."
msgstr ""
"Merhaba, Jack ve Claire buraya gelmemi ve sizinle tanışmamı önerdiler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "When will your cows produce again?"
msgstr "İneklerin ne zaman tekrar süt verecek?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "If the cows don't get anything nasty it should be around <interval>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Cheers, bye."
msgstr "Şerefe, hoşça kal."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I run this dairy with my son, Luke.  It's been a tough job keeping the herd "
"together, hasn't left a lot of time for other projects."
msgstr ""
"Bu süt çiftliğini oğlum Luke ile birlikte işletiyorum. Sürüyle birlikte "
"tutmak zor bir iş oldu, diğer projeler için pek zaman kalmadı."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I heard about Barry, such a tragedy.  Can you tell me more about what "
"happened?"
msgstr ""
"Barry hakkında duydum, gerçekten bir trajedi. Başına ne geldiği hakkında "
"daha fazla bilgi verebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Barry and Carlos went to hunt down something that killed our livestock, they"
" tracked it into the forest.  It grabbed Barry and ran off, Carlos might be "
"willing to tell you the story, he managed to allude it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I could use some help getting materials.  I want to outfit that old "
"building across the road with some kilns.  We want to make our own jars and "
"pottery so we aren't dependent on scavenging."
msgstr ""
"Evet, malzeme almak için biraz yardıma ihtiyacım var. Karşıdaki eski binayı "
"bazı ocaklarla donatmak istiyorum. Kendi kavanozlarımızı ve çömleklerimizi "
"yapmak istiyoruz, böylece hurda toplamaya bağımlı olmayız."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "That is a good idea, what do you need?"
msgstr "Bu iyi bir fikir, neye ihtiyacın var?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm not interested right now, I'd better get going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Luke was going to start college this year, now everything is upside down.  "
"He is adaptable though, had an idea to begin manufacturing our own jars and "
"pottery.  He's out in the old outbuilding right now, cleaning up the place."
msgstr ""
"Luke bu yıl üniversiteye başlayacaktı, şimdi her şey alt üst oldu. Ama uyum "
"sağlama yeteneği var, kendi kavanozlarımızı ve çömleklerimizi üretme fikri "
"vardı. Şu anda eski binada, yeri temizliyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse manages the horses and other livestock, she is amazing with animals."
msgstr ""
"Jesse atları ve diğer hayvanları yönetiyor, hayvanlarla harika bir ilişkisi "
"var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Carlos will be in his workshop if he isn't out hunting.  He is trying to get"
" a forge set up."
msgstr ""
"Carlos, avda değilse atölyesinde olacaktır. Bir demirci kurmaya çalışıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your son helps with the dairy?"
msgstr "Oğlun süt işine mi yardım ediyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "So, Jesse runs the horse farm?"
msgstr "Yani, Jesse at çiftliğini mi işletiyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Carlos?"
msgstr "Carlos'u nerede bulabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 120 Rocks"
msgstr "120 Taş topla"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "We need to build some kilns."
msgstr "Biraz ocak inşa etmemiz gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use 120 rocks to construct some kilns."
msgstr "Bazı ocaklar inşa etmek için 120 taşa ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can break up some larger stones, or gather them up from the fields."
msgstr "Büyük taşları kırabilir veya tarlalardan toplayabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to get them ourselves."
msgstr "Yine de teşekkürler, onları kendimiz almak için zaman bulacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Mining would always be an option if you had the resources."
msgstr "Kaynakların olsaydı madencilik her zaman bir seçenek olurdu."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the stone?"
msgstr "Taşın var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make Luke happy."
msgstr "Bunu takdir ediyorum, bu Luke'u mutlu edecek."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 2000 units of sand"
msgstr "2000 birim kum topla"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help with."
msgstr "Kaynak toplama konusunda yardıma ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the forge is set up, we could use 2000 units of sand to get "
"production going."
msgstr ""
"Artık ocak kurulduğuna göre, üretimi başlatmak için 2000 birim kum "
"kullanabiliriz."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll try to find time to get it myself, thanks."
msgstr "Eh, kendim bulmak için zaman ayarlamaya çalışacağım, teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe landscaping supplies and "
"hardware stores."
msgstr ""
"Bunu nehir kenarlarında bulabilirsiniz, ya da belki peyzaj malzemeleri ve "
"hırdavatçılarda."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks, now Luke can get started.  Here's a token of my thanks."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler, şimdi Luke başlayabilir. İşte teşekkürlerimin bir sembolü."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the sand went…"
msgstr "Tüm kumun nereye gittiğini merak ediyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 1000 units of clay"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help if you have time."
msgstr "Kaynak toplama konusunda yardıma ihtiyacım var, eğer zamanın varsa."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the clay kiln is set up, we could use 1000 units of clay to get "
"production going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe look for deposits in the forest."
msgstr ""
"Bunu nehir kenarlarında bulabilirsiniz, ya da belki ormanda maden "
"arayabilirsiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, now Luke can get started making jugs, We'd like to give you a cow, "
"Here's Daisy, take good care of her and she'll provide you with milk."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler, şimdi Luke sürahi yapmaya başlayabilir, sana bir inek vermek "
"istiyoruz, İşte Daisy, ona iyi bak ve sana süt verecek."

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_cow'
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Daisy"
msgstr "Daisy"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack Isherwood"
msgstr "Jack Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the patriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "Ben Isherwood ailesinin patriğiyim"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm here to deliver some resources."
msgstr "Ben buraya bazı kaynaklar getirmek için geldim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "This is a lot of land, you been here since the collapse?"
msgstr "Burası çok geniş bir arazi, çöküşten beri burada mısın?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, good to see you again."
msgstr "Hey, seni tekrar görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I live here with my wife, this is our family's land.  My daughter's family "
"and son live down the road."
msgstr ""
"Ben burada eşimle yaşıyorum, burası ailemizin arazisi. Kızımın ailesi ve "
"oğlum yolda yaşıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your whole family survived?"
msgstr "Tüm aileniz hayatta mı kaldı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've had our losses… now we stay close to home, preparing for trouble.  "
"We've always taken disaster preparedness seriously, but we didn't expect "
"anything like this though."
msgstr ""
"Kayıplarımız oldu... şimdi evin yakınında kalıyoruz, sorunlara hazırlık "
"yapıyoruz. Her zaman felaket hazırlığını ciddiye aldık, ama böyle bir şey "
"beklemiyorduk."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Even out here we've had some attacks and seen … other things.  We have been "
"working on our defenses, but it takes time.  We've been able to keep up with"
" the crops and animals though so we won't have to risk our necks for "
"supplies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of defenses do you want?"
msgstr "Ne tür savunmalar istiyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We want to put up more fencing and build some look out spots, maybe lay some"
" traps for the monsters.  We could use some extra resources.  If you want to"
" bring me logs, sand, clay, wire, nails, wood planks, and metal chunks, I'll"
" give you signed chits you can use to buy goods from any of the family."
msgstr ""
"Daha fazla çit kurmak ve bazı gözetleme noktaları inşa etmek istiyoruz, "
"belki canavarlara tuzaklar kurarız. Ekstra kaynaklara ihtiyacımız var. Eğer "
"bana kütük, kum, kil, tel, çivi, ahşap levha ve metal parçaları getirirsen, "
"aileden herhangi birinden mal almak için kullanabileceğin imzalı fişler "
"vereceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds reasonable, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "Mantıklı, ne yapabileceğime bakacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Claire and I have been together for 40 years now, couldn't run this place "
"without her.  She's quite the herbalist too, been real useful lately.  She "
"is probably in the house, you should stop in."
msgstr ""
"Claire ile 40 yıldır birlikteyiz, onsuz burayı yürütemezdim. O aynı zamanda "
"oldukça iyi bir bitki uzmanı, son zamanlarda gerçekten faydalı oldu. "
"Muhtemelen evde, uğramalısın."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  Her husband, Carlos, may "
"have some jobs for you."
msgstr ""
"Jesse ve ailesi at çiftliğinde yaşıyor. Eşi Carlos'un senin için bazı işleri"
" olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  It's just him and his son since "
"Barry was taken by that thing in the woods."
msgstr ""
"Eddie'nin süt çiftliği yolun sonunda. Barry o ormandaki şey tarafından "
"alındığından beri sadece o ve oğlu var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should get off my land, the government proved its incompetence with this"
" catastrophe."
msgstr ""
"Arazimden çıkmalısın, hükümet bu felaketle birlikte yetersizliğini "
"kanıtladı."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Go on ..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your wife, is she around?"
msgstr "Bana karından bahset, etrafta mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Excellent.  What've you brought us?"
msgstr "Harika. Bize ne getirdin?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "That's all for now.  Can we discuss something else?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "That's all for now.  I'd best get going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 20 3L jars"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help scavenging."
msgstr "Kurtarma konusunda biraz yardıma ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some 3 liter jars to preserve our produce.  Can you bring me 20"
" large three liter jars?  I'll give you some preserves in exchange."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve foods while we can."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim. Yiyecekleri korumak önemli, elimizden geldiğince."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another way, thanks."
msgstr "Eh işte. Başka bir yol bulup bulamayacağıma bakacağım, teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Grocery stores, house kitchens, there's plenty of places to look."
msgstr "Bakkallar, ev mutfakları, bakacak çok yer var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wow, perfect.  Thanks.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "Vay, mükemmel. Teşekkürler. İşte ödülün."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I wonder where all the jars went…"
msgstr "Tüm kavanozların nereye gittiğini merak ediyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 100 wheat seeds"
msgstr "100 buğday tohumu bul."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some more scavenging for you."
msgstr "Senin için biraz daha hurda toplama işim var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 100 "
"wheat seeds?  I'll give you some fresh produce."
msgstr ""
"Gelecek ekim sezonu için biraz tohuma ihtiyacımız var.  Bana 100 buğday "
"tohumu getirebilir misin?  Sana biraz taze ürün vereceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve healthy foods while we can."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim. Sağlıklı gıdaları korumak önemli, elimizden geldiğince."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another supplier, thanks."
msgstr ""
"Eh işte. Başka bir tedarikçi bulup bulamayacağıma bakacağım, teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the seeds went…"
msgstr "Tüm tohumların nereye gittiğini merak ediyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jesse Isherwood"
msgstr "Jesse Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm a horse trainer, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "Ben bir at eğitmeniyim, Isherwood ailesinin bir parçasıyım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Leave our property, Marshal."
msgstr "Mülkümüzü terk et, Marshal."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello, We don't see many people these days."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, it looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "Merhaba, burada iyi olduğunuzu görüyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It would be a lot harder without family.  Keeping the animals safe is "
"essential to our future."
msgstr ""
"Aile olmadan çok daha zor olurdu. Hayvanları güvende tutmak geleceğimiz için"
" çok önemli."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are betting on civilization not coming back."
msgstr "Görünüşe göre medeniyetin geri gelmeyeceğine bahse giriyorsunuz."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have any animal care tips?"
msgstr "Herhangi bir hayvan bakımı ipucu var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We can't wait for someone else to fix things, we need to take care of "
"ourselves."
msgstr "Başka birinin işleri düzeltmesini bekleyemeyiz, kendimize bakmalıyız."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Horses make good all around companions.  They can get places that cars can't"
" and also help when all the engines fail.  They become very trusting if you "
"feed them some nice fodder."
msgstr ""
"Atlar iyi birer arkadaş olurlar. Arabaların gidemediği yerlere ulaşabilirler"
" ve tüm motorlar arızalandığında da yardımcı olurlar. Onlara güzel yem "
"verirseniz çok güvenilir hale gelirler."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Oh good, I'm sure Jack wanted to put you to work.  If you're interested, I "
"could use a hand clearing out the woods.  My son, Chris has his hands full "
"trying to keep the predators under control."
msgstr ""
"Oh iyi, Jack'in sizi çalıştırmak istediğinden eminim. İlgileniyorsanız, "
"ormanı temizlemek için bir yardım alabilirim. Oğlum Chris, yırtıcıları "
"kontrol altında tutmaya çalışırken işleriyle meşgul."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to speak with Carlos too about some work."
msgstr "Carlos ile bazı işler hakkında da konuşmak istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Is Chris around?  I'd like to know what he's run into out in the woods."
msgstr "Chris burada mı? Ormanda neyle karşılaştığını bilmek istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "What needs killing?"
msgstr "Ne öldürmemiz gerekiyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "He's out back in the workshop."
msgstr "Atölyede arka tarafta."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He's out doing some surveying, we are planning on adding a fence line and "
"some defenses."
msgstr ""
"Biraz arazi ölçümü yapıyor, bir çit ve bazı savunmalar eklemeyi planlıyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "Burada iyi gidiyorsun gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you."
msgstr "Jack ve Claire benim seninle konuşmamı önerdi."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is Chris around?"
msgstr "Chris burada mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill wolves"
msgstr "Kurtları öldür."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some wolves."
msgstr "Bazı kurtları öldürmekte yardım edebilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"There's been some wolves that keep scaring our chickens and horses, I'd be "
"grateful if you can kill them."
msgstr ""
"Tavuklarımızı ve atlarımızı korkutan bazı kurtlar var, onları öldürebilirsen"
" minnettar olurum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wonderful, let me know when it is done."
msgstr "Harika, iş bittiğinde haber ver."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we will try some traps."
msgstr "Yine de teşekkürler, bazı tuzaklar deneyeceğiz."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "A gun will probably help."
msgstr "Bir silah muhtemelen yardımcı olacaktır."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Did you kill it?"
msgstr "Onu öldürdün mü?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, I've got this old saddle I want you to have.  I'll be happy"
" to put a horse under it if you want to do some more heroics."
msgstr ""
"Bunu takdir ediyorum, sana vermek istediğim eski bir eyerim var. Eğer biraz "
"daha kahramanlık yapmak istersen, altına bir at koymaktan mutluluk duyarım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Show me the bodies."
msgstr "Bana cesetleri göster."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill unknown monsters"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some monsters."
msgstr "Biraz canavarı öldürmek için yardıma ihtiyacımız var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some help killing a pack of monsters.  I don't know what they "
"are, but they're very fast, I'm willing to outfit you with a horse if you "
"succeed."
msgstr ""
"Bir grup canavarı öldürmek için yardıma ihtiyacımız var. Onların ne olduğunu"
" bilmiyorum ama çok hızlılar, eğer başarırsan seni bir atla donatmaya "
"hazırım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Be ready for anything."
msgstr "Her şeye hazır ol."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I guess we can try some traps, but we could really use the help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Bring something big if you've got the firepower, and keep your distance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will help keep our animals safe.  This is, Steve, he's"
" a good, steady horse.  You should talk to Carlos about some armor for him."
msgstr ""
"Bunu takdir ediyorum, bu hayvanlarımızı güvende tutmaya yardımcı olacak. Bu,"
" Steve, iyi, sağlam bir at. Onun için biraz zırh hakkında Carlos ile "
"konuşmalısın."

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_horse'
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Steve"
msgstr "Steve"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Lisa Isherwood"
msgstr "Lisa Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "Isherwood ailesinin bir parçası"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, this is a nice farm, your family live here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Jesse."
msgstr "Merhaba, Jesse'yi arıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Chris."
msgstr "Merhaba, Chris'i arıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family owns all the land around here, my parents are out in the barn and "
"my other family is down he road."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ok, I'll go find them."
msgstr "Tamam, onları bulmaya gideceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Mom is in her office, in the barn.  Be careful that you don't let our horses"
" out."
msgstr "Anne ofisinde, ahırda. Atlarımızı dışarı çıkarmadığından emin ol."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Chris is out hunting or something right now."
msgstr "Chris şu anda avlanıyor ya da bir şeyler yapıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh, ok."
msgstr "Oh, tamam."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Or something?"
msgstr "Ya da bir şeyler mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice talking to you, bye."
msgstr "Seninle konuşmak güzeldi, hoşça kal."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well he's supposed to be hunting, but since you've been talking to Luke, I "
"bet he mentioned Chris wants to learn more about the end of the world.  "
"Sometimes he'll take off for a few days and I end up patching him up so my "
"parents don't know he left the property."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Luke Isherwood"
msgstr "Luke Isherwood"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Eddie's son, part of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "Ben Eddie'nin oğluyum, Isherwood ailesinin bir parçasıyım."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I see that badge, you should leave before my father sees you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your dad said you were out here fixing up this place."
msgstr "Baban burayı düzeltmek için burada olduğunu söyledi."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, What are you doing out here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I work on it when I have the time.  I can't leave the farm too long, "
"so I can't find some things I need."
msgstr ""
"Evet, zamanı bulduğumda üzerinde çalışıyorum. Çiftlikten çok uzun süre "
"ayrılamam, bu yüzden ihtiyaç duyduğum bazı şeyleri bulamıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Must be tough having the world fall apart when you had you future to look "
"forward to."
msgstr "Dünyanın yıkılması zor olmalı, geleceğe umutla bakarken."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've been cleaning up this old building to make it into a workshop.  I want "
"to put up a pottery kiln and forge.  My dad doesn't want me leaving the farm"
" to find some things, says it is too dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I know all the grown ups worry about us, but I think we can adapt better "
"than them in the long run.  Chris has some interesting thoughts on the "
"matter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of ideas does Chris have?"
msgstr "Chris'in ne tür fikirleri var?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Things have been tough for my dad since Barry was captured.  He works till "
"he falls asleep most nights.."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is a little older than me, he's up at the horse farm with his parents "
"and sister, Lisa."
msgstr ""
"Chris benden biraz daha büyük, ailesi ve kız kardeşi Lisa ile at "
"çiftliğinde."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, he doesn't agree that what we're doing here will last.  He thinks "
"things will only get worse.  It's tough to get the adults to listen though, "
"much less agree with his solution.  You can go talk to him more about it if "
"you want."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "You won't find any help here."
msgstr "Burada hiçbir yardım bulamazsın."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your dad."
msgstr "Bana babandan bahset."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
msgstr "Cam Üfleme Sanatı kitabını bul"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get the glass blowing started."
msgstr "Cam üfleme işlemine başlamak için daha fazla bilgiye ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use a book on glass blowing.  With the internet gone, I don't"
" have any handy references."
msgstr ""
"Gerçekten cam üfleme hakkında bir kitaba ihtiyacım var. İnternet kapandığı "
"için, elimde pratik referanslar yok."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fantastic, I'm not supposed to leave our land."
msgstr "Harika, topraklarımızı terk etmemem gerektiğini biliyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well, figured I'd have to do a lot of practice anyway."
msgstr "Neyse ki, her halükarda çok pratik yapmam gerekeceğini düşündüm."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore or a glass blower's studio should have one."
msgstr ""
"Bir kütüphane, kitapçı veya bir cam üfleme stüdyosunun bir tane bulundurması"
" gerekir."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the book?"
msgstr "Kitap var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make my life so much easier."
msgstr "Bunu takdir ediyorum, bu hayatımı çok daha kolay hale getirecek."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I don't see a book…?"
msgstr "Bir kitap göremiyorum...?"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "At least you escaped with your life…"
msgstr "En azından hayatınla kurtuldun..."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
msgstr "DIY Compendium'un bir kopyasını bul."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get better pottery."
msgstr "Daha iyi seramik yapmak için daha fazla bilgiye ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use the book, DIY Compendium.  With the internet gone, I "
"don't have any handy references."
msgstr ""
"Gerçekten DIY Compendium kitabına ihtiyacım var. İnternet gittiği için "
"elimde pratik referanslar yok."

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore should have one, schools are another good idea."
msgstr ""
"Bir kütüphane, kitapçı bir tane bulundurmalı, okullar da başka bir iyi "
"fikir."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Hello there.  Nice to see you, <name_g>."
msgstr "Merhaba.  Sizi görmek güzel, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "A stranger out here?  Who are you?"
msgstr "Burada bir yabancı mı?  Kimsiniz?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr "Bir şeye ihtiyacınız var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "How do things work around here now?"
msgstr "Burada işler şimdi nasıl yürüyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nah, see ya."
msgstr "Hayır, görüşürüz."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"You mean you're still looking for wood?  Crazy… but we had a suspicion folks"
" might show up in an emergency.  Talk to the manager if you want to make an "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Hala odun mu arıyorsun demek?  Çılgınca… ama acil bir durumda insanların "
"ortaya çıkabileceğinden şüpheleniyorduk.  Sipariş vermek istersen yöneticiyi"
" ara."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, the machinery works just fine.  We were always self-sufficient and "
"<the_cataclysm> only really made that more apparent.  So if you want to "
"place an order and help keep the operation running, talk to the manager.  "
"We'll trade you for our wood."
msgstr ""
"Makine gayet iyi çalışıyor.  Her zaman kendi kendimize yeterliydik ve "
"<the_cataclysm> bunu daha belirgin hale getirdi.  Eğer bir sipariş vermek ve"
" operasyonun devam etmesine yardımcı olmak istiyorsan, yöneticiyi ara.  "
"Odunlarımızla takas yaparız."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might"
" call 'em."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm a logger here.  Seasonal work but good pay… or it was, at least.  "
"Before that first <zombie> showed up and made it clear how bad things were "
"really getting."
msgstr ""
"Eh, ben burada bir ağaç kesicisiyim. Mevsimlik iş ama iyi para… ya da en "
"azından öyleydi. İlk <zombie> ortaya çıkmadan önce ve işlerin ne kadar "
"kötüye gittiğini açıkça gösterene kadar."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"I'm a lumberjack out here.  Things were quiet for a long time.  We're pretty"
" far out in the woods so it was kind of a shock to find out just how bad "
"it'd gotten in civilization.  We had a couple close run-ins ourselves.  My "
"friend over there almost got eaten!  But we still have resources that I'm "
"sure people can use."
msgstr ""
"Ben burada bir oduncuyum. Uzun bir süre sessizdi. Ormanın derinliklerinde "
"olduğumuz için medeniyette ne kadar kötüleştiğini öğrenmek bir tür şok oldu."
" Bizim de birkaç kez başımız belaya girdi. Arkadaşım orada neredeyse yendi! "
"Ama hala insanların kullanabileceğinden emin olduğum kaynaklarımız var."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"My comrades and I were lucky to be in the right place at the right time, I "
"suppose.  We keep really busy out here, so we didn't expect <the_cataclysm> "
"to land right in our lap like that.  Luckily these axes can chop more than "
"wood.  They'll take a good chunk out of anything nasty that threatens our "
"mill."
msgstr ""
"Sanırım arkadaşlarım ve ben doğru zamanda doğru yerde olmanın şansını "
"yakaladık. Burada gerçekten meşgulüz, bu yüzden <the_cataclysm>’ın tam "
"kucağımıza düşmesini beklemiyorduk. Neyse ki bu baltalar sadece odun "
"kesmekle kalmıyor. Değirmenimizi tehdit eden her şeyden iyi bir parça "
"alabilirler."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"Well, I work here.  Welcome to the mill.  Used to be trucks in and out of "
"here all the time but you're the first face we've seen in a while."
msgstr ""
"Eh, burada çalışıyorum. Değirmene hoş geldin. Buradan sürekli kamyonlar "
"girip çıkardı ama bir süredir gördüğümüz ilk yüz sensin."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid ""
"New to the job… or, well, whatever's happening now.  I still cut trees and "
"run logs through the saw from time to time, so I guess you'd call me a "
"logger.  Things have only gotten weirder after those fucking <zombies> "
"nearly killed us.  I'm not sure how much longer we'll last…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "Hope it goes well."
msgstr "Umarım iyi gider."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid "A new face at the mill?  Who might you be?"
msgstr "Değirmen de yeni bir yüz mü? Sen kimsin?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
msgid ""
"I'm the manager here at the mill.  It's a tight-knit crew, unionized "
"operation.  When <the_cataclysm> broke out, we didn't even know about it "
"till some <zombies> wandered onto the yard.  Now, we've just held up here.  "
"I imagine any folks left out there might be needing our machinery and skills"
" to keep civilization alive.  Might make new customers yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "logger"
msgstr "logger"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "manager"
msgstr "manager"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "broker"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_employees.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "Oduncu"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_employees.json
msgid "I felled trees before the apocalypse.  Zombies shouldn't be as tough."
msgstr ""
"Kıyamet öncesinde ağaçları devirdim.  Zombilerin bu kadar dayanıklı olmaması"
" gerek."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Find Drive Belts"
msgstr "Sürüş Kayışlarını Bul"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find Drive Belts'
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Obtain 3 drive belts or makeshift drive belts in exchange for credit with "
"the loggers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need three drive belts."
msgstr "Üç sürüş kayışına ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Some of our machinery received some damage before <the_cataclysm> and we "
"were waiting on replacement parts.  Now everything's changed and those parts"
" are more important than ever.  Get us three drive belts and I'll give you "
"some credit with us."
msgstr ""
"Makinalarımız <the_cataclysm> öncesinde biraz hasar aldı ve yedek parçaları "
"bekliyorduk.  Şimdi her şey değişti ve o parçalar her zamankinden daha "
"önemli.  Bize üç sürüş kayışı getir, sana bizimle kredi vereceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Someone's got to do it."
msgstr "Bunu birinin yapması gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find actual drive belts on engines, a good replacement can be "
"made from a belt and some duct tape.  Nothing difficult."
msgstr ""
"Eğer motorlarda gerçek sürüş kayışları bulamazsan, bir kayış ve biraz bant "
"ile iyi bir yedek parça yapabilirsin.  Zor bir şey değil."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the belts?"
msgstr "Kemerleriniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  Thanks, <name_g>, we'll be fine for a long while from now."
msgstr "Harika! Teşekkürler, <name_g>, uzun bir süre idare edeceğiz."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Where are they?  I don't believe you."
msgstr "Onlar nerede? Sana inanmıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to do it."
msgstr "Bu talihsiz. Sanırım bunu yapmak için başka birini bulmak zorundayız."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Get 1,000 Nails"
msgstr "1.000 Çivi Al"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Get 1,000 Nails'
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 1,000 nails in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "Oduncularla kredi karşılığında 1.000 çivi temin et."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 1,000 nails."
msgstr "1.000 çiviye ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Along with those drive belts, we were waiting for some nails for structural "
"repairs.  Due to <the_cataclysm>, we obviously never received them.  So, I "
"need you to get us 1,000 nails.  We'll pay you fairly."
msgstr ""
"O sürücü kemerleriyle birlikte, yapısal onarımlar için bazı çivileri "
"bekliyorduk. <the_cataclysm> nedeniyle, açıkça onları hiç almadık. Yani, "
"bize 1.000 çivi getirmeni istiyorum. Seni adil bir şekilde ödeyeceğiz."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Taking apart some furniture in town should get what you need."
msgstr "Şehirdeki bazı mobilyaları sökmek ihtiyacın olanı sağlamalı."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the nails?"
msgstr "Çivileriniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our warehouse was about to fall apart.  These will be extremely helpful to "
"us."
msgstr "Depomuz çökmek üzereydi. Bunlar bizim için son derece faydalı olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Get 6,800 Nails"
msgstr "6.800 Çivi Al"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Get 6,800 Nails'
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 6,800 nails in exchange for credit with the loggers."
msgstr "6,800 çivi alarak odunculardan kredi almak."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 6,800 nails."
msgstr "6,800 çiviye ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"While fairly sturdy, the metal fence around this place won't hold out for "
"long.  So, we've decided to replace it with a wall.  However, the nails we "
"had were used to repair our existing structures, and they weren't nearly "
"enough.  After some calculations, we need 6,800 nails to do it.  That may "
"seem like a lot, but we're willing to give you a TON of credit for it."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerin etrafındaki metal çit oldukça sağlam olsa da uzun süre "
"dayanmayacak. Bu yüzden, onu bir duvarla değiştirmeye karar verdik. Ancak, "
"elimizdeki çiviler mevcut yapılarımızı onarmak için kullanıldı ve yeterli "
"değildi. Bazı hesaplamalardan sonra, bunu yapmak için 6,800 çiviye "
"ihtiyacımız var. Bu çok gibi görünebilir, ama bunun için size TONLARCA kredi"
" vermeye istekliyiz."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Well, I suppose that's reasonable."
msgstr "Sanırım bu makul."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"You might have to do more than just scrapping a bunch of furniture.  "
"Dismantling a building somewhere in town could get you what you need."
msgstr ""
"Sadece bir sürü mobilyayı hurdaya çıkarmaktan daha fazlasını yapmanız "
"gerekebilir. Şehirde bir binayı sökmek, ihtiyacınız olanı elde etmenizi "
"sağlayabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "That's absolutely amazing!  I can't thank you enough for this!"
msgstr "Bu kesinlikle harika! Bunun için size yeterince teşekkür edemem!"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "You're a fucking scammer, <name_b>!"
msgstr "Sen bir lanet dolandırıcısın, <name_b>!"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Find 6 Blankets"
msgstr "6 Battaniye Bul"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find 6 Blankets'
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Obtain 6 blankets, fur blankets, electric blankets etc in exchange for "
"credit with the loggers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "I need 6 blankets."
msgstr "6 battaniyeye ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we should be safe from harm, I decided to start adding a few things"
" to this place.  Right now, we don't have anywhere to comfortably sleep, so "
"we're building a small sleeping quarter.  We just need 6 big, warm blankets "
"to finish our project."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"I figure any hotel or motel in town should have lots of blankets, whatever "
"types you can find for us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Did you find us some bedding yet?"
msgstr "Bize biraz yatak bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks!  Feel free to sleep here if you want.  It's the least we can do for "
"the help."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler! İstersen burada uyuyabilirsin. Yardım için yapabileceğimiz en "
"azı bu."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "How is this supposed to help us?"
msgstr "Bu bize nasıl yardımcı olacak?"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Establish A Trade Route'
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the loggers and a refugee center, and "
"bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Oduncular ile bir mülteci merkezi arasında ticaret ilişkileri kur ve "
"anlaşmanın bir yazılı belgesini geri getir."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid ""
"While some of us were out scavenging, we spotted an old evac shelter that "
"looks like it might have some people inside.  I want you to go over there, "
"find whoever runs the joint, and see if we can make a deal with them for "
"some processed lumber.  This will be invaluable to our survival."
msgstr ""
"Bazılarımız avlanırken, içinde bazı insanların olabileceği eski bir tahliye "
"sığınağı gördük. Oraya gitmeni, yeri yöneten kişiyi bulmanı ve onlarla "
"işlenmiş kereste için bir anlaşma yapıp yapamayacağımızı öğrenmeni "
"istiyorum. Bu, hayatta kalmamız için çok değerli olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Please give it a try?  This is really important to us."
msgstr "Bir deneme yapar mısın? Bu bizim için gerçekten önemli."

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "What did they say about the deal?"
msgstr "Anlaşma hakkında ne dediler?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!  We're set for life on this one!"
msgstr "Teşekkürler! Bu konuda hayatımızı garanti altına aldık!"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "How does this help us?"
msgstr "Bu bize nasıl yardımcı oluyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to trade with."
msgstr "Bu talihsiz. Başka biriyle ticaret yapmamız gerekecek sanırım."

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "miner"
msgstr "madenci"

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Miner"
msgstr "Madenci"

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "Merhaba!"

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr "Buradan çıkıyorum. Hoşça kal."

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid ""
"Poor fellow - looks like you're out of your mind.  Can't help you, sorry.  "
"I'm outta here.  Bye."
msgstr ""
"Zavallı adam - aklını yitirmiş gibisin. Yardım edemem, üzgünüm. Buradan "
"çıkıyorum. Hoşça kal."

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "<spirals>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Sorry, what?"
msgstr "Üzgünüm, ne?"

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Why are you repeating 'spirals' over and over again?"
msgstr "Neden 'spiraller'i tekrar tekrar tekrarlıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
msgid "Are you nuts?"
msgstr "Aklını mı kaçırdın?"

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Haven't seen someone new in a while.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Just wandering, <name_g>."
msgstr "Sadece dolaşıyorum, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid ""
"I'll make this real simple for you.  Hand over your stuff, and no one gets "
"hurt, capiche?"
msgstr ""
"Senin için bunu gerçekten basit tutacağım. Eşyalarını ver, kimse zarar "
"görmesin, anladın mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr "Senin için ne yapabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Could you tell me a bit about yourself?"
msgstr "Kendin hakkında biraz bilgi verebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Can I purchase any of your liquor?"
msgstr "Herhangi bir içki satın alabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid "Anything I could do for you?"
msgstr "Senin için yapabileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/moonshiner/TALK_NPC_moonshiner.json
msgid ""
"I run this distillery you're standing in, before <the_cataclysm> it wasn't "
"so legal with the law.  I was in some town making a deal on my product when "
"a horde of rioters busted in, so I ran for it.  I thought my business would "
"be a nice place to stay, so I came out here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "CPT"
msgstr "KPT"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "I hope you're here to assist us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how you got down here Marshal, but if Command sent you we could"
" use your help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Sir, I don't know how the hell you got down here but if you have any sense "
"you'll get out while you can."
msgstr ""
"Efendim, buraya nasıl indiğinizi bilmiyorum ama eğer biraz aklınız varsa, "
"çıkabileceğiniz zaman çıkmalısınız."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Ma'am, I don't know how the hell you got down here but if you have any sense"
" you'll get out while you can."
msgstr ""
"Hanımefendi, buraya nasıl indiğinizi bilmiyorum ama eğer biraz aklınız "
"varsa, çıkabileceğiniz zaman çıkmalısınız."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"[MISSION] I was asked to get a report from you to send to your superiors."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "What are you doing down here?"
msgstr "Burada ne yapıyorsunuz?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Can you tell me about this facility?"
msgstr "Bu tesis hakkında bana bilgi verebilir misiniz?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "What do you need done?"
msgstr "Ne yapmamı istersin?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "I've had experience with Old Guard matters before, I can help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "This seems like a military matter to me, I'm here to assist."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "About the mission…"
msgstr "Görev hakkında…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "About one of those missions…"
msgstr "O görevlerden biri hakkında…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "I've got to go…"
msgstr "Gitmem gerekiyor…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"We can use all the help we can get.  I'll send word out to the others that "
"you're cleared to be here, but be careful.  There are still some hotspots "
"contaminated with radiation in this sector, and the lower level is in even "
"worse shape."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"I was expecting someone wearing their badge, but alright.  I'll give you "
"clearance but try to be careful down here.  I don't want over-eager civilian"
" contractors, or whatever you may be, getting themselves killed just for our"
" sake."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "I'll do what I can."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Not like I could look up personnel records from down here.  Our team in the "
"comms center might be able to uplink with some old registries but then I'd "
"have to give you clearance to go wandering around down here anyway.  I'll "
"take your word for it but watch yourself down here, this place is dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Alright, I've got a sitrep written out.  As helpful as it'd be to have you "
"here, getting this back to the others could also help get us reinforcements "
"somewhere down the line.  Not a lot of this place is operational anymore, "
"but we're expecting comms to provide a link to other assets in the region if"
" we can get it in full working order."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Thank you, that's all for now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"I'm leading what remains of my company on a mission to re-secure this "
"facility.  We entered the complex with two dozen men and immediately went "
"about securing this control room.  From here I dispatched my men to secure "
"vital systems located on this floor and the floors below this one.  If we "
"are successful, this facility can be cleared and used as a permanent base of"
" operations in the region.  Most importantly it will allow us to redirect "
"refugee traffic away from overcrowded outposts and free up more of our "
"forces to conduct recovery operations."
msgstr ""
"Şirketimin kalan kısmını bu tesisi yeniden güvence altına almak için bir "
"göreve götürüyorum. Kompleksin içine iki düzine adamla girdik ve hemen bu "
"kontrol odasını güvence altına almaya başladık. Buradan, bu kat ve alt "
"katlarda bulunan hayati sistemleri güvence altına almak için adamlarımı "
"gönderdim. Eğer başarılı olursak, bu tesis temizlenebilir ve bölgede kalıcı "
"bir operasyon üssü olarak kullanılabilir. En önemlisi, mülteci trafiğini "
"aşırı kalabalık karakollardan uzaklaştırmamıza ve kurtarma operasyonlarını "
"yürütmek için daha fazla gücümüzü serbest bırakmamıza olanak tanıyacak."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Seems like a decent plan…"
msgstr "İyi bir plan gibi görünüyor…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"This facility was constructed to provide a safe haven in the event of a "
"global conflict.  The vault can support several thousand people for a few "
"years if all systems are operational and sufficient notification is given.  "
"Unfortunately, the power system was damaged or sabotaged at some point and "
"released a single extremely lethal burst of radiation.  The catastrophic "
"event lasted for several minutes and resulted in the deaths of most people "
"located on the 2nd and lower floors.  Those working on this floor were able "
"to seal the access ways to the lower floors before succumbing to radiation "
"sickness.  The only other thing the logs tell us is that all water pressure "
"was diverted to the lower levels."
msgstr ""
"Bu tesis, küresel bir çatışma durumunda güvenli bir sığınak sağlamak için "
"inşa edilmiştir. Tünel, tüm sistemler çalışır durumda ve yeterli bildirim "
"yapıldığında birkaç yıl boyunca birkaç bin kişiyi destekleyebilir. Ne yazık "
"ki, güç sistemi bir noktada hasar gördü veya sabotaj yapıldı ve tek bir son "
"derece ölümcül radyasyon patlaması serbest bıraktı. Felaket olayı birkaç "
"dakika sürdü ve 2. kat ve alt katlarda bulunan çoğu insanın ölümüne neden "
"oldu. Bu kat üzerinde çalışanlar, radyasyon hastalığına yenik düşmeden önce "
"alt katların erişim yollarını kapatmayı başardılar. Kayıtların bize "
"söylediği tek diğer şey, tüm su basıncının alt katlara yönlendirildiğidir."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Whatever they did it must have worked since we are still alive…"
msgstr "Ne yaptıysalar işe yaramış olmalı, çünkü hala hayattayız…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Locate Commo Team"
msgstr "Commo Ekibini Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "We need help…"
msgstr "Yardıma ihtiyacımız var…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"My communications team went to secure the radio control room after we "
"breached the facility.  I haven't heard from them since, I need you to "
"locate them.  Their first objective was to record all active channels that "
"were transmitting information on other survivors or facilities.  Find them "
"and return the frequency list to me.  I'm sure they could probably use your "
"help also."
msgstr ""
"İletişim ekibim, tesisi ihlal ettikten sonra radyo kontrol odasını güvence "
"altına almak için gitti. O zamandan beri onlardan haber almadım, onları "
"bulmanıza ihtiyacım var. İlk hedefleri, diğer hayatta kalanlar veya tesisler"
" hakkında bilgi ileten tüm aktif kanalları kaydetmekti. Onları bulun ve "
"frekans listesini bana geri getirin. Eminim, muhtemelen yardımınıza da "
"ihtiyaçları vardır."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Good luck, the communications room shouldn't be far from here."
msgstr "İyi şanslar, iletişim odası buradan uzak olmamalı."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I don't know why you would bother wasting your time down here if you can't "
"handle a few small tasks…"
msgstr ""
"Eğer birkaç küçük görevi yerine getiremiyorsanız, burada zamanınızı boşa "
"harcamanızın nedenini bilmiyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "We were briefed that the communications array was on this level."
msgstr "Bu seviyede iletişim dizisinin bulunduğu konusunda bilgilendirildik."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Thanks, let me know when you need another tasking."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler, başka bir görev için ihtiyaç duyduğunuzda bana haber verin."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Cull Nightmares"
msgstr "Kabusları Yok Et"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid ""
"Your assistance is greatly appreciated, we need to clear out the more "
"ruthless monsters that are wandering up from the lower levels.  If you could"
" cull twenty or so of what we refer to as 'nightmares' my men would be much "
"safer.  If you've cleared out most of this floor then the lower levels "
"should be your next target. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "Good luck, finding a clear passage to the second level may be tricky."
msgstr "İyi şanslar, ikinci seviyeye temiz bir geçiş bulmak zor olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "These creatures can swing their appendages surprisingly far."
msgstr "Bu yaratıklar uzuvlarını şaşırtıcı derecede uzağa sallayabilirler."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
msgid "How is the hunt going?"
msgstr "Av nasıl gidiyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "SFC"
msgstr "SFC"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Welcome back."
msgstr "Hoş geldin tekrar."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Marshal, I'm rather surprised to see you here."
msgstr "Mareşal, burada sizi görmekten oldukça şaşırdım."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Sir, I'm not sure you're authorized to be here…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Ma'am, I'm not sure you're authorized to be here…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "[MISSION] The captain sent me to get a frequency list from you."
msgstr ""
"[MISSION] Kaptan, sizden bir frekans listesi almam için beni gönderdi."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "Do you need any help?"
msgstr "Herhangi bir yardıma ihtiyacın var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I should be going"
msgstr "Gitmem gerekiyor"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"We are securing the external communications array for this facility.  I'm "
"rather restricted in what I can release… go find my commander if you have "
"any questions."
msgstr ""
"Bu tesis için dış iletişim dizisini güvence altına alıyoruz. Ne "
"yayınlayabileceğim konusunda oldukça kısıtlıyım… herhangi bir sorunuz varsa "
"komutanımı bulmaya gidin."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'll try and find your commander then…"
msgstr "O zaman komutanınızı bulmaya çalışacağım…"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I was expecting the captain to send a runner.  Here is the list you are "
"looking for.  What we can identify from here are simply the frequencies that"
" have traffic on them.  Many of the transmissions are indecipherable without"
" repairing or replacing the equipment here.  When the facility was being "
"overrun, standard procedure was to destroy encryption hardware to protect "
"federal secrets and maintain the integrity of the comms network.  We are "
"hoping a few plain text messages can get picked up though."
msgstr ""
"Kaptanın bir koşucu göndermesini bekliyordum. İşte aradığınız liste. Buradan"
" tanımlayabildiğimiz şeyler, üzerinde trafik olan frekanslardır. İletimlerin"
" çoğu, buradaki ekipmanı onarmadan veya değiştirmeden çözülemez. Tesis ele "
"geçirildiğinde, federal sırları korumak ve iletişim ağının bütünlüğünü "
"sağlamak için şifreleme donanımını yok etmek standart prosedürdü. Yine de "
"birkaç düz metin mesajının alınabileceğini umuyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I hope that means you're cleared to be here.  Here is the list you are "
"looking for.  What we can identify from here are simply the frequencies that"
" have traffic on them.  Many of the transmissions are indecipherable without"
" repairing or replacing the equipment here.  When the facility was being "
"overrun, standard procedure was to destroy encryption hardware to protect "
"federal secrets and maintain the integrity of the comms network.  We are "
"hoping a few plain text messages can get picked up though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Fabricate Repeater Mod"
msgstr "Tekrarlayıcı Modu Üret"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"My chief responsibility is to monitor radio traffic and locate potential "
"targets to secure or rescue.  The majority of radio repeaters are down and "
"those that are working have only emergency power.  If you have a basic "
"understanding of electronics you should be able to fabricate the 'radio "
"repeater mod' found in these plans.  When this mod is attached to a radio "
"station's main terminal, all short range radio traffic on emergency channels"
" is boosted so we can pick it up at much longer ranges.  I really need you "
"make me one."
msgstr ""
"Başlıca sorumluluğum radyo trafiğini izlemek ve güvence altına almak veya "
"kurtarmak için potansiyel hedefleri bulmaktır. Radyo tekrarlayıcılarının "
"çoğu çalışmıyor ve çalışanlar yalnızca acil güçle çalışıyor. Elektronik "
"konusunda temel bir anlayışınız varsa, bu planlarda bulunan 'radyo "
"tekrarlayıcı modunu' üretebilmelisiniz. Bu mod bir radyo istasyonunun ana "
"terminaline bağlandığında, acil kanallardaki tüm kısa menzil radyo trafiği "
"artırılır, böylece çok daha uzun mesafelerde alabiliriz. Gerçekten bir tane "
"yapmanızı istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I know the labs on the other side of the complex have electronic "
"parts sitting around."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler, kompleksin diğer tarafındaki laboratuvarlarda etrafta "
"elektronik parçalar olduğunu biliyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'm sure the motorpool has a truck battery you could salvage."
msgstr ""
"Motor havuzunun kurtarabileceğiniz bir kamyon aküsü olduğunu düşünüyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Have you had any luck fabricating it?"
msgstr "Onu üretme konusunda şansınız oldu mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I'll see to installing this one.  It will be some time but I could "
"use someone to position these around the region."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler, bu birimi kurmaya bakacağım. Biraz zaman alacak ama bu bölgeye "
"bunları yerleştirecek birine ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I guess I could use your skills once again.  There are small transmitters "
"located in the nearby evacuation shelters; if we don't separate them from "
"the power grid their power systems will rapidly deteriorate over the next "
"few weeks.  The task is rather simple but the shelters offer us a place to "
"redirect refugees until this vault can be secured. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I should be ready for you to install the radio repeater mods by the "
"time you get back."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler, geri döndüğünüzde radyo tekrarlayıcı modlarını kurmanız için "
"hazır olmalıyım."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Try searching on the outskirts of towns."
msgstr "Şehirlerin kenarlarında arama yapmayı deneyin."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Have you had any luck severing the connection?"
msgstr "Bağlantıyı kesmede şansınız oldu mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "We are good to go!  The last of the gear is powering up now."
msgstr "Hazırız! Eşyaların son kısmı şimdi güçleniyor."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Most of my essential gear has been brought back online so it is time for you"
" to install your first radio repeater mod.  Head topside and locate the "
"nearest radio station.  Install the mod on the backup terminal and return to"
" me so that I can verify that everything was successful.  Radio towers must "
"unfortunately be ignored for now, without a dedicated emergency power system"
" they won't be useful for some time."
msgstr ""
"Temel ekipmanımın çoğu tekrar çevrimiçi hale getirildi, bu yüzden ilk radyo "
"tekrarlayıcı modunuzu kurma zamanı. Yukarı çıkın ve en yakın radyo "
"istasyonunu bulun. Modu yedek terminale kurun ve her şeyin başarılı olduğunu"
" doğrulayabilmem için bana geri dönün. Radyo kuleleri maalesef şimdilik göz "
"ardı edilmelidir, çünkü özel bir acil güç sistemi olmadan bir süre işe "
"yaramayacaklar."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'll be standing by down here once you are done."
msgstr "İşiniz bittiğinde burada bekliyor olacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"If you could make some sort of directional antenna, it might help locating "
"the radio stations."
msgstr ""
"Herhangi bir yönlü anten yapabilirseniz, radyo istasyonlarını bulmanıza "
"yardımcı olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Have you had any luck finding a radio station?"
msgstr "Bir radyo istasyonu bulmada şansınız oldu mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "That's one down."
msgstr "Bir tane gitti."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I could always use you to put another repeater mod up.  I don't have to "
"remind you but every one that goes up extends our response area just a "
"little bit more.  With enough of them we'll be able to maintain "
"communication with anyone in the region."
msgstr ""
"Başka bir tekrarlayıcı modunu kurmak için her zaman size ihtiyacım var. Size"
" hatırlatmam gerekmiyor ama kurulan her bir mod, yanıt alanımızı biraz daha "
"genişletiyor. Yeterince kurarsak, bölgede kimseyle iletişim kurabileceğiz."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "I'll be standing by."
msgstr "Bekliyor olacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"Getting a working vehicle is going to become important as the distance you "
"have to travel increases."
msgstr ""
"Gidilecek mesafe arttıkça çalışır bir araç edinmek önemli hale gelecek."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid ""
"I'll try and update the captain with any signals that I need investigated."
msgstr "İncelenmesi gereken sinyallerle kaptanı güncellemeye çalışacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Glad to see we're not on our own down here…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I can't talk now, check with the captain or our comms officer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Not much I can tell you, I'm not in charge here"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "I'm supposed to direct all questions to my leadership."
msgstr "Tüm soruları liderliğime yönlendirmem gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Be careful out there, the lower levels are still a mess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Hello, marshal.  You should check in with the captain."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "I'm afraid I can't talk now, speak with my commanding officer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "A marshal, huh?  The captain would like a word with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Are you our reinforcements?  I'd suggest you talk to our CO."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Sorry marshal, I'm on duty.  Check in with our commander."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Hey, citizen… I'm not sure you belong here."
msgstr "Hey, vatandaş… Burada sana ait olduğundan emin değilim."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "You should mind your own business, nothing to see here."
msgstr "Kendi işine bakmalısın, burada görülecek bir şey yok."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "If you need something you'll need to talk to someone else."
msgstr "Bir şeye ihtiyacın varsa, başka biriyle konuşman gerekecek."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Sir."
msgstr "Beyefendi."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Dude, if you can hold your own you should look into enlisting."
msgstr "Kanka, eğer kendini savunabiliyorsan, askere yazılmayı düşünmelisin."

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Ma'am"
msgstr "Hanımefendi"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid "Hey miss, don't you think it would be safer if you stuck with me?"
msgstr ""
"Hey hanım, benimle birlikte kalmanın daha güvenli olacağını düşünmüyor "
"musun?"

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how bad things have gotten out there, but this place seriously "
"isn't safe for civilians."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Soldier.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Don't mind me…"
msgstr "Beni umursama…"

#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Would you be interested in bartering?"
msgstr "Takas yapmaya ilgi duyar mısın?"

#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid "Can I stay here for a while?"
msgstr "Burada bir süre kalabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid ""
"They all said I was crazy for preparing for <the_cataclysm>.  Now, they're "
"all dead, and I'm still kickin'.  When the riots turned to hordes, I was "
"ready; all I had to do was dodge a few <zombies> to get back to my bastion."
"  I've been living safely here ever since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "İlginç."

#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
msgid ""
"Well, I guess you could borrow one of the spare beds, just don't hog it.  I "
"kept a few in case someone else joined me, but no one I knew came here."
msgstr ""
"Peki, yedek yataklardan birini ödünç alabilirsin, ama onu kapma. Başka "
"birisi bana katılır diye birkaç tane sakladım, ama tanıdığım hiç kimse "
"buraya gelmedi."

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "prisoner"
msgstr "tutuklu"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Prisoner"
msgstr "Tutuklu"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid ""
"My god, you've got to get me out of here.  The things… the things they've "
"done… please help."
msgstr ""
"Aman Tanrım, beni buradan çıkarman gerekiyor.  Yapılanlar… yapılanlar… "
"lütfen yardım et."

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Aren't you a little short to be a stormtrooper?"
msgstr "Bir stormtrooper olmak için biraz kısa değil misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Please, help me."
msgstr "Lütfen, bana yardım et."

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Can you get me out of this hell hole?"
msgstr "Beni bu cehennem çukurundan çıkarabilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Who are you?  Are you real?"
msgstr "Sen kimsin? Gerçek misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Can you please save me?  I have to get out of here."
msgstr "Lütfen beni kurtarır mısın? Buradan çıkmam gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Hallelujah, rescue!"
msgstr "Hallelujah, kurtuluş!"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "I can't believe my eyes.  Thank you, thank you!"
msgstr "Gözlerime inanamıyorum. Teşekkür ederim, teşekkür ederim!"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "You're… you're actually real!"
msgstr "Sen… sen gerçekten gerçeksin!"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Come with me, if you want to live."
msgstr "Yaşamak istiyorsan, benimle gel."

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "I've no use for weaklings.  Run.  Now."
msgstr "Zayıflara ihtiyacım yok. Kaç. Şimdi."

