#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I'm trying to put a cleanup crew together to tidy up the back room.  Can you"
" help?"
msgstr ""
"Arka odayı temizlemek için bir temizlik ekibi toplamaya çalışıyorum.  "
"Yardımcı olabilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "What's your take on the situation here?"
msgstr "Buradaki durum hakkında ne düşünüyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Oh, hey, it's you again."
msgstr "Oh, hey, yine sensin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "You're back, and still alive!  Whoa."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Aw hey, look who's back."
msgstr "Ah hey, bak kim geri dönmüş."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, kid.  What's up?"
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, çocuk.  Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Hi, Aleesha.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Aleesha. Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Hi Aleesha, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Hi Aleesha.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "I'm not a kid, okay?  I'm sixteen."
msgstr "Ben çocuk değilim, tamam mı? On altı yaşındayım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "I'm not a kid, okay?  I'm fifteen."
msgstr "Ben çocuk değilim, tamam mı? On beş yaşındayım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "I'm not a kid, okay?  I'm fourteen."
msgstr "Ben çocuk değilim, tamam mı? On dört yaşındayım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean anything by it.  What's up?"
msgstr "Üzgünüm, bunu kastetmedim. Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean anything by it.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"We're just standing around here waiting, like a bunch of idiots.  We're "
"supposedly waiting to go downstairs to the shelter, but it's been over a "
"month.  I don't think it's happening.  I don't know what we're doing here.  "
"I've read all the books, and there's zombies outside so we're stuck in here."
"  We can hear them at night."
msgstr ""
"Burada durup bekliyoruz, bir grup aptal gibi. Aşağıdaki sığınak için "
"beklediğimiz söyleniyor ama bir aydan fazla oldu. Olacağını sanmıyorum. "
"Burada ne yaptığımızı bilmiyorum. Tüm kitapları okudum ve dışarıda zombiler "
"var, bu yüzden burada sıkışıp kaldık. Gece onları duyabiliyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what's up.  I'm not sure what we've even doing here.  They say "
"we're supposed to wait until we can be moved to the shelter downstairs, but "
"we've been here days and there's no word on how long we'll be waiting.  It's"
" all so stupid, and nobody can tell me anything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"You can't just go asking people questions like that nowadays.  I'm a "
"teenaged girl alone in an evacuation center after, like, literally everyone "
"in the world died and came back as zombies.  What do you think my story is?"
"  My entire family died, came back as zombies, and I somehow wound up here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Who takes care of you here?"
msgstr "Burada sana kim bakıyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"Nobody really.  I'm old enough to work and get merch for my rations.  Jenny "
"and Rhy look out for me though.  They think I don't notice that they're "
"looking out for me, but I do.  It's okay, they're both cool."
msgstr ""
"Gerçekten kimse. Çalışacak kadar büyüğüm ve rasyonlarım için malzeme "
"alabiliyorum. Ama Jenny ve Rhy benim için göz kulak oluyor. Beni "
"gözetlediklerini fark etmediğimi düşünüyorlar ama fark ediyorum. Sorun "
"değil, ikisi de havalı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"I don't have much of a hot take besides what I just said.  It's shit.  Not "
"enough to do to stay busy, not enough to eat, and even if I had internet, "
"all the YouTubers I follow are dead."
msgstr ""
"Sadece söylediklerim dışında pek bir görüşüm yok. Berbat. Meşgul kalacak "
"yeterince iş yok, yiyecek yok ve internetim olsa bile takip ettiğim tüm "
"YouTuber'lar ölü."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Boris Borichenko"
msgstr "Boris Borichenko"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Is there anything I can help you out with?"
msgstr "Size yardımcı olabileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Got anything else I can help out with?"
msgstr "Başka yardımcı olabileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"So, have you had a chance to get that laptop working and look at it yet?"
msgstr ""
"Yani, o dizüstü bilgisayarı çalıştırma şansın oldu mu ve ona baktın mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "You don't seem to be doing great."
msgstr "İyi görünmüyorsun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Well, well.  I'm glad you are back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hello again, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "It is good to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ah, another new face.  Hello.  I am Boris."
msgstr "Ah, başka bir yeni yüz. Merhaba. Ben Boris."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Boris."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Boris."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hi, Boris.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Boris.  Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Good to see you, Boris.  Are things looking up for you at all?"
msgstr "Seni görmek güzel, Boris. Hayatında bir şeyler yolunda mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hi Boris, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hi Boris.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "It is nice to meet you too.  To what do I owe the pleasure?"
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum. Bu keyfi neye borçluyum?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a traveler, taking the chance to have some living human company.  "
"What's up in your life these days?"
msgstr ""
"Ben sadece bir gezginim, biraz insan şirketi bulma şansını "
"değerlendiriyorum. Bu günlerde hayatında neler var?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "I just wanted to say hi.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"What is \"up\"?  Less than I would like, it seems.  I am better when I am "
"busy, and I am not at all busy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"It is good to see you too.  I would not say things are looking \"up\" yet, "
"but they are not so much looking down perhaps.  I am keeping a bit busier."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Want to talk about it a little?"
msgstr "Bunun hakkında biraz konuşmak ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"I was a carpenter.  I like to keep my hands busy, especially when I am "
"stressed.  Now, here I am, picking my nose and stuck thinking about my "
"problems and all that I've lost."
msgstr ""
"Ben bir marangozdum. Ellerimi meşgul tutmayı seviyorum, özellikle stresli "
"olduğumda. Şimdi buradayım, burnumu karıştırıyorum ve kaybettiklerim ve "
"sorunlarım hakkında düşünmekte sıkışıp kaldım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "What have you lost, if it's okay for me to ask?"
msgstr "Eğer sormamda bir sakınca yoksa, ne kaybettin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"It seems like carpentry work would be something the Free Merchants need.  "
"Why are you so bored?"
msgstr ""
"Ahşap işçiliği, Özgür Tüccarların ihtiyaç duyduğu bir şey gibi görünüyor. "
"Neden bu kadar sıkıldın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Now that things are cleaned up in the back, is there anything holding you "
"back from working?"
msgstr "Arka taraf temizlendiğine göre, çalışmanı engelleyen bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"No, not great.  Like all here, I have lost too much.  I do not feel I can "
"ever come back from it.  Can anyone be strong enough?"
msgstr ""
"Hayır, pek iyi değil. Buradaki herkes gibi, çok şey kaybettim. Bunun "
"üstesinden gelebileceğimi hissetmiyorum. Kimse yeterince güçlü olabilir mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"I would rather talk about what I have left: my husband, Stan, and his "
"brother Garry, my best friend.  Without them, I'd be lost myself.  What "
"we've lost is more than anyone should have to think about."
msgstr ""
"Kalanlarım hakkında konuşmayı tercih ederim: kocam Stan ve en iyi arkadaşım "
"Garry, onun kardeşi. Onlar olmadan kaybolmuş olurdum. Kaybettiklerimiz, "
"kimsenin düşünmesi gereken bir şeyden daha fazlası."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  I'd better get going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"…Ash.  His name was Ash, and he was ten years old.  Such a light, a spark.  "
"I wanted to see the man he would grow into.  I… now I can barely say his "
"name.  I miss him so much, every instant.  If I did not have Stan, I would "
"walk out through the barbed wire and join the walking dead."
msgstr ""
"…Ash. Onun adı Ash'ti ve on yaşındaydı. Ne kadar bir ışık, bir kıvılcım. "
"Büyüyeceği adamı görmek istiyordum. Şimdi adını söylemekte zorlanıyorum. Onu"
" her an çok özlüyorum. Stan olmasaydı, tel örgüden geçip yürüyen ölülerle "
"birlikte olurdum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  Tell me more about Ash."
msgstr "Kaybın için üzgünüm. Ash hakkında daha fazla bilgi ver."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"We've all lost a lot of people.  You can either let yourself die, or learn "
"to survive."
msgstr ""
"Hepimiz birçok insan kaybettik. Ya kendini öldürmene izin verirsin ya da "
"hayatta kalmayı öğrenirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm so sorry, man.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  I'd better get going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"I could talk forever, but it's hard to make the words come.  He was so "
"*smart*.  Always on the computer, writing stories and programming silly "
"games in Scratch.  He had a little robotics toy he made walk around and do "
"funny dances.  It was a challenge to make him play with his friends "
"sometimes, he would get so far into himself and buried in that thing.  So "
"tough to be a parent, you know?  It is good for him to write, to learn, but "
"he also needs to socialize and have friends.  He'll grow out… he…"
msgstr ""
"Sonsuza kadar konuşabilirim ama kelimeleri çıkarmak zor. O kadar *zekiydi*. "
"Sürekli bilgisayarda, hikayeler yazıyor ve Scratch'te komik oyunlar "
"programlıyordu. Yürüyüp komik danslar yapan küçük bir robotik oyuncağı "
"vardı. Bazen arkadaşlarıyla oynaması zor oluyordu, kendine o kadar dalıyordu"
" ki o şeyin içinde kayboluyordu. Ebeveyn olmak çok zor, biliyor musun? "
"Yazması, öğrenmesi iyi ama aynı zamanda sosyalleşmesi ve arkadaş edinmesi de"
" gerekiyor. Büyüyecek... o..."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Do you have any of his writing?"
msgstr "Onun yazılarından herhangi biri var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"No.  In the evacuation shelter, distracted by grief, I forgot it.  We were "
"rushed onto the bus so quickly, and… well, I don't remember much of that "
"time.  His work was all saved on the hard drive, we thought we could "
"download it from the cloud when we arrived but, well, there is no cloud now."
"  Even if there were, it would only have his writing, not his little games, "
"his silly voice recordings."
msgstr ""
"Hayır. Tahliye sığınaklarında, yas içinde dikkatim dağılmıştı, onu unuttum. "
"O kadar hızlı bir şekilde otobüse bindirildik ki… işte, o zamanla ilgili pek"
" bir şey hatırlamıyorum. Onun çalışmaları tamamen sabit diskteydi, "
"geldiğimizde buluttan indirebileceğimizi düşündük ama, işte, şimdi bulut "
"yok. Olsa bile, sadece onun yazıları olurdu, küçük oyunları değil, komik ses"
" kayıtları değil."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Well, now that you mention it, with the back bay cleared I could probably "
"set up back there and start work.  I don't know if I can handle it.  The "
"last time I was back there was the last time I saw…  If… if someone were to "
"clean up back there, wipe away some memories, then I could start renovating "
"it into a better living space."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"There isn't much to do with a hammer and a saw here indoors, and working "
"outside is too dangerous.  If we had enough space for me to do some "
"shuffling around, I could build some privacy walls in here.  I tried to set "
"up a bit of a shop in the garage space, but I had to keep taking everything "
"down for caravan loading and unloading and couldn't get anything done.  The "
"caravans bring food, so they get priority, I can't argue with that."
msgstr ""
"İçeride bir çekiç ve bir testere ile yapacak pek bir şey yok ve dışarıda "
"çalışmak çok tehlikeli. Eğer etrafta biraz hareket edebileceğim kadar alan "
"olsaydı, burada biraz mahremiyet duvarları inşa edebilirdim. Garaj alanında "
"biraz dükkan kurmaya çalıştım ama karavan yükleme ve boşaltma için her şeyi "
"sürekli indirmek zorunda kaldım ve hiçbir şey yapamadım. Karavanlar yiyecek "
"getiriyor, bu yüzden önceliği onlar alıyor, buna itiraz edemem."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "What do you need to get things cleaned up?  Can I help?"
msgstr "Eşyaları temizlemek için neye ihtiyacın var? Yardımcı olabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"We could put together a little clean up group, but everyone here has "
"terrible memories of that place.  I could not ask anyone here to go back and"
" see the leftovers of people we knew.  Still, it's a big job.  Who here "
"might be able to do it?"
msgstr ""
"Küçük bir temizlik grubu oluşturabiliriz ama burada herkesin o yerle ilgili "
"kötü anıları var. Buradaki hiç kimseye geri dönüp tanıdığımız insanların "
"kalıntılarına bakmasını isteyemezdim. Yine de, bu büyük bir iş. Burada bunu "
"yapabilecek kimse var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sure there's someone.  Would you like me to ask around?"
msgstr "Eminim birisi vardır. Sormamı ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Everyone agrees this is bad.  Sleeping on a cot on the floor, crowded in "
"with strangers, woken by zombies in the night.  To me, though, that is all "
"just a drop in the bucket.  What is killing me is being forced to sit with "
"nothing but my thoughts of what I've lost."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"It was difficult at first, but yes, I did.  It hurts, but it is good.  I am "
"so proud of him.  Would you like to see some… some of what you brought me?"
msgstr ""
"Başlangıçta zorlayıcıydı, ama evet, yaptım. Acıyor, ama iyi. Onunla çok "
"gurur duyuyorum. Bana getirdiğin bazı… bazı şeyleri görmek ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Sure, my friend.  I'd love to hear you brag about your boy."
msgstr "Tabii ki, dostum. Oğlundan övünmeyi duymak isterim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"That sounds a bit heavy for me right now, let's talk about something else"
msgstr ""
"Bu şu anda benim için biraz ağır geliyor, başka bir şeyden bahsedelim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Not today, I have to get going.  Just glad I was able to help."
msgstr "Bugün değil, gitmem gerekiyor. Yardım edebildiğim için mutluyum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"[Boris boots up the laptop and opens a folder labelled 'ART'.  He shows you "
"simple digital paintings, clearly done by an adolescent.  There's nothing "
"terribly remarkable about them except the number: Ash was a prolific "
"creator.  Boris goes through several, proudly showing how his son learned "
"little lighting tricks, or reminiscing on the time his son showed him the "
"art.  After a while, he stops commenting and just continues quietly clicking"
" through photos.  He seems different in the glow of the screen, like several"
" years dropped away from his face, despite the deep sadness still etched "
"there.]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"[Boris boots up the laptop and opens a folder labelled 'STORY 1'.  In it are"
" numerous text files containing smatterings of stream-of-conscious notes, "
"copy-and-pasted bits of fanfictions, notes about how to write a novel, and "
"more.  The story itself is a handful of poorly fleshed out chapters written "
"with the quality level you'd expect from a grade schooler.  Nonetheless it's"
" quite impressive that there's this much stuff on a single topic.  Boris "
"talks for a while about dinner conversations for weeks that wuold focus on "
"Ash's ideas for his stories.  After a while, he trails off and just "
"continues fliping through the files, reading silently.]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"[Boris boots up the laptop and opens the videos folder.  He shows you "
"several self-made videos that follow a loose blog style, of an awkward young"
" man talking about his favorite games, interspersed with comments about art "
"and writing.  Boris comments on little events and laughs a few times, before"
" becoming engrossed in his reminiscence.]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "(Leave Boris alone for now)"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Have you had a problem with memory, friend?  I was the one who asked you "
"this, I thought I explained why I could not."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Oh.  Right.  It's been a long apocalypse.  What were you saying?"
msgstr "Ah. Doğru. Uzun bir kıyamet geçti. Ne diyordun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Sorry.  I didn't notice which dialogue option I was selecting.  I'll just "
"back away slowly now."
msgstr ""
"Üzgünüm. Hangi diyalog seçeneğini seçtiğimi fark etmedim. Şimdi yavaşça geri"
" çekileceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
msgstr "Arka koyu temizleyecek birini bul."

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Find someone to clean up the back
#. bay.'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Boris in the refugee center is looking for at least five people to help "
"clean up the back bay"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Find a few people able to help clean the back, people without too much "
"trauma there."
msgstr ""
"Arka tarafı temizlemeye yardımcı olabilecek birkaç kişi bul, orada fazla "
"travması olmayan insanlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Yes, please.  If you can ask around for someone who can help, I can gather "
"the tools they will need and some payment for them."
msgstr ""
"Evet, lütfen. Eğer yardımcı olabilecek birini sormak istersen, ihtiyaç "
"duyacakları aletleri ve onlara bir ödeme toplarım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "You are a kind soul."
msgstr "Sen nazik bir ruhsun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ah well.  I can ask around myself, perhaps."
msgstr "Ah, peki. Kendim de etrafa sorabilirim, belki."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Those of us here in the back have too many bad memories, but perhaps someone"
" who didn't come with the original refugee groups would be less burdened."
msgstr ""
"Burada arka tarafta bulunanlarımızın çok fazla kötü anısı var, ama belki de "
"orijinal mülteci gruplarıyla gelmeyen biri daha az yük taşır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Greetings, my friend.  Have you found anyone?"
msgstr "Selamlar, dostum. Herhangi birini bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"This has great promise.  Perhaps something to keep me busy will help.  Here,"
" I found some small money to thank you."
msgstr ""
"Bu büyük bir umut vadediyor. Belki beni meşgul edecek bir şey yardımcı olur."
" İşte, sana teşekkür etmek için biraz para buldum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I see…  Well I shall get things in order!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "No worries.  Let me know if you want to try again."
msgstr "Endişelenme. Tekrar denemek istersen bana haber ver."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find a circular saw."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find a circular saw for Boris."
msgstr "Boris için bir dairesel testere bul."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"We now have a space to work in, and I have wood and nails to spare.  All I "
"need is a saw.  I would love tablesaw and mitre saw, but I can work with a "
"hand held circular saw for now.  I have looked, and what we have is garbage."
"  Can you bring me a good one?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"It is not hard to find.  I have even seen them for sale at the merchants, "
"but they save them as trade goods and will not give me as a gift."
msgstr ""
"Bulmak zor değil. Onları tüccarlarda satışta bile gördüm ama onları ticaret "
"malı olarak saklıyorlar ve bana hediye vermiyorlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Greetings, my friend.  Have you found a saw I can use?"
msgstr "Selamlar, dostum. Kullanabileceğim bir testere bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Ah, good.  VonWalt is good brand, I had a saw like this at home.  Now I "
"shall set to work, and make myself a shop back there.  Oh yes, here is a "
"little payment I saved."
msgstr ""
"Ah, iyi. VonWalt iyi bir marka, evde böyle bir testereye sahip olmuştum. "
"Şimdi işe koyulacağım ve orada kendime bir dükkan yapacağım. Oh evet, burada"
" biraz ödeme biriktirdim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I see…"
msgstr "Anlıyorum..."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Bring Boris his son's lost writing."
msgstr "Boris'e oğlunun kaybolan yazısını getir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Find Boris' son's laptop."
msgstr "Boris'in oğlunun dizüstü bilgisayarını bulun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"If you can find it, it would mean so much to me.  I will give you directions"
" to the shelter where he left it.  It was barely a shelter, broken and torn "
"apart.  It should just be on the floor where it was dropped."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "You can tell it is his because he covered it in stickers."
msgstr "Onun olduğunu anlayabilirsin çünkü üzerine çıkartmalar yapıştırmıştı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"I know it is a hard thing to hope, but were you able to find Ash's laptop?"
msgstr ""
"Umut etmek zor bir şey olduğunu biliyorum ama Ash'in dizüstü bilgisayarını "
"bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"It is so strange to see this again, like a little piece of my old life.  I "
"don't know if I can bring myself to read what's on it yet, but having this "
"piece of him is a great comfort."
msgstr ""
"Bunu tekrar görmek çok garip, eski hayatımdan küçük bir parça gibi. "
"Üzerindekileri okumaya kendimi getirebilir miyim bilmiyorum ama onun bu "
"parçasına sahip olmak büyük bir teselli."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Even that you tried means a lot to me."
msgstr "Denemiş olman bile benim için çok şey ifade ediyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ash's laptop computer"
msgid_plural "Ash's laptop computers"
msgstr[0] "Ash'in dizüstü bilgisayarı"
msgstr[1] "Ash'in dizüstü bilgisayarları"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Ash's laptop computer"}
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"A small, somewhat worn-out laptop computer.  The flip-top is decorated with "
"various stickers."
msgstr ""
"Küçük, biraz yıpranmış bir dizüstü bilgisayar. Kapak kısmı çeşitli "
"çıkartmalarla süslenmiş."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Dana Nunez"
msgstr "Dana Nunez"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I spoke to your husband about getting you a job at the Tacoma Ranch.  What "
"would you think about that?"
msgstr ""
"Eşinle Tacoma Ranch'ta sana bir iş bulmak hakkında konuştum. Bunun hakkında "
"ne düşünürsün?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Your husband said to ask you what you'd think about getting out of this "
"place and coming to work for me at my own camp."
msgstr ""
"Eşin, buradan çıkıp benim kampımda çalışmayı düşünür müsün diye sormanı "
"söyledi."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "About that sourdough starter you had me looking for…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Got any more bread I can trade flour for?"
msgstr "Un karşılığında takas edebileceğim başka ekmek var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Hi there.  I'm Dana, Dana Nunez.  Nice to see a new face."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Dana, hey?  Nice to meet you.  How are things here?"
msgstr "Dana, değil mi? Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum. Burada işler nasıl?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Dana.  What's your story?"
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Dana. Hikayen nedir?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Hi Dana, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Hello, nice to see you again.  What brings you around today?"
msgstr "Merhaba, seni tekrar görmek güzel.  Bugün seni buraya getiren ne?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "It's good to see you're still around."
msgstr "Hala burada olduğunu görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Hi Dana, nice to see you too.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I was working in a nice restaurant as a baker, until <the_cataclysm>.  I was"
" pregnant, and it was getting close to time to go on mat leave; lots of time"
" on my feet, getting up stupid-early to make pastries, you know.  Because of"
" the pregnancy we were evacuated early and shipped out this way, but our bus"
" was attacked in the chaos.  We managed to escape, but had to hike the rest "
"of the way, with the Singhs and a few other refugees that didn't make it.  I"
" lost the baby.  It wasn't a good time."
msgstr ""
"Güzel bir restoranda fırıncı olarak çalışıyordum, ta ki <the_cataclysm> "
"olana kadar.  Hamileydim ve doğum iznine çıkma zamanı yaklaşıyordu; ayakta "
"çok zaman geçiriyordum, hamur işleri yapmak için aptalca erken kalkıyordum, "
"biliyorsun.  Hamilelik nedeniyle erken tahliye edildik ve bu yöne "
"gönderildik, ama otobüsümüz kaos içinde saldırıya uğradı.  Kaçmayı başardık,"
" ama geri kalan yolu yürümek zorunda kaldık, Singhler ve hayatta kalamayan "
"birkaç mülteci ile birlikte.  Bebeğimi kaybettim.  İyi bir zaman değildi."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Have you done any baking lately?"
msgstr "Son zamanlarda hiç hamur işi yaptın mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss."
msgstr "Kaybınız için üzgünüm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "I'd better get going.  Bye, Dana."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "That sounds like a great deal, here's some flour for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "I got two merch for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Thanks for cutting me a deal, here's the six cups of flour."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "All right, one merch as agreed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Not since I last saw you, sorry.  Come by tomorrow and I'll try to keep a "
"loaf set aside for you, but they disappear fast."
msgstr ""
"Seni en son gördüğümden beri değil, üzgünüm. Yarın gel, senin için bir somun"
" ayırmaya çalışırım ama bunlar hızlıca tükeniyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I sure do, if you've got the flour or the merch for me, I'd be happy to "
"trade you another loaf."
msgstr ""
"Kesinlikle, eğer benim için un veya merch'in varsa, sana başka bir somunla "
"takas yapmaktan memnuniyet duyarım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I do a bit.  I got a sourdough starter going almost as soon as I arrived, "
"and it's making passable bread already.  I cooked some up yesterday "
"actually, I could probably trade a loaf of fresh bread for, say, about eight"
" cups of flour, or two merch."
msgstr ""
"Biraz yapıyorum. Geldiğim gibi ekşi mayalı hamur başlattım ve şimdiden "
"geçerli ekmek yapıyor. Aslında dün biraz pişirdim, muhtemelen taze bir somun"
" ekmek için, diyelim ki, yaklaşık sekiz kupa un veya iki merch ile takas "
"yapabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"[BARTER] Is that the lowest you can go?  I'd love some bread, but I can't "
"quite make that."
msgstr ""
"[BARTER] Bu en düşük fiyatın mı? Ekmek almak isterim ama bunu tam olarak "
"karşılayamam."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"[BARTER] Aw, c'mon.  I rescued Landough, can't you cut me a little deal?"
msgstr ""
"[BARTER] Ah, hadi ama. Landough'u kurtardım, bana biraz indirim yapamaz "
"mısın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Thanks, can we talk about something else?"
msgstr "Teşekkürler, başka bir şey hakkında konuşabilir miyiz?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "I'll look into that.  I'd better get going though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, it's not something I can bend on.  I don't make a big profit off "
"this, I use what I get to make more bread.  If I cut you a deal, I'll run "
"out of supplies."
msgstr ""
"Üzgünüm, bu konuda esneklik gösteremem. Buradan büyük bir kar elde "
"etmiyorum, aldıklarımı daha fazla ekmek yapmak için kullanıyorum. Sana bir "
"indirim yaparsam, malzemelerim tükenir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Well, I tried.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Thanks, but I think I'll pass.  I gotta run."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Oh, fine.  Six cups of flour, or one merch.  I'm not going any lower, I got "
"a business to run here."
msgstr ""
"Oh, tamam. Altı kupa un veya bir merch. Daha aşağıya inmiyorum, burada bir "
"işim var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"You know, I think I changed my mind.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "I guess I'm outta here then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"That's kind of you to say.  I'm doing my best to move on… it hurts, but in "
"the scale of things it could be worse.  Pablo and I still have each other, "
"that's a lot more than most."
msgstr ""
"Bunu söylemek nazik. Elimden gelenin en iyisini yapmaya çalışıyorum… acıyor,"
" ama her şeyin ölçeğinde daha kötü olabilirdi. Pablo ve ben hâlâ birbirimize"
" sahibiz, bu çoğu insandan çok daha fazla."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Great, here's a loaf of the best damn sourdough bread in the world.  I used "
"to make that claim as a joke, but I feel like now there's a fighting chance "
"nobody else can beat me."
msgstr ""
"Harika, işte dünyanın en iyi ekşi mayalı ekmeklerinden bir somun. Bunu şaka "
"olarak söylerdim ama şimdi kimsenin beni yenemeyeceği konusunda bir şansım "
"olduğunu hissediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Nice.  Enjoy the mighty bounty of Landough Calrisean."
msgstr "Güzel. Landough Calrisean'ın muazzam nimetinin tadını çıkar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Here you go, from the family recipe."
msgstr "İşte, aile tarifinden."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Hope you enjoy it as much as I do, this is the best damn bread in the world "
"now."
msgstr "Umarım benim kadar beğenirsin, bu artık dünyanın en iyi ekmeği."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Great, here's a loaf of my locally-famous, not-very-mature sourdough.  It's "
"not too bad honestly.  Everyone here seems to like it."
msgstr ""
"Harika, işte yerel olarak ünlü, çok olgunlaşmamış ekşi mayalı bir somun. "
"Gerçekten de fena değil. Buradaki herkes bunu seviyor gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"You seem pretty unhappy about the quality of your bread.  Is there something"
" I can do to help?"
msgstr ""
"Ekmek kalitenizden pek memnun görünmüyorsunuz. Size yardımcı olabileceğim "
"bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "It smells awesome.  I'm going to head out now, thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, not quite yet.  Landough was in pretty rough shape.  No fault of "
"yours, it was no good having him cooped up in a dank fridge for that long… "
"and I think my apprentice baker may have fucked with him before the "
"Cataclysm too.  He'd better hope he's a zombie now, because if I see him "
"alive… anyway, it's gonna take a few more feeds before I can get him ready "
"for prime time, check back in a couple days."
msgstr ""
"Üzgünüm, henüz değil. Landough oldukça kötü durumdaydı. Senin hatan değil, "
"onu o kadar uzun süre karanlık bir buzdolabında tutmak iyi değildi... ve "
"sanırım çırak fırıncım Kıyamet'ten önce onunla oynamış olabilir. Şimdi bir "
"zombi olmasını ummalı, çünkü onu canlı görürsem... her neyse, onu prime time"
" için hazırlamak için birkaç besleme daha almam gerekecek, birkaç gün içinde"
" kontrol et."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Things are tense at the best of times.  We didn't choose this crowd, so not "
"all of us really get along.  I like Jenny and Fatima, and the three of us "
"are kind of lucky to have friends here, but that doesn't make up for us "
"being a bunch of unfamiliar faces crammed into a tiny space.  Someone's "
"gonna murder someone soon, mark my words."
msgstr ""
"En iyi zamanlarda bile işler gergin. Bu kalabalığı biz seçmedik, bu yüzden "
"hepimiz gerçekten iyi geçinmiyoruz. Jenny ve Fatima'yı seviyorum ve üçümüz "
"burada arkadaşlarımız olduğu için şanslıyız ama bu, tanımadığımız yüzlerin "
"dar bir alana sıkışmış olmasını telafi etmiyor. Birisi yakında birisini "
"öldürecek, sözlerimi işaretle."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Have you heard anything back from the ranch about jobs yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Huh.  I've made a few friends here, but not so much as I'd stick around here"
" with no future prospects, hoping someone downstairs dies to make room for "
"me.  It does sound nice, if they're looking for more workers."
msgstr ""
"Hı. Burada birkaç arkadaş edindim ama gelecekteki beklentim olmadan burada "
"kalacak kadar değilim, aşağıda birinin ölmesini umarak. Daha fazla işçi "
"arıyorlarsa kulağa hoş geliyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I spoke to the foreman over at Tacoma Ranch.  If you're willing to put in "
"the work, they'll find some work for you over there."
msgstr ""
"Tacoma Ranch'taki ustabaşına konuştum. Eğer çalışmaya istekliysen, orada "
"senin için bir iş bulacaklar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "I'll look into that.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"All right.  I've taken some time to think about it, and I'm willing to go.  "
"I'm sure they'll have use for a baker over there, after all, and if I don't "
"get out of this place there's a very real chance I'm going to snap.  You can"
" go let Pablo know first hand, if you want; he's been pretty excited about "
"the idea."
msgstr ""
"Tamam. Üzerinde düşünmek için biraz zaman aldım ve gitmeye hazırım. Sonuçta "
"orada bir fırıncıya ihtiyaçları olacaktır ve bu yerden çıkmazsam gerçekten "
"sinirlerim bozulacak. İstersen Pablo'ya birinci elden haber verebilirsin; bu"
" fikir hakkında oldukça heyecanlıydı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Sure, I'll go tell him.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Sure, I'll go tell him.  I'd better get going though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Pablo's a little quicker on the trigger than I am.  We're trying to have a "
"baby, did you know that?  It's a bit crazy in this world, but I won't change"
" those plans.  Tell you what: if your camp has access to a doctor and some "
"medical facilities, in case I actually can get pregnant again, I would "
"consider getting out of here and signing up."
msgstr ""
"Pablo, tetikte benden biraz daha hızlı. Bir bebek sahibi olmaya çalışıyoruz,"
" bunu biliyor muydun? Bu dünyada biraz çılgınca ama bu planları "
"değiştirmeyeceğim. Şunu söyleyeyim: eğer kampınızda bir doktora ve bazı "
"tıbbi tesislere erişim varsa, gerçekten tekrar hamile kalabilirsem, buradan "
"çıkmayı ve kaydolmayı düşünebilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Find Dana's family sourdough culture"
msgstr "Dana'nın aile ekşi mayasını bul"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "I could get my real sourdough starter…"
msgstr "Gerçek ekşi maya başlatıcımı alabilirim…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"If you really like this second-rate bread, you could risk your life for "
"something actually worth it.  I left my actual sourdough starter back in the"
" bakery where I worked.  That baby is a hundred years old, and has been in "
"my family for generations… if you can bring him to me, I'll bake you the "
"finest bread you've ever had."
msgstr ""
"Eğer bu ikinci sınıf ekmeği gerçekten seviyorsan, aslında buna değer bir şey"
" için hayatını riske atabilirsin. Gerçek ekşi maya başlatıcımı çalıştığım "
"fırında bırakmıştım. O bebek yüz yaşında ve ailemde nesiller boyu var… eğer "
"onu bana getirebilirsen, sana şimdiye kadar yediğin en güzel ekmeği yaparım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Take care of yourself out there.  And listen, when you bring my sourdough "
"back, I don't want to see a scratch on him, you understand?"
msgstr ""
"Dışarıda kendine dikkat et. Ve dinle, ekşimi geri getirdiğinde, üzerinde en "
"ufak bir çizik bile görmek istemiyorum, anlıyor musun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I can understand why you think you wouldn't want to risk your life for a "
"bread starter.  You haven't tried that bread."
msgstr ""
"Bir ekmek başlatıcısı için hayatını riske atmak istemeyeceğini anlıyorum. O "
"ekmeği denemedin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"He'll be in the right-hand fridge, in a jar with a picture of the Millennium"
" Falcon on it."
msgstr ""
"O sağdaki buzdolabında, üzerinde Millennium Falcon resmi olan bir kavanozda "
"olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "So, you seen my sourdough starter?"
msgstr "Yani, benim ekşi maya başlatıcımı gördün mü?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Oh, you will not regret this.  He may not look like much, but he's got it "
"where it counts, kid.  It's gonna take me a few days to revive him after "
"being abandoned so long, but he'll be operational soon and then you can come"
" back for some real bread."
msgstr ""
"Oh, bundan pişman olmayacaksın. Görünüşü pek bir şey ifade etmiyor olabilir "
"ama önemli yerlerde işini görecek, çocuk. Uzun süre terk edildikten sonra "
"onu canlandırmam birkaç gün alacak ama yakında çalışır hale gelecek ve sonra"
" gerçek ekmek için geri gelebilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "This ain't it."
msgstr "Bu değil."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I am not sure if I'm gonna make it through the Cataclysm without my special "
"jar of goop."
msgstr ""
"Özel goop kavanozum olmadan Kıyamet'ten geçip geçemeyeceğimden emin değilim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Dana's family sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "Dana's family sourdough starter"
msgstr[0] "Dana'nın aile ekşi mayası"
msgstr[1] "Dana'nın aile ekşi mayaları"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': "Dana's family sourdough starter"}
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"This crusty old jar has a glow-in-the-dark Millennium Falcon decal on the "
"side, and a label that reads, \"Landough Calrisean.  Dana's.  Do not touch "
"on pain of death\".  It's been abandoned for some time and doesn't look like"
" it could be readily salvaged as a sourdough culture, but maybe an "
"experienced sourdough baker could manage it."
msgstr ""
"Bu çatlak eski kavanozun yanında karanlıkta parlayan Millennium Falcon "
"çıkartması var ve üzerinde \"Landough Calrisean. Dana'nın. Ölüm cezası ile "
"dokunmayın\" yazılı bir etiket var. Bir süredir terkedilmiş ve ekşi maya "
"kültürü olarak kolayca kurtarılacak gibi görünmüyor, ama belki deneyimli bir"
" ekşi maya fırıncısı bunu başarabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid "Dana's sourdough bread"
msgid_plural "Dana's sourdough breads"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Dana's sourdough bread"}
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"This round loaf of bread has a thick, dark crust, and smells very enticing."
msgstr ""
"Bu yuvarlak ekmek, kalın, koyu bir kabuğa sahip ve çok çekici bir kokusu "
"var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"*sits in a surprisingly well-built room made of lovingly assembled cardboard"
" boxes.  The area is quite clean and cozy.  The whole building is built on "
"top of cargo pallets, insulated with scraps, and waterproofed with plastic."
"  It shows an unexpected amount of design prowess.  \"Hello, my noble knight"
" errant,\" Dave intones, his voice solemn.  \"We owe you a great debt for "
"your actions of the past.  Some day, we shall repay it.  Until then, you are"
" welcome here, now and always.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Hi Dave.  You seem different."
msgstr "Merhaba Dave. Farklı görünüyorsun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "How are things going up here on the roof?"
msgstr "Burada çatıda işler nasıl gidiyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "Always good to catch up, Dave.  Keep on being you."
msgstr "Görüşmek her zaman güzel, Dave. Kendin olmaya devam et."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"*nods deeply.  \"We are, for where we once were in chaos, now we are at "
"peace.  In time, this shall bring wisdom, but we must ponder on these great "
"changes.\""
msgstr ""
"*derin bir şekilde başını sallıyor. \"Biz, bir zamanlar kaos içinde "
"olduğumuz yerden, şimdi barış içindeyiz. Zamanla, bu bilgelik getirecek, ama"
" bu büyük değişiklikler üzerinde düşünmeliyiz.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Were you like this, uh, before?  Did you used to have a doctor or anything?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"\"We were… I… we can scarcely remember those times.\"  Dave looks pained.  "
"\"No, we had no doctor.  We didn't need one.  We had a job and… and… we "
"don't like to talk about this.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"Come on, Dave.  We're friends.  I won't use this against you or anything."
msgstr ""
"Hadi ama, Dave. Biz arkadaşız. Bunu senin aleyhine kullanmayacağım ya da "
"başka bir şey."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"*winces.  \"It is true.  You have earned some truth, but we… we find it hard"
" to give.  We had a job, an education.  Prestige.  It is all very faint "
"now.\"  He touches a stainless steel ring on his pinky finger, looking lost "
"in thought.  \"We don't know why that man left, and this one remains.  "
"Perhaps that is some wisdom that will come with time, or perhaps it is a "
"door best left closed.\""
msgstr ""
"*inceden sızlanır. \"Bu doğru. Biraz gerçeği hak ettin, ama biz… vermekte "
"zorlanıyoruz. Bir işimiz, bir eğitimimiz vardı. Prestij. Şimdi hepsi çok "
"silik.\"  Serçe parmağındaki paslanmaz çelik yüzüğe dokunuyor, düşüncelere "
"dalmış görünüyor. \"O adamın neden gittiğini, bu adamın neden kaldığını "
"bilmiyoruz. Belki bu, zamanla gelecek bir bilgeliktir, ya da belki de kapalı"
" kalması gereken bir kapıdır.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid ""
"*gestures about his new home.  \"We have everything we wanted.  They cannot "
"see us here, and our mind is at peace.  We go outside as we need, and the "
"safety we have received here stays with us, as long as we are careful about "
"it.  In time, perhaps we will again have need of your noble services.\""
msgstr ""
"*Yeni evine işaret eder. \"İstediğimiz her şeye sahibiz. Burada bizi "
"göremezler ve aklımız huzur içinde. İhtiyacımız olduğunda dışarı çıkıyoruz "
"ve burada aldığımız güvenlik bizimle kalıyor, dikkatli olduğumuz sürece. "
"Zamanla, belki yine senin asil hizmetlerine ihtiyaç duyacağız.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dino_Dave.json
msgid "You seem different."
msgstr "Farklı görünüyorsun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Draco Dune"
msgstr "Draco Dune"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well now, good to see another new face!  Welcome to the center, friend, I'm "
"Draco."
msgstr ""
"Şimdi, başka bir yeni yüzü görmek güzel! Merkezde hoş geldin, dostum, ben "
"Draco."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Draco."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Draco."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi, Draco, how are you doing?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Draco, nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi again, Draco, nice to see you too."
msgstr "Yine merhaba, Draco, seni görmek de güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi Draco, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi Draco, nice to see you too.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you too.  What brings you to these parts?  Got any stories to "
"share?  Happy ones, hopefully… we've had our fill of sadness around here."
msgstr ""
"Seni tanımak güzel. Buralara ne getirdi seni? Paylaşacak hikayelerin var mı?"
" Umarım mutlu hikayelerdir… burada üzüntüden fazlasını yaşadık."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "What about you, how're you doing?"
msgstr "Ya sen, nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Yeah, it's tough everywhere.  Well, bye."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well, look at you.  Asking after random folks like some sort of shepherd!  "
"No, don't take offense now… I mean it well.  We could use more folks askin' "
"after other folks.  I figure it makes the world go round, now, more than "
"ever.  I'm well, friend, considering I have both of my legs and much of my "
"health left to me.  A bit of pain in the back, but can't really complain "
"much if that's the worst of it, right?  You look like you've had a story of "
"your own to tell, just getting here.  I'm writing it in my imagination right"
" now.  Fought through countless hordes, run ragged, chased at every turn, "
"yeah, no thank-you any more of that for me!"
msgstr ""
"Bak sen, rastgele insanları soruyorsun sanki bir çoban gibisin! Hayır, şimdi"
" alınma… bunu iyi niyetle söylüyorum. Başkalarını soran daha fazla insana "
"ihtiyacımız var. Bence bu, dünyayı döndürüyor, şimdi her zamankinden daha "
"fazla. İyiyim, dostum, iki bacağım ve sağlığımın çoğu bende olduğu için. "
"Sırtımda biraz ağrı var ama eğer bu en kötüsü ise pek şikayet edemem, değil "
"mi? Buraya gelirken kendi hikayeni anlatacak gibi görünüyorsun. Şu anda onu "
"hayal gücümde yazıyorum. Sayısız kalabalıkla savaştım, yorgun düştüm, her "
"köşede peşime düştüler, evet, artık bunun için teşekkürler!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "What about you, what's your story?"
msgstr "Ya sen, hikayen ne?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No more indeed."
msgstr "Gerçekten daha fazla yok."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Oh you don't have time for all that, do you?  Well, I'll give you the short "
"version.  I've gotten kinda tired of it in the telling.  Frankly, it's not "
"as heroic, not as inspiring, not as tragic, and certainly not as funny as "
"some of the tales around here.  But it's mine, ya know?  I'm a musician.  "
"Guitar's my baby.  You like folk and the blues, friend?  Well, that was my "
"bag and I sure could please my own ear with em, anyway.  Folks who's bein' "
"generous might also say it pleased theirs.  Problem is, I seem to be between"
" guitars right now, you know?  Temporarily guitar-light, if you get my "
"saying.  Problem is, in the run for my life, I had to use old Jasmine as a "
"bit of a billy club.  Had to curb some rowdy dudes on my way here.  It was "
"her or me, you understand?  You wouldn't begrudge a man breakin' his "
"instrument to save his life, would ya?"
msgstr ""
"Ah, bunlar için zamanın yok, öyle mi? Kısa versiyonunu vereyim. Anlatmaktan "
"biraz yoruldum. Açıkçası, bu hikaye o kadar kahramanca değil, o kadar ilham "
"verici değil, o kadar trajik değil ve kesinlikle buradaki bazı hikayeler "
"kadar komik değil. Ama bu benim, biliyor musun? Ben bir müzisyenim. Gitar "
"benim bebeğim. Halk müziği ve blues'u sever misin, dostum? İşte, bu benim "
"işimdi ve onları dinlemekten keyif alıyordum. Cömert olanlar, onların da "
"hoşuna gittiğini söyleyebilir. Sorun şu ki, şu anda gitarlarım arasında "
"kaldım, biliyor musun? Geçici olarak gitar eksikliği yaşıyorum, eğer ne "
"demek istediğimi anlıyorsan. Sorun şu ki, hayatım için koşarken, eski "
"Jasmine'i bir sopa gibi kullanmak zorunda kaldım. Buraya gelirken biraz "
"yaramaz adamları dizginlemek zorunda kaldım. Ya o ya ben, anlıyor musun? Bir"
" adamın hayatını kurtarmak için enstrümanını kırmasına kızmazsın, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I think I would've done the same.  Nobody around here has a guitar?"
msgstr "Aynısını yapardım sanırım. Burada hiç gitar yok mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Yes, yes I would… you monster."
msgstr "Evet, evet yapardım… canavar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Would you believe that they don't!  Not a one in the whole place.  Well, "
"maybe downstairs, but that's a different matter, isn't it?  Say, you're not "
"planning on sticking around, right?  You're a free-roller, not a settler, "
"seems like to me.  Don't know if I could beg or cajole you into maybe "
"keepin' an ear out for a new guitar for me?  There gotta still be plenty out"
" there not gettin' any love these days.  Whattya say?  Help an old man play "
"some blues?  Would be good to have some real music around this place.  Be "
"good for PEOPLE, you know what I'm sayin'?"
msgstr ""
"Onların olmadığını inanır mısın! Tüm yerde bir tane bile yok. Belki aşağıda "
"vardır ama o başka bir mesele, değil mi? Dediğim gibi, burada kalmayı "
"planlamıyorsun, değil mi? Sen özgür bir gezginsin, yerleşimci değil, bana "
"öyle geliyor. Belki yeni bir gitar bulmam için senden yardım isteyebilir "
"miyim? Bu günlerde hala sevgi görmeyen birçok gitar olmalı. Ne dersin? Yaşlı"
" bir adamın blues çalmasına yardım eder misin? Bu yerin etrafında gerçek "
"müzik olması iyi olurdu. İNSANLAR için iyi olurdu, ne demek istediğimi "
"anlıyorsun, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Where would we be without music?"
msgstr "Müzik olmadan nerede olurduk?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"You're aware that the world has ended, right?  I've got real problems to "
"deal with.  You're on your own."
msgstr ""
"Dünyanın sona erdiğinin farkındasın, değil mi? Gerçek sorunlarla başa çıkmam"
" gerekiyor. Kendi başınasın."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Let me ask you something.  What type are you?"
msgstr "Bana bir şey sorabilir miyim? Hangi türdensin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Uhh, what do you mean?"
msgstr "Eee, ne demek istiyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'll tell you what type I am."
msgstr "Hangi türde olduğumu söyleyeceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No, not playing this game."
msgstr "Hayır, bu oyunu oynamıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "You know, what kinda person are you?  What motivates you?"
msgstr "Biliyorsun, ne tür bir insansın? Seni ne motive ediyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Leaving."
msgstr "Ayrılıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "So then, what type are you?"
msgstr "O halde, hangi türdensin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The 'just getting by' type."
msgstr "'Geçinmeye çalışan' türü."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The serious type."
msgstr "Ciddi tür."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The zany type."
msgstr "Çılgın tür."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I fight stuff."
msgstr "Ben şeylerle savaşıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I want to see it all."
msgstr "Her şeyi görmek istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The 'doesn't have time for this' type."
msgstr "'Bunun için zamanı yok' türü."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  You can understand how folks be wantin' some liveliness in these "
"times.  Some music sure would help with that.  Damn, I miss it.  All I hear "
"is those MP3 players with their tin-can drum machines and whiny vocals.  "
"Help me find a guitar and we'll really get this place smokin'!"
msgstr ""
"Ben de! İnsanların bu zamanlarda biraz canlılık istemesini anlayabiliyorum. "
"Biraz müzik kesinlikle buna yardımcı olurdu. Kahretsin, onu özlüyorum. "
"Duyduğum tek şey, teneke davul makineleri ve mızmız vokalleriyle o MP3 "
"çalarlar. Bana bir gitar bulmama yardım et, bu yeri gerçekten "
"hareketlendirelim!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I could be persuaded."
msgstr "İkna edilebilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "It's called dub-step and I like it.  Goodbye, old man."
msgstr "Buna dub-step deniyor ve hoşuma gidiyor. Hoşça kal, yaşlı adam."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  Times are hard for folks and that's no laughing matter.  People "
"need some normality in these times.  Some reminders of how things used to "
"be.  I think a sing-along or two could do folks good."
msgstr ""
"Ben de! İnsanlar için zamanlar zor ve bu gülünecek bir durum değil. "
"İnsanların bu zamanlarda biraz normalliğe ihtiyacı var. Eskiden nasıl "
"olduğunu hatırlatan bazı şeyler. Bir veya iki şarkı söyleme etkinliği "
"insanların işine yarayabilir diye düşünüyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Couldn't hurt."
msgstr "Zararı olmaz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I don't need to hear amateur-hour karaoke around here.  Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  I did stand-up comedy at a club once.  Well, outside a club anyway."
"  You know what'd be funny?  Next time one of those stupid ferals starts "
"running around chasing after a squirrel or something, if I had me a guitar I"
" could play the Benny Hill tune and get everybody crackin' up.  Places needs"
" some laughter badly."
msgstr ""
"Ben de! Bir keresinde bir kulüpte stand-up komedi yaptım. Neyse ki, bir "
"kulüp dışında. Ne komik olurdu biliyor musun? Bir sonraki o aptal vahşi "
"hayvanlardan biri bir sincap peşinde koşmaya başladığında, elimde bir gitar "
"olsaydı Benny Hill melodisini çalabilirdim ve herkes gülmekten kırılırdı. Bu"
" yerin gerçekten biraz gülmeye ihtiyacı var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "That'd be awesome."
msgstr "Bu harika olurdu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, wouldn't be so funny when Zed heard all the sound and broke in.  Be "
"responsible."
msgstr ""
"Evet, Zed tüm sesi duyup içeri girdiğinde o kadar komik olmazdı. Sorumlu ol."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too.  It's fight a stay afloat in these times.  Some music would lift all"
" spirits, though, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"Ben de. Bu zamanlarda ayakta kalmak için savaşmak zorundayız. Ama biraz "
"müzik ruhları yükseltir, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Can you play heavy metal on an acoustic guitar?"
msgstr "Akustik gitarda heavy metal çalabilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Boring.  I'm going to go destroy something."
msgstr "Sıkıcı. Bir şeyi yok etmeye gideceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  For now, anyway, that's not really possible for me.  I mean, I "
"guess you know better than me about that.  Man, I used to travel all around."
"  Saw halfa the States with my guitar on my back.  Now, though, well, I "
"think I'll stay inside til this all flies over."
msgstr ""
"Ben de! Şu an için, bu benim için gerçekten mümkün değil. Yani, sanırım bu "
"konuda benden daha iyi biliyorsun. Adamım, eskiden her yere seyahat ederdim."
" Sırtımda gitarımla Amerika'nın yarısını gördüm. Ama şimdi, sanırım bu her "
"şey geçene kadar içeride kalacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Maybe I could help with something?"
msgstr "Belki bir şeye yardım edebilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Well then, I'll leave you here where it's safe."
msgstr "O zaman, seni burada güvenli bir yerde bırakacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"My savior!  My patron of the arts!  You're always welcome here, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Man, just imagine what I could do with a new guitar."
msgstr "Adamım, yeni bir gitarla neler yapabileceğimi bir düşün."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Let's talk about getting you that guitar."
msgstr "Sana o gitarı almayı konuşalım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I've been thinking about that deal you mentioned."
msgstr "Bahsettiğin anlaşmayı düşünüyordum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Anything you buying or selling, by chance?"
msgstr "Herhangi bir şey alıp satıyor musun, acaba?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "See you around, Draco."
msgstr "Görüşürüz, Draco."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well now, my friend-o!  You just asked a mighty fine question.  Folks have "
"been missing the little things in life.  New shoes, new cellphones, can't "
"exactly go shopping, or, well, I guess you sorta can, if you mind the broken"
" glass.  I left my wallet in an outdoorsman's store when I 'bought' this "
"warmer coat.  Figured that's kinda it, you know?  It didn't matter anymore."
"  I don't think my insurance's going to pay out for any health care I get "
"now.  I did what you see in the movies though, I rolled a joint with a "
"hundred dollar bill.  Ended up coughing and rerolling it in regular paper "
"though.  Was too harsh.  Just letting you know in case you get the smart "
"idea of trying it."
msgstr ""
"Şimdi, dostum! Harika bir soru sordun. İnsanlar hayattaki küçük şeyleri "
"özlüyor. Yeni ayakkabılar, yeni cep telefonları, alışverişe çıkmak pek "
"mümkün değil, ya da, sanırım biraz mümkün, eğer kırık camlara dikkat "
"edersen. Bu sıcak ceketi 'aldığımda' bir dış giyim mağazasında cüzdanımı "
"unuttum. Bunun böyle olduğunu düşündüm, anlıyor musun? Artık önemi yoktu. Şu"
" anda aldığım sağlık hizmetleri için sigortamın ödeme yapacağını sanmıyorum."
" Ama filmlerde gördüğün gibi yaptım, yüz dolarlık bir banknotla bir sigara "
"sardım. Ama sonunda öksürüp normal kağıtta yeniden sardım. Çok sertti. "
"Denemek gibi akıllıca bir fikrin olursa haberin olsun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "Devam et."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Say, I don't mean to get you in any trouble or nothing, if any folks still "
"care about that, but you haven't seen any green around town, have ya?"
msgstr ""
"Dediğim gibi, seni başını belaya sokmak istemiyorum ya da bir şey, eğer hala"
" bu konuda umursayan insanlar varsa, ama şehirde yeşil bir şey gördün mü?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Ne?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "WHAT."
msgstr "NE."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh yeah, some people've been growing it in their basements."
msgstr "Ah evet, bazı insanlar bunu bodrumlarında yetiştiriyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not comfortable with where this is going."
msgstr "Bu gidişattan rahatsızım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm "
"talking about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh.  Uh, sure."
msgstr "Ah. Uh, tabii."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Right, of course I knew that!  There's tons of the stuff out there for the "
"taking."
msgstr "Tamam, bunu bildiğimi biliyordum! Dışarıda alınacak tonlarca var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Nope, sorry."
msgstr "Hayır, üzgünüm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not doing this."
msgstr "Bunu yapmıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Hey, don't get all serious on me all of a sudden.  It helps me relax.  "
"Lubricates my joints.  Eases the pain, ya know?  Makes every day a bit more "
"bearable."
msgstr ""
"Hey, birdenbire bu kadar ciddileşme.  Bu beni rahatlatıyor.  Eklemelerimi "
"yağlıyor.  Acıyı hafifletiyor, biliyorsun?  Her günü biraz daha katlanılır "
"hale getiriyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I can help."
msgstr "Yardım edebilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Find somebody else, dude."
msgstr "Başka birini bul, dostum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, no worries, though.  I'm good at the moment.  Ask me again later and "
"maybe I'll have scrounged up some more cash for you."
msgstr ""
"Evet, endişelenme.  Şu an iyiyim.  Daha sonra tekrar sor, belki senin için "
"biraz daha para bulmuş olurum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Amazing!  My lucky day.  Let's see here.  What can I offer… I can scrounge "
"up some Merch bucks for, say, five joints or joints-worth of the good stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "You have yourself a deal.  Here's the marijuana."
msgstr "Anlaştık.  İşte marijuana."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "You have yourself a deal.  Here's some joints."
msgstr "Anlaştık.  İşte biraz cigara."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh, alright.  I'll be back later with the goods."
msgstr "Oh, tamam.  İlerle birlikte geri döneceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "On second thought, maybe later."
msgstr "İkinci düşünce, belki daha sonra."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Well, let me know when you have.  I'm not going anywhere."
msgstr "Tamam, ne zaman hazır olursan haber ver.  Nereye gitmiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Tabii."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not your drug dealer, buddy."
msgstr "Ben senin uyuşturucu satıcın değilim, dostum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Sold!  Thanks for helping me out, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No problem, Draco."
msgstr "Sorun değil, Draco."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "You're welcome.  Later."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Bring an acoustic guitar"
msgstr "Bir akustik gitar getir"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure, imagine how things would be if we had some live music around "
"here?  I don't know how much I could thank you, though, if you're looking "
"for payment.  You'd sure be improving the mood, though."
msgstr ""
"Aynen, tabii, burada canlı müzik olsaydı işler nasıl olurdu bir düşünsene? "
"Eğer ödeme arıyorsan sana ne kadar teşekkür edebileceğimi bilmiyorum. Ama "
"kesinlikle havayı iyileştirirdin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"I just want a functional acoustic guitar.  Preferably one that hasn't been "
"used to cave in any zombie skulls."
msgstr ""
"Sadece işlevsel bir akustik gitar istiyorum. Tercihen herhangi bir zombi "
"kafasını ezmek için kullanılmamış bir tane."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Great!  We'll be makin' music in no time!"
msgstr "Harika! Çok geçmeden müzik yapıyor olacağız!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh well.  I understand your reluctancy… I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'll let you in on a little secret.  Guitars COULD be found at a music"
" store.  Let that one sink in a bit."
msgstr ""
"Şimdi sana küçük bir sır vereyim. Gitarlar bir müzik mağazasında "
"BULUNABİLİR. Bunu biraz sindir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "How's my guitar comin', friend?"
msgstr "Gitarım ne durumda, dostum?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Hell yeah, bud!  You just made a lot of people really happy!  In thanks, "
"I'll have enough cash to offer you more recompense for our little dealings."
msgstr ""
"Evet, dostum! Birçok insanı gerçekten mutlu ettin! Teşekkür olarak, küçük "
"işlerimiz için sana daha fazla tazminat sunacak kadar param olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Huh.  This… is something, isn't it."
msgstr "Hıh. Bu... bir şey, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No worries.  They don't grow from trees, but we have time."
msgstr "Endişelenme. Ağaçlardan yetişmiyorlar ama zamanımız var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "Fatima al Jadir"
msgstr "Fatima al Jadir"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "How did you wind up here at the center?"
msgstr "Merkezde nasıl buraya geldin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help you out?"
msgstr "Sana yardım edebileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Actually I'm just heading out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr "Yine merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Good to see you're still around."
msgstr "Hala burada olduğunu görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Oh, hi."
msgstr "Oh, merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"Oh, hey, a new face.  Hi, I'm Fatima.  Just visiting I hope?  It's nice to "
"meet new people but there are no beds to share."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too, Fatima.  I'm just passing through."
msgstr "Seninle tanışmak da güzel, Fatima. Sadece geçiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "Hi, Fatima.  How are things?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Fatima. Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "I'm afraid I can't talk right now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "Well, cool.  Anything I can help you with?"
msgstr "Tamam, harika. Size yardımcı olabileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"Oh, you know, the usual.  Trapped in a tight space with a bunch of strangers"
" getting along tenuously at best.  Good times, good times."
msgstr ""
"Ah, biliyorsun, her zamanki gibi.  En iyi ihtimalle zorla anlaşan bir grup "
"yabancı ile dar bir alanda hapsolmuşum.  Güzel zamanlar, güzel zamanlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm> I had just finished welding school actually, and was "
"about to start looking for a job.  That was fun, being a young Muslim woman "
"in a Massachusetts trade college, let me tell you."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>'dan önce aslında kaynak okulunu yeni bitirmiştim ve iş "
"aramaya başlayacaktım. Massachusetts'teki bir ticaret kolejinde genç bir "
"Müslüman kadın olmak eğlenceliydi, size söyleyeyim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"Welding seems like a pretty non-traditional occupational choice; is there a "
"story there?"
msgstr ""
"Kaynak yapma, oldukça sıradışı bir meslek seçimi gibi görünüyor; bunun "
"arkasında bir hikaye var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"You'd be surprised actually!  Metal art has been part of Muslim traditions for years, although that's not why I got into it.  I'm not a very traditional girl.  My parents aren't very traditional either, but my grandparents are really old fashioned and strict.  My sister came out as gay and they made her life really hard; mom and dad thought she should keep it secret, but she didn't believe in that.  I always loved mechanics and working with my hands, so when they started harassing my parents about getting my sister and I married off to nice men so we'd stop being so immoral, I decided to pick a job I liked that would bother them as much as possible.  It was a good choice, not only did it make them livid but I love welding.  I love the feel of standing back and looking at my work, knowing I took a few chunks of scrap metal and made them into something useful.  I love how it feels to make it fit together perfectly.  It just puts me at peace.\n"
"\n"
"I… I do hope my grandparents are okay though.  They were old fashioned, and they made choices I didn't like, but they were family and I still have sweet memories of them from when I was little.  I've had to do a lot more thinking about God since <the_cataclysm>, and while I'd never agree with the decisions they made, I understand more why they thought they had to make them.  They just wanted the whole family to share their relationship with God, in their messed up way."
msgstr ""
"Aslında şaşırırsınız! Metal sanatı yıllardır Müslüman geleneklerinin bir parçası, ama bu yüzden bu işe girmedim. Ben çok geleneksel bir kız değilim. Ailem de çok geleneksel değil, ama büyüklerim gerçekten eski kafalı ve katı. Kız kardeşim eşcinsel olduğunu açıkladı ve onların hayatını gerçekten zorlaştırdılar; anne ve babam bunun gizli kalması gerektiğini düşündüler, ama o buna inanmadı. Ben her zaman mekanik şeylere ve ellerimle çalışmaya bayıldım, bu yüzden kız kardeşimle beni iyi adamlara evlendirmek için ailemin peşimi bırakmadığı zaman, onları mümkün olduğunca rahatsız edecek bir iş seçmeye karar verdim. Bu iyi bir seçimdi, sadece onları deli etmekle kalmadı, aynı zamanda kaynak yapmayı seviyorum. İşime geri çekilip bakmanın verdiği hissi seviyorum, birkaç parça hurda metal alıp onları kullanışlı bir şeye dönüştürdüğümü bilmek harika. Birbirine mükemmel bir şekilde oturtmanın verdiği hissi seviyorum. Bu beni huzurlu hissettiriyor.\n"
"\n"
"Ama… Umarım büyüklerim iyidir. Onlar eski kafalıydı ve hoşlanmadığım seçimler yaptılar, ama aileydiler ve onlarla küçükken güzel anılarım var. <the_cataclysm> sonrası Tanrı hakkında daha fazla düşünmek zorunda kaldım ve yaptıkları kararlara asla katılmasam da, neden bu kararları almak zorunda hissettiklerini daha iyi anlıyorum. Sadece tüm ailenin Tanrı ile olan ilişkilerini, kendi karmaşık yollarında paylaşmalarını istediler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"I was on my way to visit my parents back in Burlington, waiting at a bus station, when the evacuation notices started sounding.  I'd been a little out of touch for a bit and didn't realize how bad the rioting was getting.  When my bus arrived it got repurposed into an evacuation vehicle, and took me here.  I… I didn't used to be very religious, it's just something I was born to, but since this happened I've been thinking a lot more about God, and how grateful I am for His help in surviving.  With things still so difficult, it helps to know He's got some plan for me.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, mine was the second bus to arrive, and they were just getting some triage and processing stuff set up.  I was put in charge of helping with the wounded, along with Uyen.  Things went a little strange later on… one of the women doing triage and processing had a bit of a hang-up about particular, um, colors of people being allowed into the center.  She claimed to have lost our 'papers', along with a lot of other peoples'.  Thankfully because we'd helped so many we were able to argue that they couldn't leave us out, but there was no space left downstairs by the time we got that sorted, so here we are."
msgstr ""
"Burlington'daki ailemi ziyaret etmek üzere yola çıkmıştım, bir otobüs durağında bekliyordum, tahliye bildirimleri çalmaya başladığında. Bir süredir biraz kopuk kalmıştım ve isyanların ne kadar kötüleştiğini fark etmemiştim. Otobüsüm geldiğinde, tahliye aracı olarak yeniden düzenlendi ve beni buraya getirdi. Ben… eskiden çok dindar değildim, bu sadece doğuştan gelen bir şeydi, ama bu olaydan beri Tanrı hakkında çok daha fazla düşünmeye başladım ve hayatta kalmamda bana yardım ettiği için ne kadar minnettar olduğumu düşünüyorum. İşler hala bu kadar zorken, benim için bir planı olduğunu bilmek yardımcı oluyor.\n"
"\n"
"Neyse, benim otobüsüm ikinci gelen otobüstü ve onlar sadece bazı triage ve işlem şeylerini kuruyorlardı. Yaralılara yardım etme konusunda Uyen ile birlikte görevlendirildim. Daha sonra işler biraz garip gitmeye başladı… triage ve işlem yapan kadınlardan biri, belirli, um, insanların renkleriyle ilgili merkeze alınmalarının engellenmesi konusunda bir takıntısı vardı. 'Belgelerimizi' kaybettiğini iddia etti, birçok diğer insanın belgeleriyle birlikte. Neyse ki, bu kadar çok insana yardım ettiğimiz için bizi dışarıda bırakamayacaklarını savunabildik, ama biz bunu hallettiğimizde aşağıda hiç yer kalmamıştı, bu yüzden buradayız."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"Things are still tense, but I've been busy lately.  Jenny's had her project "
"going and got me started helping her out with it, and for some reason that "
"seems to have been the tipping point: I'm getting chances to do a lot more "
"welding work now.  It's helping.  I feel a bit self-conscious praying in the"
" common areas, and of course, we don't go outside if we can help it."
msgstr ""
"Hala gerginlikler var, ama son zamanlarda meşguldüm. Jenny'nin projesi vardı"
" ve ona yardım etmeye başlamamı sağladı, ve nedense bu, dönüm noktası gibi "
"oldu: Şimdi çok daha fazla kaynak yapma şansım var. Bu yardımcı oluyor. "
"Ortak alanlarda dua ederken biraz rahatsız hissediyorum ve tabii ki, eğer "
"yardımcı olabiliyorsak dışarı çıkmıyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"It's tense here.  I know I'd feel a lot better if I had something to do with"
" my skills, or even if I just had a quiet place to pray sometimes.  I feel a"
" bit self-conscious praying in the common areas.  Jenny was talking about "
"some project ideas she had that could get me doing my job again, but I admit"
" I'm pretty nervous about going outside."
msgstr ""
"Burada gergin bir atmosfer var.  Yeteneklerimle yapacak bir şeyim olsaydı ya"
" da en azından bazen dua edebileceğim sessiz bir yerim olsaydı, kendimi çok "
"daha iyi hissedeceğimi biliyorum.  Ortak alanlarda dua ederken biraz "
"rahatsız hissediyorum.  Jenny, işimi tekrar yapmamı sağlayabilecek bazı "
"proje fikirlerinden bahsediyordu, ama dışarı çıkma konusunda oldukça gergin "
"olduğumu itiraf etmeliyim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "Find a copy of the Quran"
msgstr "Kuran'ın bir kopyasını bul."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "I could use a bit of help to find a copy of the Quran."
msgstr "Kuran'ın bir kopyasını bulmak için biraz yardıma ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"I feel silly asking this, but here goes.  I've never been really into "
"reading holy books and stuff like that.  I usually went to the mosque on "
"Friday, and I try to pray five times a day but I hardly ever manage it.  I "
"guess I'm not a very good Muslim, but with all that's happened I would "
"really love to have a copy of the Quran to read.  This seems like a time to "
"get back in touch with God, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Bunu sormak biraz saçma geliyor ama işte. Kutsal kitapları ve benzeri "
"şeyleri okumaya pek meraklı olmadım. Genellikle Cuma günü camiye giderdim ve"
" günde beş kez namaz kılmaya çalışırım ama bunu pek başaramıyorum. Sanırım "
"pek iyi bir Müslüman değilim ama olanlardan sonra okumak için bir Kuran "
"kopyasına sahip olmayı gerçekten isterim. Bu, Tanrı ile yeniden bağlantı "
"kurmak için bir zaman gibi görünüyor, biliyor musun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "Thank you.  I'll see if I can save up a little reward for you."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim. Biraz ödül biriktirip bir şeyler alıp almayacağıma "
"bakacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid "That's okay.  Thanks for offering."
msgstr "Sorun değil. Teklif ettiğin için teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"It's not as common as the bible, but you should be able to find copies in "
"most libraries and bookstores, or in religious buildings.  Make sure you get"
" the translated version, I can't read Arabic!"
msgstr ""
"Kutsal kitap kadar yaygın değil ama çoğu kütüphane ve kitapçıda ya da dini "
"binalarda kopyalarını bulabilmelisin. Çevirisini aldığından emin ol, Arapça "
"okuyamam!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much.  Just having a copy to keep at hand does actually feel "
"pretty comforting.  I did a few extra rounds of chores and saved the "
"proceeds for if you managed this, here you go.  It's not much but I hope it "
"helps."
msgstr ""
"Çok teşekkür ederim. Elimde bir kopya bulundurmak gerçekten oldukça "
"rahatlatıcı hissettiriyor. Birkaç ekstra iş yaptım ve eğer bunu "
"başarabilirsen diye kazandıklarımı biriktirdim, işte bu. Çok değil ama "
"umarım yardımcı olur."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
msgid ""
"It's okay.  I don't know how much comfort I'd have found in an old book "
"anyway."
msgstr "Sorun değil. Eski bir kitapta ne kadar rahatlık bulurdum bilmiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Garry Villeneuve"
msgstr "Garry Villeneuve"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Well, hello."
msgstr "\"Eh, merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr "Seni tekrar görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Hi.  Hi there.  I'm Garry, Garry Villeneuve."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Garry."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Garry."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Hi, Garry.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Garry. Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Hi Garry, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Hi Garry.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too.  Are you staying here, or something?"
msgstr ""
"Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum.  Burada mı kalıyorsun, yoksa başka bir şey mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "No, I'm a traveler.  What's up with you?"
msgstr "Hayır, ben bir gezginim.  Seninle ne var?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Nope, in fact I'm leaving right now."
msgstr "Hayır, aslında hemen çıkıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid ""
"Doing my best to keep going in the face of… everything.  Not getting far."
msgstr "Her şeye rağmen devam etmeye çalışıyorum… pek de ilerleyemiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid ""
"Before the apocalypse I was an electrician.  Boris here is my brother-in-"
"law, and we were a decent contractor team.  When the evacuations sounded, we"
" left together with our… with our families.  We got stuck into a crowded "
"evac shelter, then onto a crowded bus.  Then… everything went wrong.  The "
"bus was attacked, destroyed.  Nearly everyone died.  A few of us made it "
"back… not enough."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "You lost someone…"
msgstr "Birini kaybettin…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid ""
"Yes.  My wife, Linda… thrown from the bus.  She didn't make it.  And… and my"
" nephew, Ash, Boris and Stan's son.  We got him here, but there wasn't "
"anything we could do.  Internal injuries."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid ""
"It's tense here, but I don't know.  Stan, Boris and I have been pretty "
"insular.  I guess we'd better get to know some of the others here "
"eventually.  It feels it should be a temporary stop, but it's starting to "
"look like we'll be here for the long term.  If we live that long."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid "Guneet Singh"
msgstr "Guneet Singh"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hi."
msgstr "Merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid "Hey again."
msgstr "Yine merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid ""
"Oh, hello.  I don't think I've seen you around before.  I'm Guneet, people "
"call me Gunny."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Gunny."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Gunny."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid "Hi, Gunny.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Gunny. Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid "Hi Gunny, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid "Hi Gunny.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid ""
"I guess we're still doing that stuff?  Cool.  Nice to meet you too.  What's "
"up?"
msgstr ""
"Sanırım hala o şeyleri yapıyoruz? Harika. Seninle tanışmak da güzel. "
"Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "I just had some questions."
msgstr "Biraz sorum vardı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid "."
msgstr "."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid ""
"I was in high school, you know.  Most of the way through my junior year.  "
"\"My story\"?  I got on a bus with my parents, the bus crashed, and everyone"
" died except a few people, most of whom are crammed into this little shelter"
" now.  Who knows when we're getting out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
msgid ""
"It sucks in here, there's no two ways about it.  People don't talk to us "
"because we wear turbans and we still have each other.  They think because "
"we're still together, we didn't lose anything.  My dad believes it, too, and"
" I think my mom's on the fence."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Jenny Forcette"
msgstr "Jenny Forcette"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What are you working on?"
msgstr "Üzerinde ne çalışıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Tell me a bit about your background."
msgstr "Geçmişin hakkında biraz bilgi verir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "How are things, living here?"
msgstr "Burada yaşamak nasıl?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me anything about the other refugees here?"
msgstr ""
"Buradaki diğer mülteciler hakkında bana bir şeyler söyleyebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Nice to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Hi there.  Haven't see you around here before.  I'm Jenny, Jenny Forcette."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Nice meeting you.  What are you doing on that computer?"
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum.  O bilgisayarda ne yapıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Hi, Jenny.  What are you up to these days?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Jenny.  Bu günlerde ne yapıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Nice meeting you.  I'd best get going, though."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum.  Ama gitsem iyi olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Sorry Jenny, I can't stay to chat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I'm puttering around, I always have stuff on the go.  Gotta keep busy, keep "
"my mind off stuff, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Me?  I trained at MIT in mechanical engineering, I worked for a long time as"
" senior engineer at Marduk Thermal in Rhode Island.  It was a good job, but "
"I landed my dream gig at Boston Dynamics and moved up north to start there."
"  I had just finished my orientation and was going to start work when the "
"riots started.  Just my damn luck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "That's impressive, but there must be more to you than just your job."
msgstr "Bu etkileyici, ama senin işinden daha fazlası olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Sorry about your luck.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Ha!  You must not know many engineers, hey?  I guess there's more to me than"
" engineering, but most of my hobbies come back to it one way or the other.  "
"It's not that I live for my work, doing engineering for a heating company "
"wasn't some great dream, but when I got home I'd putter with the projects I "
"wanted to do instead of the ones they made me do.  You know?  And of course,"
" I had my friends and things, we'd go out or hang out and play board games "
"and stuff.  Maybe some day I'll get a board game group started up here, "
"although there's nothing wrong with the card games we've got now.  Plus I "
"don't think Zombicide would hold the same interest for me as it used to."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"About a month ago, I got a mold for making high-caliber air rifle bullets.  "
"I've been designing some turrets that would use a central air system to "
"power pneumatic rifle turrets around the center.  It's a lot easier than "
"trying to make gunpowder!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I recently came into possession of this mold for making high-caliber air "
"rifle bullets.  I'm kinda working on a design that would use them to protect"
" the base.  Got a long way to go, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Tell me more about your project."
msgstr "Projen hakkında daha fazla bilgi ver."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"They're pretty big.  This isn't something you'd carry around with you.  They"
" fire .30 cal bullets using compressed air that we'd make inside the "
"basement and then pipe up to individual storage tanks for the guns that "
"would be good for a few hundred shots each.  The design should be capable of"
" auto or semi-auto fire, at a range that's pretty comparable to a gunpowder-"
"based weapon.  It takes out some of the most limited parts of ranged "
"weapons: no gunpowder, no brass casings, just lead that we melt into my "
"mold.  It's not soundless, but it's not as loud as a chemical weapon.  There"
" are tons of advantages.  Only trouble is, I can't convince the Free "
"Merchants to give me the parts I need."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Well, these things are a standard .30 caliber.  They should be compatible "
"with any similar rifle barrel.  It would be pretty easy to repurpose some "
"rifle parts into large air weapons that we could use without relying on "
"gunpowder, and without so much noise.  I'm still drawing up an actual design"
" though, I have a bunch of features I want.  Ask me again in a couple weeks "
"and I'll give you some more info."
msgstr ""
"Bunlar standart .30 kalibre. Benzer tüfek namlularıyla uyumlu olmalıdır. "
"Bazı tüfek parçalarını, barut kullanmadan ve bu kadar gürültü yapmadan "
"kullanabileceğimiz büyük hava silahlarına dönüştürmek oldukça kolay "
"olacaktır. Ancak hala gerçek bir tasarım üzerinde çalışıyorum, istediğim "
"birçok özellik var. Bana birkaç hafta sonra tekrar sor, sana daha fazla "
"bilgi vereceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Is there some way I can help you get the stuff you need?"
msgstr ""
"İhtiyacın olan şeyleri almanda sana yardımcı olabileceğim bir yol var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What were you saying before?."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"It's getting bad.  We've been stuck in here for months, nothing changing, "
"nothing improving.  We can't go outside, we don't have enough to eat, and we"
" didn't choose to be with each other.  I don't know how long we can stay "
"like this before somebody snaps."
msgstr ""
"Kötüye gidiyor. Burada aylardır sıkışıp kaldık, hiçbir şey değişmiyor, "
"hiçbir şey iyileşmiyor. Dışarı çıkamıyoruz, yeterince yiyeceğimiz yok ve "
"birbirimizle birlikte olmayı seçmedik. Birinin sinirlenmeden önce ne kadar "
"süre böyle kalabileceğimizi bilmiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"There's good and there's bad.  We're all pretty sick of being cooped up in "
"here for months, never knowing if there's going to be food to eat or not.  "
"It's starting to look like they're never going to let us go down to the "
"secure basement, and none of us have slept well since we were brought in.  "
"We know we've got it pretty good… we're safe, we're alive.  It's just, like,"
" what kind of life are we even living?"
msgstr ""
"İyi ve kötü var. Hepimiz burada aylardır kapalı kalmaktan oldukça hastayız, "
"yiyecek olup olmayacağını asla bilmeden. Güvenli bodrum katına inmemize asla"
" izin vermeyecekleri gibi görünüyor ve içeri alındığımızdan beri hiç kimse "
"iyi uyumadı. Oldukça iyi durumda olduğumuzu biliyoruz... güvendeyiz, "
"hayattayız. Sadece, ne tür bir hayat yaşıyoruz ki?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"It's been over a month now, so I guess I'm starting to get used to it.  "
"Things were pretty rough after Sean died, but it wasn't our first big loss "
"and it won't be the last I guess.  I've made a couple friends, and in a "
"weird way we're all like family.  We were all hoping they'd let us "
"downstairs sooner than this though.  We're never quite sure if there's going"
" to be enough food to go around.  I'm really hoping I can lose myself in "
"this project.  Still haven't had a good night's sleep since <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"Bir aydan fazla oldu, bu yüzden sanırım buna alışmaya başlıyorum. Sean "
"öldükten sonra işler oldukça zorlayıcıydı, ama bu bizim ilk büyük kaybımız "
"değildi ve sanırım son da olmayacak. Birkaç arkadaş edindim ve garip bir "
"şekilde hepimiz aile gibiyiz. Ama daha önce aşağıya inmemize izin "
"vereceklerini umuyorduk. Yeterince yiyecek olup olmayacağından asla emin "
"olamıyoruz. Bu projeye kendimi kaybetmeyi gerçekten umuyorum. "
"<the_cataclysm> sonrası iyi bir gece uykusu uyuyamadım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Living here?  Yeah, I guess I live here now.  It's… it's weird.  We're "
"crowded into this tiny space, I don't know these people, but we're sharing "
"bathrooms and we've all been through the same stuff.  It's not great.  At "
"night we can hear the <zombies> outside, and we all just lie there awake, "
"thinking the same things but too scared to talk about it."
msgstr ""
"Burada mı yaşıyorum? Evet, sanırım şimdi burada yaşıyorum. Bu... garip. Bu "
"küçük alana sıkışmış durumdayız, bu insanları tanımıyorum ama tuvaletleri "
"paylaşıyoruz ve hepimiz aynı şeylerden geçtik. Harika değil. Gece dışarıda "
"<zombies> seslerini duyabiliyoruz ve hepimiz orada uyanık yatıyoruz, aynı "
"şeyleri düşünüyoruz ama bunları konuşmaktan çok korkuyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the Free Merchants?"
msgstr "Bana Özgür Tüccarlar hakkında bilgi verebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Fatima?"
msgstr "Fatima hakkında bana bir şeyler söyleyebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What has made you friends with Dana, Draco, and Aleesha?"
msgstr "Dana, Draco ve Aleesha ile arkadaş olmanı sağlayan ne oldu?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the Borichenkos?"
msgstr "Borichenkolar hakkında bana bir şeyler söyleyebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the Singhs?"
msgstr "Singh'ler hakkında bana bir şeyler söyleyebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the others?"
msgstr "Diğerleri hakkında bana bir şeyler söyleyebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"For better or worse, we're a community now.  Fatima and I work together a "
"fair bit, and I consider Dana, Draco, and Aleesha my friends, and so of "
"course I've gotten to know Dana's husband Pedro too.  The Borichenkos are "
"their own sweet brand of messed up, like all of us.  The Singhs have each "
"other, and keep mostly to themselves.  Vanessa and I don't see eye to eye, "
"but I'm still glad she's here.  Uyen and Rhyzaea are always bickering about "
"leadership decisions, as if they made those kind of calls.  What did you "
"want to know?"
msgstr ""
"İyi ya da kötü, artık bir topluluğuz. Fatima ile birlikte oldukça fazla "
"çalışıyoruz ve Dana, Draco ve Aleesha'yı arkadaşım olarak görüyorum, "
"dolayısıyla elbette Dana'nın eşi Pedro'yu da tanıdım. Borichenkolar, hepimiz"
" gibi kendi tatlı karmaşasıyla dolular. Singh'ler birbirlerine sahipler ve "
"genelde kendi hallerinde takılıyorlar. Vanessa ile aynı fikirde değiliz, ama"
" burada olduğu için yine de mutluyum. Uyen ve Rhyzaea liderlik kararları "
"hakkında sürekli tartışıyorlar, sanki bu tür kararları alıyorlarmış gibi. Ne"
" hakkında bilgi almak istedin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Well, there's a bunch of us.  We're starting to form a bit of a community.  "
"Fatima and I work together a fair bit, and I've been hanging out with Dana, "
"Draco, and Aleesha quite a lot.  I don't know the Borichenko bunch, the "
"Singhs, Vanessa, Uyen, or Rhyzaea quite as well, but we've talked.  What did"
" you want to know?"
msgstr ""
"Aslında aramızda bir grup var. Biraz topluluk oluşturmaya başlıyoruz. Fatima"
" ile birlikte oldukça fazla çalışıyoruz ve Dana, Draco ve Aleesha ile çok "
"vakit geçiriyorum. Borichenkoları, Singh'leri, Vanessa'yı, Uyen'i veya "
"Rhyzaea'yı pek tanımıyorum ama konuştuk. Ne hakkında bilgi almak istedin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What was it you said earlier?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"They run this place, and they don't run a charity.  We get paid for working "
"around the place, maintaining it, what have you, and we trade cash for food."
"  The thing is, supply and demand and all… there's a lot more cash than food"
" around.  It's easier to buy a laptop than a piece of beef jerky, and "
"there's no sign of that getting better.  The balance is way off right now, a"
" hard day of work barely gets you enough to fill your belly.  I shouldn't "
"bitch too much though.  I don't know much better way to run it, although "
"rumor is that the folks living downstairs have it a lot easier than we do.  "
"I try not to think too much on that."
msgstr ""
"Bu yeri onlar yönetiyor ve bir hayır kurumu işletmiyorlar. Burada "
"çalıştığımız için para alıyoruz, bakımını yapıyoruz, neyse işte, ve yiyecek "
"için nakit takas ediyoruz. İşin aslı, arz ve talep meselesi... etten çok "
"daha fazla nakit var. Bir dizüstü bilgisayar almak, bir parça kurutulmuş et "
"almaktan daha kolay ve bunun düzelmesine dair hiçbir işaret yok. Denge şu "
"anda çok bozuk, zor bir iş günü bile karnını doyuracak kadar kazandırmıyor. "
"Ama çok şikayet etmemeliyim. Bunu yönetmenin daha iyi bir yolunu bilmiyorum,"
" ama aşağıda yaşayanların bizden çok daha kolay bir yaşam sürdüğüne dair "
"söylentiler var. Bunun üzerine fazla düşünmemeye çalışıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Fatima's a sweety, but she's a total dork.  I know, I know, it's backwards "
"for the engineer to call the heavy duty mechanic a nerd, but hey.  I call it"
" like it is.  She and I have been doing some odd jobs around the upstairs "
"here, fixing up old machinery and things."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Well, Dana lost her baby right after <the_cataclysm>, in a bus rollover.  "
"She was lucky to make it out alive.  She and Pedro had one of the rougher "
"trips here, I guess.  We just kinda click as friends, I'm grateful there's "
"someone else here I can really get along with.  Her husband, Pedro, is still"
" pretty shell-shocked.  He doesn't talk much.  I like him though, when he "
"opens up he's just hilarious.  Draco is just a cantankerous old fart who "
"hasn't actually got old yet, give him twenty years and he'll be there.  I "
"like grumpy people.  We also have pretty similar taste in music.  Aleesha's "
"a sweet kid, and we've all kind of adopted her, but she seems to hang out "
"with me and Dana the most.  She's a great artist, and she's full of crazy "
"ideas.  I guess I like her because of all of us, she seems to have the most "
"hope that there's a future to be had."
msgstr ""
"Dana, <the_cataclysm> sonrasında bir otobüs devrilmesinde bebeğini kaybetti."
" Hayatta kalmayı başardığı için şanslıydı. Buraya gelmek için oldukça zorlu "
"bir yolculuk yaptılar, sanırım. Arkadaş olarak birbirimize uyum sağlıyoruz, "
"burada gerçekten iyi geçinebildiğim başka birinin olduğu için minnettarım. "
"Eşi Pedro hala oldukça şokta. Çok konuşmuyor. Ama onu seviyorum, açıldığında"
" gerçekten komik. Draco, aslında yaşlanmamış ama huysuz bir ihtiyar. Ona "
"yirmi yıl ver, orada olacak. Huysuz insanları seviyorum. Ayrıca müzik "
"zevkimiz de oldukça benzer. Aleesha tatlı bir çocuk ve hepimiz onu "
"benimsemişiz gibi, ama en çok benimle ve Dana ile takılıyor gibi görünüyor. "
"Harika bir sanatçı ve deli fikirlerle dolu. Sanırım onu seviyorum çünkü "
"aramızda, geleceğin olabileceğine dair en fazla umudu olan o gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I didn't get to know Boris, Garry, and Stan so well for the first while.  "
"They kinda kept to themselves.  Boris and Stan had just lost their son, you "
"know.  It's pretty lucky that Garry was with them, he's Stan's little "
"brother.  Together, they're a pretty good team.  I feel bad for thinking "
"they were standoffish before.  They probably do the most to pull their "
"weight around here whenever there's work to be done."
msgstr ""
"Boris, Garry ve Stan'ı ilk başlarda pek tanıyamadım. Kendilerine "
"kapalıydılar. Boris ve Stan, biliyorsun, oğullarını yeni kaybetmişlerdi. "
"Garry'nin onlarla birlikte olması oldukça şanslı, o Stan'ın küçük kardeşi. "
"Birlikte, oldukça iyi bir ekipler. Önceden mesafeli olduklarını düşündüğüm "
"için kendimi kötü hissediyorum. Burada yapılacak iş olduğunda, muhtemelen en"
" çok katkıyı sağlıyorlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Boris and Stan are married, I guess.  They kinda keep to themselves, they "
"seem a bit standoffish if you ask me.  Garry is Stan's brother, I think, but"
" I'm not totally sure.  He seems nice enough, but he's a man of few words.  "
"I can't get a good bead on them.  I've learned not to pry too much though."
msgstr ""
"Boris ve Stan evli, sanırım. Kendilerine kapalılar, bana sorarsan biraz "
"mesafeli görünüyorlar. Garry, Stan'ın kardeşi sanırım ama tam olarak emin "
"değilim. Yeterince nazik görünüyor ama az konuşan birisi. Onları iyi "
"tanıyamıyorum. Ama fazla kurcalamamayı öğrendim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"The Singhs are really shy, and I think they feel pretty bad about making it "
"through this together.  They're the only complete family I've seen since "
"<the_cataclysm>.  That has to feel really weird, and I think it's made them "
"stick really close together.  I think… I think they also just don't really "
"like any of us."
msgstr ""
"Singh'ler gerçekten utangaç, ve birlikte bunu başardıkları için oldukça kötü"
" hissettiklerini düşünüyorum.  <the_cataclysm>'dan beri gördüğüm tek tam "
"aile onlar.  Bu gerçekten garip hissettirmeli, ve sanırım onları birbirine "
"daha da yakınlaştırdı.  Sanırım… sanırım bizden hiç hoşlanmıyorlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I really can't get a bead on them.  They never really talk to anyone outside"
" of their little family group, they just sit in their own spot and speak "
"Punjabi.  They always seem nice, and they do their share, they just don't "
"have any social connection."
msgstr ""
"Onları gerçekten anlayamıyorum.  Küçük aile gruplarının dışındaki kimseyle "
"pek konuşmuyorlar, sadece kendi yerlerinde oturup Pencabi konuşuyorlar.  Her"
" zaman nazik görünürler, ve paylarını yaparlar, sadece sosyal bir "
"bağlantıları yok."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Vanessa… I'm doing my best, I really am, but we just do not get along.  One "
"of these days one of us is probably going to brain the other with a tire "
"iron, and I'm just grateful I spend more time around the tire irons.  Uyen "
"and Rhyzaea are both excellent people, and I genuinely like them, but I "
"can't stand this ongoing political bullshit they've got going on. John is a "
"walking stereotype, but he's a great poker buddy.  I admit I kinda like him."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Vanessa… well, she's nice, I guess.  I gotta say, she kinda drives me nuts, "
"but we're in this together so I try not to be too harsh.  Uyen and Rhyzaea "
"both seem to want to run the show here, but I try to stay out of those "
"politics and just focus on building stuff.  I don't see much good coming of "
"it. John is a walking stereotype, I imagine there must be more depth to him,"
" but I haven't seen it yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Find an electric motor"
msgstr "Elektrik motoru bul"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, if you want to risk your neck out there and bring me what I need, I'm "
"not gonna say no.  I can't, like, pay you or anything though, you know that "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Evet, eğer dışarıda risk alıp bana ihtiyacım olanı getirirsen, hayır "
"demeyeceğim. Ama, sana ödeme yapamam, bunu biliyorsun değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Before I get anything going, I'm going to need to set up a compressor.  I "
"have a lot of the stuff for that, but I need a large tank for air, and a "
"good sized electric motor - about 10 kg or so.  I'm also going to need a 60 "
"liter tank, after that."
msgstr ""
"Bir şeyler yapmadan önce, bir kompresör kurmam gerekecek. Bunun için birçok "
"malzemem var, ama büyük bir hava tankına ve iyi boyutta bir elektrik "
"motoruna ihtiyacım var - yaklaşık 10 kg kadar. Ayrıca, ondan sonra 60 "
"litrelik bir tank da gerekecek."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Great!  Bring it to me when you find one."
msgstr "Harika! Bir tane bulduğunda bana getir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Oh well.  Thanks for offering anyway."
msgstr "Eh, neyse. Yine de teklifin için teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Try a basic hybrid car, or maybe farm equipment that uses an electric motor."
"  The kind on a bike would be too small, and the kind on those fance Edison "
"sports cars is going to be too big."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Any sign of a motor I can use?"
msgstr "Kullanabileceğim bir motorun işareti var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"That's exactly what I need!  Want to talk about that tank now?  I saved a "
"few merch for you, by the way."
msgstr ""
"Tam olarak ihtiyacım olan bu! Şimdi o tank hakkında konuşmak ister misin? Bu"
" arada senin için birkaç malzeme ayırdım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Huh.  This isn't going to work like I thought."
msgstr "Hıh. Bu düşündüğüm gibi olmayacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Bring back a 60L metal tank"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Now that I've got that motor, I can get my compressor mostly built.  I will "
"need a tank though."
msgstr ""
"Artık o motoru aldım, kompresörümü büyük ölçüde inşa edebilirim. Ama bir "
"tank gerekecek."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I can get started building the compressor, but I need a large metal tank to "
"store compressed air centrally.  About 60 liters should do…"
msgstr ""
"Kompresörü inşa etmeye başlayabilirim, ama merkezi olarak sıkıştırılmış "
"havayı depolamak için büyük bir metal tanka ihtiyacım var. Yaklaşık 60 litre"
" yeter…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"It needs to be a good strong tank, like a big propane tank or something… you"
" could look at fuel storage tanks and things, as long as they're durable "
"enough.  Heck, if you get some sheet metal you could probably even weld a "
"good one together."
msgstr ""
"İyi sağlam bir tank olması gerekiyor, büyük bir propan tankı gibi ya da bir "
"şey… dayanıklı oldukları sürece yakıt depolama tanklarına ve benzerlerine "
"bakabilirsin. Hatta, eğer biraz sac metal alırsan, muhtemelen iyi bir tane "
"bile kaynaklayabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Any sign of a tank I can use?"
msgstr "Kullanabileceğim bir tank işareti var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Hey, this is perfect, \"tanks\" a bunch.  Okay, I'm sorry for that.  Anyway,"
" now that I've got the parts, I might be able to build a proof of concept.  "
"First I gotta get this thing up and running, and argue with the bean "
"counters about letting me draw power to run it.  Oh right, and here's some "
"merch, thanks for the help!"
msgstr ""
"Hey, bu mükemmel, \"tanks\" çok. Tamam, bunun için üzgünüm. Neyse ki, "
"parçaları aldım, bir konsept kanıtı oluşturabilirim. Öncelikle bu şeyi "
"çalışır hale getirmem ve beni çalıştırmak için güç çekmeme izin vermeleri "
"konusunda muhasebecilerle tartışmam gerekiyor. Ah doğru, işte biraz ürün, "
"yardımın için teşekkürler!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Huh.  This isn't going to work like I thought.  Back to the drawing board I "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"Hımm. Bu düşündüğüm gibi olmayacak. Sanırım tekrar başa dönmem gerekecek."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "John Clemens"
msgstr "John Clemens"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "Howdy, pardner."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid ""
"Howdy, pardner.  They call me Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, John."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, John."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "Hi, John.  Got a minute?"
msgstr "Merhaba, John. Bir dakikan var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "Hi John, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "Hi John.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you too.  I reckon' you got some questions 'bout this place."
msgstr ""
"Seninle tanıştığıma da memnun oldum. Bu yer hakkında bazı soruların olduğunu"
" tahmin ediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "Yeah, I sure do."
msgstr "Evet, kesinlikle var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid "What can I do ya for?"
msgstr "Sana ne yapabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid ""
"My story?  Just a wanderin' cowhand, eatin' dust on the trail.  I settled "
"here for a spell after I came upon some hard times."
msgstr ""
"Hikayem mi? Sadece toz yutan bir sığır çobanıyım, yolda toz yiyorum. Zor "
"zamanlar geçirdikten sonra burada bir süre yerleştim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid ""
"You… you do know what's going on here, right?  With the evacuation and "
"stuff?"
msgstr ""
"Sen… burada neler olduğunu biliyorsun, değil mi? Tahliye ve diğer şeylerle "
"ilgili?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid ""
"Course I do, I ain't an idjit.  It's all the folks here c'n talk about."
msgstr ""
"Tabii ki, ben bir aptal değilim. Buradaki herkes bunun hakkında "
"konuşabiliyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid ""
"Folks don't like bein' kept from the blue sky for too long.  Cooped up like "
"cattle in a barn… we need pastures to run free, if'n y'get my drift.  'Til "
"we got 'em, it's gonna be tense in here."
msgstr ""
"İnsanlar mavi gökyüzünden uzun süre uzak tutulmayı sevmez.  Ahırda sığır "
"gibi kapalı kalmak… özgürce koşabileceğimiz meralara ihtiyacımız var, "
"anladın mı?  Onları elde edene kadar burada gergin olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Mandeep Singh"
msgstr "Mandeep Singh"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Hello sir.  I am Mandeep Singh."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Hello ma'am.  I am Mandeep Singh."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Mandeep."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Mandeep."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Hi, Mandeep.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Mandeep.  Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Hi Mandeep, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Hi Mandeep.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "It is nice to meet you as well.  Can I help you with something?"
msgstr ""
"Ben de tanıştığımıza memnun oldum.  Size bir konuda yardımcı olabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "I understand.  I don't know if I have many answers for you."
msgstr "Anlıyorum.  Size çok fazla cevabım olup olmadığını bilmiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid ""
"My story?  It is much the same as everyone's, I fear.  Loss and violence.  I"
" have not lost as much as many; by the grace of the Lord I have still got my"
" wife and son.  I could not be more grateful."
msgstr ""
"Hikayem mi?  Korkarım ki herkesin hikayesiyle aynı.  Kayıp ve şiddet.  "
"Birçok kişi kadar kaybetmedim; Tanrı'nın lütfuyla hala eşim ve oğlum "
"yanımda.  Daha fazla minnettar olamazdım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid ""
"It is hard for me to say.  No one is happy here.  I sense that some are "
"frustrated that my family and I have escaped the end of the world apparently"
" unscathed.  That, and perhaps some other things, have made it hard for us "
"to make close friends here."
msgstr ""
"Söylemek benim için zor.  Burada kimse mutlu değil.  Ailem ve benim dünyanın"
" sonundan görünüşte hasarsız kurtulmamız bazılarını hayal kırıklığına "
"uğratıyor gibi hissediyorum.  Bu ve belki de başka bazı şeyler, burada yakın"
" arkadaşlar edinmemizi zorlaştırdı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Mangalpreet Singh"
msgstr "Mangalpreet Singh"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Hi there."
msgstr "Merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Oh, hello there."
msgstr "Oh, merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm Mangalpreet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Mangalpreet."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Mangalpreet."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Hi, Mangalpreet."
msgstr "Merhaba, Mangalpreet."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Hi Mangalpreet, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Hi Mangalpreet.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm glad to meet you too.  Will you be staying with us?  I thought they"
" were taking no more refugees."
msgstr ""
"Evet, seni tanımaktan memnun oldum.  Bizimle kalacak mısın?  Daha fazla "
"mülteci almayacaklarını düşünmüştüm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "I'm a traveler actually.  Just saying hello."
msgstr "Aslında ben bir gezginim.  Sadece merhaba demek istedim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Is there anything you'd like to talk about?"
msgstr "Konuşmak istediğin bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid "Not really.  I'd better get going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid ""
"Before the end of the world, I was the vice principal of an elementary "
"school.  Now, I'm not sure what I am.  A person without a purpose."
msgstr ""
"Dünyanın sonundan önce, bir ilkokulun müdür yardımcısıydım.  Şimdi, ne "
"olduğumdan emin değilim.  Amacı olmayan bir insan."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
msgid ""
"I have my family.  I have the Guru Granth Sahib.  I have these things, but I"
" do not have peace.  No one here does.  We are crowded, we are plagued by "
"the sounds and the memories of the dead.  The situation is grim."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Pablo Nunez"
msgstr "Pablo Nunez"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Dana wanted me to be the one to let you know: they've got work for you over "
"at the ranch.  You could get out of here if you want."
msgstr ""
"Dana, sana haber vermemi istedi: çiftlikte senin için bir iş var. İstersen "
"buradan çıkabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "I'd better get going.  Bye, Pablo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Hello, nice to see you again."
msgstr "Merhaba, seni tekrar görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Hi there.  I'm Pablo, nice to see a new face."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Pablo, hey?  Nice to meet you."
msgstr "Pablo, değil mi? Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Hi, Pablo.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Pablo. Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Hi Pablo, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Hi Pablo, nice to see you too.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "We don't get many new faces around here.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "Burada pek çok yeni yüz görmüyoruz. Sana nasıl yardımcı olabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"It's been a rough time, adapting to everything that's going on.  What would "
"you like to know about?"
msgstr ""
"Her şeyin olduğu gibi adapte olmak zor bir dönemdi. Ne hakkında bilgi almak "
"istersin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I was an accountant before.  Just finished my CPA last year and I already "
"had a position as a manager at my firm.  Everything was looking good.  We "
"decided we were ready for a baby.  Hindsight makes us idiots, hey?"
msgstr ""
"Önceden muhasebeciydim. Geçen yıl CPA'mı bitirdim ve firmamda yönetici "
"olarak bir pozisyonum vardı. Her şey iyi görünüyordu. Bir bebek için hazır "
"olduğumuza karar verdik. Geçmişe dönüp bakınca aptalca görünüyor, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "How did you wind up in this place?"
msgstr "Bu yere nasıl geldin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Dana and I were evacuated early, because of her pregnancy.  They took us to "
"a concentration center, and then we got on a bus to come here.  The bus "
"though, it was rolled over by a giant monster, and many died.  We made it "
"out along with a few others, and we kept going until we made it here.  It "
"wasn't much farther, and for some reason the monster didn't chase us, just "
"kept tearing at the bus."
msgstr ""
"Dana ve ben erken tahliye edildik, çünkü hamileydi. Bizi bir toplama "
"merkezine götürdüler, sonra buraya gelmek için bir otobüse bindik. Ama "
"otobüs, dev bir canavar tarafından devrildi ve birçok kişi hayatını "
"kaybetti. Biz birkaç kişiyle birlikte kurtulduk ve buraya ulaşana kadar "
"devam ettik. Çok uzakta değildi ve bir sebepten canavar bizi takip etmedi, "
"sadece otobüsü parçalamaya devam etti."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "What about the pregnancy?"
msgstr "Hamilelik ne durumda?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "What happened to the other crash survivors?"
msgstr "Diğer kaza kurtulanlarına ne oldu?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"The doctor did what she could but after the accident and the stress of the "
"attack… No."
msgstr ""
"Doktor elinden geleni yaptı ama kazadan ve saldırının stresinden sonra… "
"Hayır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Thanks.  No, really, thank you.  Others have gone through so much I feel "
"like we should suck it up, but Rhy says we should let ourselves mourn "
"properly and she seems to know her stuff."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler. Hayır, gerçekten, teşekkür ederim. Diğerleri çok şey yaşadı, bu"
" yüzden dayanmalıyız gibi hissediyorum ama Rhy, kendimizi düzgün bir şekilde"
" yas tutmamız gerektiğini söylüyor ve bildiği anlaşılıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"From the bus?  A few of us made it in the end; the Singh family were on that"
" bus with us.  We were some of the last refugees to arrive.  They put us "
"into a room for processing, where a bunch of the wounded were being handled "
"as best as they could manage.  They were short staffed though, and they "
"missed one.  We all thought he was just having a nap, but he wasn't, and "
"when he got back up as a zombie, there was a huge panic.  Gunshots in a "
"small, crowded room, and trampling… it was really ugly.  We were close to "
"the door and managed to get out right away, but then a couple panicking "
"people closed the place off and left innocent people in there for what "
"seemed like ages, calling it an 'outbreak'.  By the time leveler heads "
"prevailed, there weren't many people left in there to recover."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I've been back to the quarantined area, cleared it out.  It was ugly back "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Karantinaya alınmış alana geri döndüm, orayı temizledim. Orası çok kötüydü."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for that, both for taking away the constant worry about all those "
"<zombies> close at hand, and for putting those poor souls at rest at last."
msgstr ""
"Bunun için teşekkürler, hem o yakınlardaki tüm <zombies> hakkında sürekli "
"endişeyi ortadan kaldırdığın için, hem de o zavallı ruhları nihayet huzura "
"kavuşturduğun için."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"It's pretty tough here.  We're packed into too small a location with too "
"many people.  Everyone is dealing with their own trauma.  Rhy is trying to "
"help out, but she can't be a proper counselor in these circumstances.  I "
"don't know how we're going to survive for long.  As for me, I wish I could "
"be anywhere but here.  I need to see the sky again, or I'm going to go "
"insane."
msgstr ""
"Burada oldukça zor. Çok fazla insanla çok küçük bir alana sıkıştık. Herkes "
"kendi travmasıyla başa çıkıyor. Rhy yardım etmeye çalışıyor ama bu "
"koşullarda düzgün bir danışman olamaz. Uzun süre nasıl hayatta kalacağımızı "
"bilmiyorum. Benim için, burada olmaktan başka bir yerde olmayı dilerdim. "
"Gökyüzünü tekrar görmek zorundayım, yoksa delireceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "Why not move to the Tacoma Commune?"
msgstr "Neden Tacoma Komünü'ne taşınmıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid "I've got a secure base.  You and your wife could come with me."
msgstr "Güvenli bir üssüm var. Sen ve eşin benimle gelebilirsiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"I heard about that place.  What use would they have for an accountant, "
"though?  If they have work for my wife Dana and I, I'd definitely consider "
"it."
msgstr ""
"O yer hakkında duydum. Ama bir muhasebeciye ne ihtiyaçları var ki? Eğer eşim"
" Dana ve benim için bir iş bulurlarsa, kesinlikle değerlendiririm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"This is amazing news!  Thank you so much!  I've talked to some of the "
"traders who have been there and I really think I can help, mostly with the "
"manual labor but also with the bookkeeping end.  It sounds so much better "
"than this place.  Thanks, my friend!  We'll get packing, and see if we can "
"get a place on the next caravan out.  It'll be a little while I'm sure, but "
"at least our child won't be born in captivity."
msgstr ""
"Bu harika bir haber! Çok teşekkür ederim! Orada bulunan bazı tüccarlarla "
"konuştum ve gerçekten yardımcı olabileceğimi düşünüyorum, çoğunlukla "
"fiziksel işlerde ama aynı zamanda muhasebe kısmında da. Burası buradan çok "
"daha iyi görünüyor. Teşekkürler, dostum! Eşyalarımızı toplayacağız ve bir "
"sonraki kervanda bir yer bulup bulamayacağımıza bakacağız. Biraz zaman "
"alacak, eminim ama en azından çocuğumuz esaret altında doğmayacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
msgid ""
"Really?  I might consider it.  Talk to my wife, Dana.  She's put down a lot "
"more roots here, it would be up to her I think.  I'd go anywhere right now."
msgstr ""
"Gerçekten mi? Bunu düşünebilirim. Eşim Dana ile konuş. Burada çok daha fazla"
" kök saldı, sanırım ona bağlı. Şu anda her yere giderim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Rhyzaea Johnny"
msgstr "Rhyzaea Johnny"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "What brings you around here?  We don't see a lot of new faces."
msgstr "Buralarda seni ne getiriyor?  Yeni yüzler pek görmüyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Need to talk?"
msgstr "Konuşmamız mı gerekiyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"Hi there.  I don't think we've met before.  I'm Rhyzaea, people call me Rhy."
msgstr ""
"Merhaba.  Daha önce tanıştığımızı sanmıyorum.  Ben Rhyzaea, insanlar bana "
"Rhy diyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Rhy."
msgstr "Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Rhy."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Hi, Rhy.  How's it going?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Rhy.  Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "So, what's your story?  We don't see a lot of new people back here."
msgstr "Peki, hikayen nedir?  Burada pek çok yeni insan görmüyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Just a curious traveler.  What's up with you?"
msgstr "Sadece meraklı bir gezginim.  Seninle ne var?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "I'm doing as well as can be expected, I suppose.  Nice of you to ask."
msgstr "Sanırım beklenildiği kadar iyiyim.  Sorduğun için teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"It's a long, long story.  I'm not from around here, I'm actually from way "
"out in Western Canada.  I'd always wanted to see New England, and I was down"
" here on vacation when, well, you know.  I got evacuated, but because I'm "
"not a US citizen they weren't willing to take me downstairs.  I can "
"understand that, even if I don't like it much.  To tell you the truth I'm "
"still coming to terms with the fact that I'll probably never know how my "
"family and my band are doing."
msgstr ""
"Uzun, çok uzun bir hikaye.  Buradan değilim, aslında Batı Kanada'dan "
"geliyorum.  Her zaman Yeni İngiltere'yi görmek istemiştim ve buraya tatilde "
"geldim, neyse ki, biliyorsun.  Tahliye edildim ama ben ABD vatandaşı "
"olmadığım için beni aşağıya almak istemediler.  Bunu anlayabiliyorum, pek "
"hoşuma gitmese de.  Doğruyu söylemek gerekirse, ailemin ve grubumun nasıl "
"olduğunu asla bilemeyeceğim gerçeğiyle hala yüzleşmeye çalışıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Tell me about yourself."
msgstr "Bana kendinden bahset."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Tell me about your family."
msgstr "Bana ailenizden bahset."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Tell me about your band."
msgstr "Bana grubundan bahset."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"I was a counselor actually, I worked for my band, Gitxsan.  Did a lot of "
"mental health and addictions for people that had been through some really "
"tough stuff.  Maybe not zombies eating your child level tough, but "
"surprisingly not far off.  My people have gone through some real messy crap."
msgstr ""
"Aslında bir danışmandım, grubum için çalıştım, Gitxsan. Gerçekten zor şeyler"
" yaşamış insanlar için çokça ruh sağlığı ve bağımlılıkla ilgilendim. Belki "
"çocuğunuzu yiyen zombiler seviyesinde zor değil, ama şaşırtıcı bir şekilde "
"çok da uzak değil. Halkım gerçekten karmaşık şeylerden geçti."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Well, it's been nice talking to you, but I need to head out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"My band is Gitxsan, we're from Northwestern British Columbia, around the "
"Skeena River.  I'm from Hazelton, myself.  It's a beautiful place.  Tall "
"mountains, temperate rainforests… I partly came here because I love those "
"wet coastal forests, and I love exploring them in other countries.  I've "
"been to Korea and Slovakia for the same reason.  I guess I'm a bit of a "
"forest tourist?  I don't know if I'll ever see my own forest again, and the "
"thought breaks my heart."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"My mom and dad are back in Hazelton, they live with my grandma and my older "
"brother; he took a hard knock to the head doing dumb things as a kid, and he"
" can't really take care of himself now.  I have a daughter, Angel, she's "
"sixteen and didn't want to come with me on this trip.  God help me, I can't "
"bear to think of her, she must think I'm dead."
msgstr ""
"Annem ve babam Hazelton'da, büyükannemle ve abimle yaşıyorlar; çocukken "
"aptalca şeyler yaparken kafasına sert bir darbe aldı ve şimdi kendine "
"gerçekten bakamıyor. Bir kızım var, Angel, on altı yaşında ve bu yolculukta "
"benimle gelmek istemedi. Tanrım, onu düşünmeye dayanamıyorum, muhtemelen "
"beni ölmüş sanıyordur."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"It's tense here.  Maybe it always will be.  Still, things have been getting "
"a bit better lately, and it's showing in a bit of a cascade effect.  It's "
"hard to say what will be the ongoing effects of the trauma we've been "
"through, but in the short term, people are starting to settle into whatever "
"this new life we've got is.  I hope we can keep that going."
msgstr ""
"Burada gergin bir atmosfer var. Belki her zaman böyle olacak. Yine de, son "
"zamanlarda işler biraz daha iyiye gitmeye başladı ve bu bir tür zincirleme "
"etki gösteriyor. Geçtiğimiz travmanın devam eden etkilerinin ne olacağını "
"söylemek zor, ama kısa vadede, insanlar bu yeni hayatımıza alışmaya "
"başlıyor. Bunu sürdürebiliriz umarım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"There have been a lot of improvements around here, and I think the pressure "
"has gone off a bit.  There's a lot that still needs to be done, of course.  "
"I don't think we're out of the woods yet.  We've all seen things that are "
"hard to even wrap your head around; you know how that is."
msgstr ""
"Burada birçok iyileşme oldu ve baskının biraz azaldığını düşünüyorum. "
"Elbette hala yapılması gereken çok şey var. Henüz tehlikeden çıkmadığımızı "
"düşünüyorum. Hepimiz kafamızın etrafında döndürmekte zorlandığımız şeyler "
"gördük; bunun nasıl bir şey olduğunu biliyorsunuz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"Things are maybe looking up, a tiny bit.  At least there's been some "
"positive change.  Still, people up here are barely hanging on.  I've seen "
"trauma before, a lot, but this is pretty much the worst imaginable.  "
"Everyone has lost everything, with a huge dose of nightmare on top of it "
"all.  We're putting on a brave face, and a little bit of hope is going a "
"long way."
msgstr ""
"Belki işler biraz daha iyiye gidiyor. En azından bazı olumlu değişiklikler "
"oldu. Yine de, buradaki insanlar zar zor ayakta kalıyor. Daha önce travma "
"gördüm, çokça, ama bu hayal edilebilecek en kötü durum. Herkes her şeyi "
"kaybetti ve bunun üstüne büyük bir kabus eklendi. Cesur bir yüz takınıyoruz "
"ve biraz umut uzun bir yol kat ediyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid ""
"People up here are barely hanging on.  I've seen trauma before, a lot, but "
"this is pretty much the worst imaginable.  Everyone has lost everything, "
"with a huge dose of nightmare on top of it all.  We're putting on a brave "
"face, but without help, things are going to break, really soon."
msgstr ""
"Buradaki insanlar zar zor ayakta kalıyor. Daha önce travma gördüm, çokça, "
"ama bu hayal edilebilecek en kötü durum. Herkes her şeyi kaybetti ve bunun "
"üstüne büyük bir kabus eklendi. Cesur bir yüz takınıyoruz, ama yardım "
"olmadan, işler gerçekten çok yakında kırılacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Stan Borichenko"
msgstr "Stan Borichenko"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Do you want to talk about your story?"
msgstr "Hikayeniz hakkında konuşmak ister misiniz?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hm?  Oh, hi."
msgstr "Hm?  Oh, merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "…Hi."
msgstr "…Merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Hello.  I'm sorry, if we've met before, I don't really remember.  I'm… I'm "
"Stan."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Stan, hey?  Nice to meet you."
msgstr "Stan, öyle mi? Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hi, Stan.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Stan.  Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hi Stan, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Hi Stan.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Huh?  Sorry, yes, nice to meet you too."
msgstr "Ne?  Üzgünüm, evet, seni tanımak güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "You seem distracted."
msgstr "Dikkatini dağıtıyorsun gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I've been through some hard stuff.  I'm not really myself lately."
msgstr ""
"Üzgünüm, zor zamanlar geçirdim.  Son zamanlarda pek kendim gibi değilim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "Sorry to hear that.  I'll leave you be."
msgstr "Bunu duyduğuma üzüldüm.  Seni yalnız bırakacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"No, I don't particularly want to talk about it, but I can I guess.  Before "
"<the_cataclysm> I was an insurance adjuster.  My husband Boris and I were "
"evacuated with my brother Garry, and from our evacuation center we caught a "
"commissioned bus out here.  The bus was attacked by a monster, we lived.  "
"Not everyone on the bus did.  We lost people dear to us, now we're stuck "
"here with little to do but think about it."
msgstr ""
"Hayır, bunun hakkında konuşmak istemiyorum, ama sanırım konuşabilirim.  "
"<the_cataclysm> öncesinde ben bir sigorta eksperiydim.  Kocam Boris ile "
"birlikte kardeşim Garry ile tahliye edildik ve tahliye merkezimizden buraya "
"giden bir kiralık otobüse bindik.  Otobüs bir canavar tarafından saldırıya "
"uğradı, hayatta kaldık.  Otobüsteki herkes hayatta kalmadı.  Bizim için "
"değerli olan insanları kaybettik, şimdi burada düşünmekten başka pek bir şey"
" yapmadan sıkışıp kaldık."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Mostly my family and I have just been mourning.  This isn't the best place "
"to do it.  I hope we'll have something productive to do soon; Boris, in "
"particular, has skills to contribute that might help him feel alive again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Stan_Borichenko.json
msgid "I had better be going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Uyen Tran"
msgstr "Uyen Tran"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Could you teach me a bit about first aid?"
msgstr "Bana biraz ilkyardım öğretebilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Hi there.  You look new, nice to meet you.  My name's Uyen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too, Uyen."
msgstr "Ben de tanıştığımıza memnun oldum, Uyen."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Hi, Uyen.  Got a minute?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Uyen.  Bir dakikan var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Just a traveler.  Can I ask you a few things?"
msgstr "Sadece bir yolcuyum.  Sana birkaç şey sorabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "I'm always good for a talk.  It gets pretty boring down here."
msgstr "Her zaman sohbet etmeye hazırım.  Burada oldukça sıkıcı geçiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"I was a paramedic.  I was there through some of the absolute worst of it, to"
" this day I can't tell you how I made it out.  One thing led to another and "
"I got pushed onto a bus to help take care of a couple people who needed "
"assistance for travel.  Broken arms, that kinda stuff.  I got here early, I "
"was one of the first to arrive.  Then, this woman in processing 'lost' my "
"paperwork while I was busy helping a guy with a bad gash on his head.  If I "
"hadn't made a stink about it, I'd probably be out in the lobby with those "
"poor souls that couldn't get in at all."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I don't see why not.  It's always good to have more people who can do "
"it.  I'll need a bit of payment for my time, of course."
msgstr ""
"Tabii, neden olmasın.  Bunu yapabilen daha fazla insanın olması her zaman "
"iyidir.  Elbette, zamanım için biraz ödeme almam gerekecek."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "All right, let's do it!"
msgstr "Tamam, hadi yapalım!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Actually, I had better go."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"We've got it okay, I guess, as long as this doesn't last too long.  The "
"situation is pretty tight, though.  If we're stuck here for too long people "
"are going to start getting a bit stir crazy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Find Antiseptic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Find Antiseptic'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Find 50 doses of antiseptic for Uyen Tran in the refugee center, in exchange"
" for <reward_count:FMCNote> Merch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"There's the doc out front helping anyone that can pay… but for us up here, "
"money mostly goes to food.  I could do a lot for basic cuts, bruises, and "
"common stuff if I had some supplies to help out.  Could you bring me some "
"antiseptic?  Six bottles would probably be enough to last us a while."
msgstr ""
"Önde, ödeme yapabilen herkese yardım eden doktor var… ama burada, bizim için"
" para çoğunlukla yiyeceğe gidiyor.  Temel kesikler, morluklar ve yaygın "
"şeyler için yardımcı olabilecek bazı malzemelerim olsaydı, çok şey "
"yapabilirdim.  Bana biraz antiseptik getirebilir misin?  Altı şişe, "
"muhtemelen bir süre idare etmemiz için yeterli olur."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Thanks so much.  It's a small thing but it'd be really helpful."
msgstr "Çok teşekkürler.  Küçük bir şey ama gerçekten yardımcı olurdu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "That's okay.  I'm sure we'll make do somehow."
msgstr "Sorun değil. Eminim bir şekilde idare edeceğiz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Lots of people used to have first aid kits in their bathrooms.  I'm sure "
"they can't all have been looted."
msgstr ""
"Birçok insanın banyolarında ilk yardım çantaları vardı. Eminim hepsi "
"yağmalanmamıştır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Thanks so much.  Listen, I told some of the others what you were up to for "
"us and we pooled our cash to thank you.  It's not much but I hope it helps… "
"these are merch, the local money, you can trade them for goods from the "
"shop.  A lot of us will take them in trade too."
msgstr ""
"Çok teşekkür ederim. Dinle, senin bizim için ne yaptığını diğerlerine "
"söyledim ve seni teşekkür etmek için paramızı birleştirdik. Çok fazla değil "
"ama umarım yardımcı olur… bunlar yerel para, dükkanlardan mal almak için "
"takas edebilirsin. Birçok kişi bunları takas olarak alacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Find Bandages"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Find Bandages'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Find 30 bandages for Uyen Tran in the refugee center, in exchange for "
"<reward_count:FMCNote> Merch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"There's the doc out front helping anyone that can pay… but for us up here, "
"money mostly goes to food.  I could do a lot for basic cuts, bruises, and "
"common stuff if I had some supplies to help out.  Could you bring me a few "
"extra bandages?  Thirty would probably be enough to last us a while."
msgstr ""
"Önde, ödeme yapabilen herkese yardım eden doktor var… ama burada, para "
"çoğunlukla yiyeceğe gidiyor. Temel kesikler, morluklar ve yaygın şeyler için"
" çok şey yapabilirim eğer yardımcı olacak bazı malzemelerim olursa. Bana "
"birkaç ekstra bandaj getirebilir misin? Otuz tanesi muhtemelen bir süre "
"idare etmemiz için yeterli olur."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Thanks so much.  Listen, I told some of the others what you were up to for "
"us and we pooled our cash to thank you.  It's not much but I hope it helps… "
"these are merch, the local money, you can trade them for goods from the "
"shop."
msgstr ""
"Çok teşekkür ederim. Dinle, senin bizim için ne yaptığını diğerlerine "
"söyledim ve seni teşekkür etmek için paramızı birleştirdik. Çok fazla değil "
"ama umarım yardımcı olur… bunlar yerel para, dükkanlardan mal almak için "
"takas edebilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "Find Prozac"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Find Prozac'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Find 6 bottles of Prozac for Uyen Tran in the refugee center, in exchange "
"for <reward_count:FMCNote> Merch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "We could still use your help…"
msgstr "Hala yardımına ihtiyacımız var…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"I probably shouldn't be prescribing things, but there's a ton of people "
"needing help with sleep in here.  If you could get us some antidepressants, "
"Rhyzaea and I can probably make sure they're doled out appropriately without"
" people having to starve to pay for them.  Three month's worth - about 6 "
"bottles - would last us a little while."
msgstr ""
"Muhtemelen reçete yazmamam gerekir, ama burada uyku konusunda yardım isteyen"
" tonlarca insan var. Eğer bize biraz antidepresan getirebilirsen, Rhyzaea ve"
" ben muhtemelen bunların uygun şekilde dağıtılmasını sağlayabiliriz, "
"insanların bunlar için aç kalmasına gerek kalmadan. Üç aylık - yaklaşık 6 "
"şişe - yeterince dayanır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Prozac was really common.  You can probably find it in most medicine "
"cabinets and pharmacies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid ""
"Thanks so much.  Listen, I told some of the others what you were up to for "
"us and we pooled our cash to thank you.  You've done a lot to help us out."
msgstr ""
"Çok teşekkürler. Bak, diğerlerine senin bizim için ne yaptığını söyledim ve "
"teşekkür etmek için paramızı birleştirdik. Bize çok yardımcı oldun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Vanessa Toby"
msgstr "Vanessa Toby"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "I'd like to hire out those scissors of yours."
msgstr "O makaslarını kiralamak istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Hmm, can we change this haircut a little please?"
msgstr "Hmm, bu saçı biraz değiştirebilir miyiz lütfen?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Hmm, can we change this shave a little please?"
msgstr "Hmm, bu tıraşı biraz değiştirebilir miyiz lütfen?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Oh, you're back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Oh, great.  Another new mouth to feed?  Just what we need.  Well, I'm "
"Vanessa."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "I'm not a new mouth to feed, but nice to meet you too."
msgstr "Ben yeni bir ağız değilim, ama seni tanımak da güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Hi, Vanessa.  What's up?"
msgstr "Merhaba, Vanessa. Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Yeah, no.  I'm going."
msgstr "Hayır, hayır. Gidiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Well that's good.  If you're going to pull your own weight I guess that's an"
" improvement."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Not much is up.  Not enough, in fact.  Here we are stuck in this slum pit "
"with a bunch of strangers, and all we can do is sit around staring at our "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Pek bir şey yok.  Aslında yeterince değil.  Burada bir grup yabancı ile bu "
"gecekondu çukurunda sıkışıp kaldık ve yapabileceğimiz tek şey ellerimize "
"bakmak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I don't really want to talk about my life before this shit-show, if that's "
"what you mean.  I don't need a shoulder to cry on.  I'm a hairdresser, is "
"that enough personal information for you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Could you give me a haircut?"
msgstr "Bana bir saç kesimi yapar mısın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm stuck in a dank shitty brick building with two dozen strangers, "
"the world's dead, and there's not enough food to go around.  At least I can "
"do some work to keep me busy though, and the extra merch does go a long way "
"to keeping my belly full.  People like getting a good haircut."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"You want the sarcastic version, or the really sarcastic version?  I'm stuck "
"in a dank shitty brick building with two dozen strangers, the world's dead, "
"and there's not enough food to go around.  Why don't you fuckin' figure it "
"out?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I can see you need one, but last time I used these shears it was to stab a "
"zombie in the face.  I don't think you'd want them in your hair.  Maybe you "
"could help me get set up properly?"
msgstr ""
"Birine ihtiyacın olduğunu görebiliyorum, ama bu makası en son bir zombinin "
"yüzüne saplamak için kullandım.  Onları saçında istemezsin sanırım.  Belki "
"bana düzgün bir şekilde hazırlanmakta yardım edebilirsin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "What can I do to help you out?"
msgstr "Sana nasıl yardımcı olabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I can give you a haircut.  It'll be six merch for a haircut, or three "
"for a shave, okay?"
msgstr ""
"Tabii, sana saç tıraşı verebilirim. Saç kesimi için 6 merch, sakal için 3 "
"merch eder, tamam mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Please give me a haircut."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Please give me a shave."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Actually, you owe me a free haircut, remember?"
msgstr "Aslında bana bir saç tıraşı borcun vardı hatırladın mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "That's a bit rich for my blood.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "That's a bit rich for my blood.  I better head out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Ha ha ha ha!  No."
msgstr "Ha ha ha ha! Hayır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "I don't know what I expected."
msgstr "Ne bekledim bilmiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Make A Haircut Kit"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Make A Haircut Kit'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby in the refugee center."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "If I had some equipment, I could do some hairdresser work here."
msgstr "Eğer biraz ekipmanım olsaydı, burada kuaförlük yapabilirdim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I didn't think to pack my hairdressing equipment when I was evacuated.  If "
"you could put together a basic hair cutting kit for me, I could do a bit of "
"styling for people around here.  I'll even give you a free haircut for your "
"troubles."
msgstr ""
"Tahliye edildiğimde kuaförlük ekipmanımı yanımda getirmeyi düşünmemiştim. "
"Eğer benim için basit bir saç kesim kiti hazırlayabilirsen, buradaki "
"insanlar için biraz stil yapabilirim. Sıkıntın için sana ücretsiz bir saç "
"kesimi bile yaparım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Cool, thanks.  It'll be good to have something useful to do, and to not be "
"staring at so many shaggy slobs."
msgstr ""
"Harika, teşekkürler. Yapacak faydalı bir şeyim olacağı için iyi olacak ve bu"
" kadar dağınık insanlara bakmak zorunda kalmayacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Whatever, I'll keep twiddling my thumbs then."
msgstr "Her neyse, parmaklarımı oynatmaya devam edeceğim o zaman."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I don't need too much.  Scissors, a small mirror, a bit of cloth, and some "
"way to keep it all stored clean when I'm not using it, like a leather pouch "
"or something.  I can get the rest of what I need from shelter supplies."
msgstr ""
"Çok fazla bir şeye ihtiyacım yok. Makas, küçük bir ayna, biraz kumaş ve "
"kullanmadığımda hepsini temiz bir şekilde saklayacak bir yol, mesela bir "
"deri çanta veya bir şey. Geri kalan ihtiyaçlarımı barınak malzemelerinden "
"alabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Well, this is pretty serviceable.  Heck, these scissors are nice enough that"
" I could probably inexplicably make your hair longer or a different color "
"with them."
msgstr ""
"Eh, bu oldukça kullanışlı. Vay canına, bu makaslar o kadar güzel ki, "
"muhtemelen saçını açıklanamaz bir şekilde uzatabilir veya farklı bir renge "
"boyayabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Seriously?  You failed to find *scissors*?  How do you tie your shoes in the"
" morning?"
msgstr ""
"Cidden mi? *Makas* bulamadın mı? Sabahları ayakkabılarını nasıl bağlıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "Sorry, but you couldn't pay me enough to go back there."
msgstr "Pardon ama bana oraya geri dönmem için hiçbir şey veremezsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"No way, sorry.  I was in there when things went bad.  It'll be hard enough "
"to go back after it's cleaned up, I can't bear to look at it right now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "I can't.  Too many memories back there.  Sorry."
msgstr "Yapamam. Çok fazla anı var. Üzgünüm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "I wish I could, but no.  I can't face the memories."
msgstr "Keşke yapabilseydim ama yapamam. Anılarımla yüzleşemem."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, no.  That's too much to ask from me.  I was back there when it went "
"wrong."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You won't get much luck asking those of us who were back there I'm afraid.  "
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"Orada olanlardan yardım istemenin pek bir işe yarayacağını sanmıyorum, "
"üzgünüm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "Thanks anyway.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Well, thanks anyway."
msgstr "Yine de teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This is for Boris?  Yeah, Boris is has been through a lot, I'll do it for "
"him."
msgstr "Bu Boris için mi? Evet, Boris çok şey yaşadı, onun için yapacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"It won't be pretty, but I'll see what I can do.  We'll all benefit from it "
"after all."
msgstr ""
"Güzel olmayacak, ama ne yapabileceğime bakacağım. Sonuçta hepimiz bundan "
"faydalanacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "I can try.  It's worth trying for Boris."
msgstr "Denemek istiyorum. Boris için denemeye değer."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "That's a big ask, for sure.  Okay, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""
"Kesinlikle büyük bir istekte bulunuyorsun. Tamam, ne yapabileceğime "
"bakacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Broker"
msgstr "Broker"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I'm here to deliver some food supplies."
msgstr "Erzakları getirdim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"I'm trying to put a cleanup crew together to tidy up the back room.  Can you"
" offer any help?"
msgstr ""
"Arka odayı temizlemek için bir temizlik ekibi toplamaya çalışıyorum. Bana "
"herhangi bir yardım sunabilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Are you able to buy some canning supplies?"
msgstr "Biraz konserve malzemesi satın alabilir misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I was told you had work for me?"
msgstr "Benim için bir işin olduğunu söylediler?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "What's the deal with this written-on paper money you guys use?"
msgstr "Sizin kullandığınız bu yazılı kağıt parayla ne oluyor?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "The refugees stuck up here seem a bit disgruntled."
msgstr "Burada sıkışıp kalan mülteciler biraz memnuniyetsiz görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Do you know about those beggars in the lobby?"
msgstr "Şu lobideki dilencileri biliyormusun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "What's the deal with the closed-off areas of the building?"
msgstr "Binadaki kapalı alanların olayı ne?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"What are you going to do with that back bay area now that I've cleaned it "
"out for you?"
msgstr "Temizlediğim o arka koy alanıyla şimdi ne yapacaksın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Tell me more about that ranch of yours."
msgstr "O çiftliğin hakkında daha fazla bilgi ver."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I'd better get going.  Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "What can I help you with?"
msgstr "Sana nasıl yardımcı olabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Yes, I can buy 500 mL or 3 L glass jars at the moment."
msgstr "Evet, şuanda 500 mL ya da 3 L cam kavanozlar alabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away."
"  I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our "
"supplies.  We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so"
" I prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Merkezdeki yemek stoklarından sorumluyum. Buraya ilk geldiğimiz sırada "
"kargaşa yüzünden yaşanan yağmalanma olaylarından dolayı çok fazla erzağımız "
"çalındı. Erzağımızın bitmemesi için elimden geleni yapıyorum. Taze et ve "
"sebze, meyve gibi yiyecekler elde ettiğimiz bir kaç yerimiz var, bu yüzden "
"mısır unu, kurutulmuş et, meyve şarapları gibi bozulmayan ürünlerin "
"toplanmasına öncelik veriyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away."
"  I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our "
"supplies.  We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so"
" I prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Merkezdeki yemek stoklarından sorumluyum. Buraya ilk geldiğimiz sırada "
"kargaşa yüzünden yaşanan yağmalanma olaylarından dolayı çok fazla erzağımız "
"çalındı. Erzağımızın bitmemesi için elimden geleni yapıyorum. Taze et ve "
"sebze, meyve gibi yiyecekler elde ettiğimiz bir kaç yerimiz var, bu yüzden "
"mısır unu, kurutulmuş et, meyve şarapları gibi bozulmayan ürünlerin "
"toplanmasına öncelik veriyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away."
"  I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our "
"supplies.  We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so"
" I prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Merkezdeki yemek stoklarından sorumluyum. Buraya ilk geldiğimiz sırada "
"kargaşa yüzünden yaşanan yağmalanma olaylarından dolayı çok fazla erzağımız "
"çalındı. Erzağımızın bitmemesi için elimden geleni yapıyorum. Taze et ve "
"sebze, meyve gibi yiyecekler elde ettiğimiz bir kaç yerimiz var, bu yüzden "
"mısır unu, kurutulmuş et, meyve şarapları gibi bozulmayan ürünlerin "
"toplanmasına öncelik veriyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Why cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine?"
msgstr "Neden mısır unu, kurutulmuş et ve meyve şarabı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Okay, but I meant \"who are you\", like, \"what's your story?\""
msgstr "Tamam, ama \"sen kimsin\" demek istemiştim, yani \"hikayen nedir?\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"All three are easy to locally produce in significant quantities and are non-"
"perishable.  We have a local farmer or two and a few hunter types that have "
"been making attempts to provide us with the nutritious supplies.  We do "
"always need more suppliers though.  This stuff is rather cheap in bulk, so I"
" can pay a premium for any you have on you.  Canned food and other edibles "
"are handled by the merchant in the front in trade."
msgstr ""
"Üçü de önemli miktarlarda yerel olarak üretmesi kolay ve bozulmaz. Yerel bir"
" çiftçimiz veya iki çiftçimiz var ve besleyici malzemeleri sağlamaya "
"çalışıyorlar. Ancak her zaman daha fazla tedarikçiye ihtiyacımız var. Bu "
"malzemeler toplu halde oldukça ucuz, bu yüzden yanınızda olanlar için ekstra"
" ödeme yapabilirim. Konserve gıda ve diğer yenilebilirler, önde bulunan "
"tüccar tarafından ticaretle işleniyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Are you looking to buy anything else?"
msgstr "Başka bir şey satın almak mı istiyorsunuz?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Very well… let's talk about something else."
msgstr "Pekala… başka bir şey hakkında konuşalım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I'm sorry, but I'm not here to make friends, I've got a job to do."
msgstr "Üzgünüm, ama burada arkadaş edinmek için değil, bir işim var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"I'm actually accepting a number of different foodstuffs: beer, sugar, flour,"
" smoked meat, smoked fish, dried fruit and vegetables, cooking oil, "
"preservatives like salt and vinegar; and as mentioned before, jerky, "
"cornmeal, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Aslında birçok farklı gıda maddesi kabul ediyorum: bira, şeker, un, "
"tütsülenmiş et, tütsülenmiş balık, kuru meyve ve sebzeler, yemeklik yağ, tuz"
" ve sirke gibi koruyucular; ve daha önce bahsettiğim gibi, kurutulmuş et, "
"mısır unu ve meyve şarabı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"We call them \"Free Merchant Certified Notes\".  We started signing money "
"almost as soon as we got here as a way of showing it represented actual "
"goods and services we had to trade.  Within a few days we'd organized the "
"system, and now it's been evolving into a form of cash.  Internally they're "
"traded for labor and services in exchange for food rations and other trade "
"goods, but we've been using them with suppliers we regularly trade with as "
"well, those that have faith in us."
msgstr ""
"Onlara \"Özgür Tüccarlarının Sertifikalı Notları\" diyoruz. Buraya "
"geldiğimizde, ticaret yapmamız gereken gerçek malları ve hizmetleri temsil "
"ettiğini göstermek için neredeyse hemen para imzalamaya başladık. Birkaç gün"
" içinde sistemi organize ettik ve şimdi nakit biçimine evriliyor. İçeride, "
"gıda rasyonları ve diğer ticaret malları karşılığında iş gücü ve hizmetler "
"için takas ediliyor, ancak düzenli ticaret yaptığımız tedarikçilerle de "
"kullanıyoruz, bize güvenenlerle."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's a tough situation.  When we started out here nobody was really in"
" charge, and we let more in than we really had capacity to feed and support."
"  When the dust settled and we'd established a little order, there were "
"still all these people upstairs waiting for a place to live, and no space.  "
"We've set up a little space for them, but it's not ideal."
msgstr ""
"Evet, zor bir durum. Burada başladığımızda kimse gerçekten sorumlu değildi "
"ve besleyip destekleyebileceğimizden daha fazlasını içeri aldık. Toz "
"dindiğinde ve biraz düzen kurduğumuzda, hala yukarıda yaşamak için bekleyen "
"tüm bu insanlar vardı ve yer yoktu. Onlar için küçük bir alan oluşturduk, "
"ama ideal değil."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"I do.  I don't know what you did to convince them to move out, but our "
"supply chain and I both thank you.  I hope it wasn't too unseemly."
msgstr ""
"Evet, yaptım. Onları dışarı çıkmaya ikna etmek için ne yaptığını bilmiyorum "
"ama tedarik zincirimiz ve ben sana teşekkür ediyoruz. Umarım çok çirkin "
"olmamıştır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Even once we got things sorted out, there weren't enough beds for everyone, "
"and definitely not enough supplies.  These are harsh times.  We're doing "
"what we can for those folks… at least they've got shelter."
msgstr ""
"Her şeyi düzene koyduktan sonra bile, herkes için yeterli yatak yoktu ve "
"kesinlikle yeterli malzeme de yoktu. Bu zor zamanlar. O insanlar için "
"elimizden geleni yapıyoruz… en azından barınakları var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Well, there's the downstairs section, we can't fit more people down there so"
" it's out of bounds.  Then there's the second bay that we were using as a "
"staging area at first.  Things went… wrong.  I hear the shopkeeper is "
"offering a reward to clear it out, if you're feeling suicidal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "What went wrong with your staging area?"
msgstr "Hazırlık alanınızda ne yanlış gitti?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"We didn't have great organization when we first arrived.  A few of the "
"earliest arrivals set up a triage and sorting system, with the sick and "
"infirm getting set aside to wait.  It's cruel, but we could see there was "
"only space for so many, and we didn't know what was causing people to turn "
"into zombies at the time, so we were trying to quarantine out infection.  A "
"couple folks died in there, and it escalated.  One of the first people here,"
" Jacob, had taken charge of the whole thing.  When the triage area had to be"
" evacuated he stayed behind to make sure everyone who could get out got out."
"  It was a hell of a loss."
msgstr ""
"İlk geldiğimizde iyi bir organizasyonumuz yoktu. İlk gelenlerden birkaçı, "
"hasta ve zayıf olanların beklemesi için bir triage ve sıralama sistemi "
"kurdu. Bu acımasızdı, ama orada yalnızca bu kadar insan için yer olduğunu "
"görebiliyorduk ve o zaman insanların neden zombilere dönüştüğünü "
"bilmiyorduk, bu yüzden enfeksiyonu karantinaya almaya çalışıyorduk. Orada "
"birkaç kişi öldü ve işler büyüdü. Buradaki ilk insanlardan biri olan Jacob, "
"tüm durumu üstlendi. Triage alanı tahliye edilmesi gerektiğinde, çıkabilen "
"herkesin çıkmasını sağlamak için geride kaldı. Bu büyük bir kayıptı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Thanks, can I ask you something else?"
msgstr "Teşekkürler, başka bir şey sorabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for that.  We don't have any immediate plans for the area.  Once "
"it's cleaned up I suppose we'll let the people living up here decide what to"
" do with it."
msgstr ""
"Bunun için teşekkür ederim. Bölge için hemen bir planımız yok. "
"Temizlendikten sonra burada yaşayan insanların ne yapacağına karar vermesine"
" izin vereceğiz sanırım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"I'm so glad we've got that up and running.  One of the people evacuated here"
" had a connection to a functioning ranch, and we got him and a crew out "
"there as quickly as we were able.  We're hoping they'll be able to supply us"
" in enough foodstuffs to make this place self-sufficient and even to trade "
"with other communities as they arise."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"You'd be better off asking the shopkeeper up front, I'm the quartermaster."
msgstr ""
"Ön taraftaki dükkan sahibine sormanız daha iyi olur, ben malzeme "
"sorumlusuyum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
msgstr "In a Pickle Pt. 2"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'In a Pickle Pt. 2'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Deliver 50 large three-liter jars in exchange for <reward_count:FMCNote> "
"certified notes."
msgstr ""
"<reward_count:FMCNote> sertifikalı not karşılığında 50 büyük üç litrelik "
"kavanoz teslim edin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I do have some work for you."
msgstr "Sizin için biraz işim var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"You heard right.  When you brought in those canning jars, it got us thinking"
" about expanding our food storage from dehydrated to include cans.  We could"
" use some larger jars though for big stock items.  Can you bring me 50 large"
" three liter jars?  I'll pay you a Certified Note per two."
msgstr ""
"Doğru duydunuz. O konserve kavanozlarını getirdiğinizde, gıda depolamamızı "
"kurutulmuş gıdalardan konserve içerecek şekilde genişletmeyi düşündük. Ancak"
" büyük stok ürünleri için daha büyük kavanozlara ihtiyacımız var. Bana 50 "
"adet üç litrelik büyük kavanoz getirebilir misiniz? İki tanesi için size bir"
" Sertifika Notu ödeyeceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  Once we get a cottage industry set up with some of our "
"inhabitants, I'll be able to start buying these from you and other "
"scavengers in smaller lots.  This should be enough to test out our "
"equipment."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler. Birkaç sakinimizle bir küçük sanayi kurduğumuzda, bunları "
"sizden ve diğer hurda toplayıcılardan daha küçük partiler halinde almaya "
"başlayabileceğim. Bu, ekipmanımızı test etmek için yeterli olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Wow, that's a lot more jars than it sounded on paper.  Thanks.  Here's your "
"payment."
msgstr ""
"Vay, bu kağıtta duyduğumdan çok daha fazla kavanoz. Teşekkürler. İşte "
"ödemeniz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_hostile_guard.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Guard"
msgstr "Muhafız"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Hello marshal."
msgstr "Merhaba mareşal."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Can I join you guys?"
msgstr "Sizinle katılabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Anything I can do for you?"
msgstr "Size yardımcı olabileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "See you later."
msgstr "Görüşürüz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "This is a refugee center that we've made into a sort of trading hub."
msgstr ""
"Burası, bir tür ticaret merkezi haline getirdiğimiz bir mülteci merkezi."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "So are you with the government or something?"
msgstr "Yani hükümetle mi çalışıyorsunuz yoksa?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "What do you trade?"
msgstr "Ne ile ticaret yapıyorsunuz?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha, no.  Though there is Old Guard somewhere around here if you have "
"any questions relating to what the government is up to."
msgstr ""
"Ha ha ha, hayır. Ancak burada hükümetin ne yaptığıyla ilgili sorularınız "
"varsa, bir yerde Eski Muhafızlar var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Oh, okay.  I'll go look for him"
msgstr "Oh, tamam. Onu bulmaya gideceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"Anything valuable really.  If you really want to know, go ask one of the "
"actual traders.  I'm just protection."
msgstr ""
"Gerçekten değerli olan her şey. Eğer gerçekten bilmek istiyorsan, gerçek "
"tüccarlardan birine sor. Ben sadece korumayım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "I'll go talk to them later."
msgstr "Onlarla daha sonra konuşacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Will do, thanks!"
msgstr "Yapacağım, teşekkürler!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "Hayır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "That's pretty blunt!"
msgstr "Bu oldukça açık!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Death is pretty blunt."
msgstr "Ölüm oldukça açık."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "So no negotiating?  No, 'If you do this quest then we'll let you in?'"
msgstr ""
"Yani pazarlık yok mu? Hayır, 'Eğer bu görevi yaparsan seni içeri alacağız "
"mı?'"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "I don't like your attitude."
msgstr "Tavrını beğenmedim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Well alright then."
msgstr "Peki o zaman."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Then leave, you have two feet."
msgstr "O zaman git, iki ayağın var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "I think I'd rather rearrange your face instead!"
msgstr "Sanırım yüzünü yeniden düzenlemeyi tercih ederim!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Yapacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"Depends on what you want.  Go talk to a merchant if you have anything to "
"sell.  Otherwise the Old Guard liaison might have something, if you can find"
" him.  But if you're just looking for someone to put a good word in, I might"
" have something for you."
msgstr ""
"Ne istediğine bağlı. Satacak bir şeyin varsa bir tüccarla konuş. Aksi "
"takdirde, Eski Muhafız bağlantısının bir şeyleri olabilir, eğer onu "
"bulabilirsen. Ama eğer sadece birinin iyi bir söz söylemesini istiyorsan, "
"senin için bir şeyim olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Alright then."
msgstr "Tamam o zaman."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "A good word might be helpful.  What do you need?"
msgstr "İyi bir söz yardımcı olabilir. Ne ihtiyacın var?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Old Guard huh, I'll go talk to him!"
msgstr "Eski Muhafızlar mı, onunla konuşmaya gideceğim!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Who are the Old Guard?"
msgstr "Eski Muhafızlar kim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"That's just our nickname for them.  They're what's left of the federal "
"government.  Don't know how legitimate they are but they are named after "
"some military unit that once protected the president.  Their liaison is "
"usually hanging around here somewhere."
msgstr ""
"Bu sadece onlara verdiğimiz takma ad. Federal hükümetin geriye kalan kısmı "
"onlar. Ne kadar meşru olduklarını bilmiyorum ama bir zamanlar başkanı "
"koruyan bir askeri birimden adlarını alıyorlar. Genellikle buradaki bir "
"yerde bağlantıları dolaşıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Whatever, I had another question."
msgstr "Her neyse, başka bir sorum vardı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Okay, I'll go look for him then."
msgstr "Tamam, o zaman onu aramaya gideceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"Stay safe out there.  Hate to have to kill you after you've already died."
msgstr ""
"Dışarıda güvende kal. Zaten öldükten sonra seni öldürmek zorunda kalmaktan "
"nefret ediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Smokes, let's go."
msgstr "Sigara, hadi gidelim."

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': "Smokes, let's go."}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"Make a friend at the refugee center by handing over around five packs - 100 "
"cigarettes."
msgstr ""
"Mülteci merkezinde bir arkadaş edinmek için yaklaşık beş paket - 100 sigara "
"ver."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Come on man, I just need a smoke."
msgstr "Hadi dostum, sadece bir sigaraya ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"With all that's been going on, it's been more and more difficult to find a "
"smoke.  My stash has been running low for a while now.  Think you could help"
" me out here?  A few packs is all I need."
msgstr ""
"Tüm bunlar olurken, sigara bulmak giderek daha zor hale geldi. Stoklarım bir"
" süredir azalıyor. Burada bana yardım edebileceğini düşünüyor musun? Birkaç "
"paket yeter."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Thanks, it's great to see someone willing to help a guy out."
msgstr "Teşekkürler, birine yardım etmeye istekli birini görmek harika."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Well, I'll find someone else to do it for me."
msgstr "Peki, benim için bunu yapacak başka birini bulacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid ""
"Plenty of smokers in towns.  Gotta be some left over cigs in some of them "
"houses."
msgstr ""
"Şehirlerde pek çok sigara içen var. Bazı evlerde kalan sigaralar olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Got the smokes?"
msgstr "Sigara var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Thanks!  I'll be sure to put in a good word for you around the center."
msgstr "Teşekkürler! Seni merkezde iyi bir şekilde anacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "I am actually new."
msgstr "Aslında yeniyim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Are there any rules I should follow while inside?"
msgstr "İçeride uymam gereken kurallar var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "So who is everyone around here?"
msgstr "Burada herkes kim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Lets trade!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help?"
msgstr "Yardım edebileceğim bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Thanks!  I will be on my way."
msgstr "Teşekkürler! Yolda olacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Yes of course.  Just don't bring any trouble and it's all fine by me."
msgstr "Evet tabii ki. Sadece sorun çıkarma, her şey benim için tamam."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid ""
"Well mostly no.  Just don't go around robbing others and starting fights and"
" you will be all set.  Also, don't go into the basement.  Outsiders are not "
"allowed in there."
msgstr ""
"Aslında hayır. Sadece başkalarını soymaya ve kavga çıkarmaya kalkışma, her "
"şey yolunda gidecek. Ayrıca, bodruma girme. Oraya dışarıdan gelenler "
"giremez."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Ok, thanks."
msgstr "Tamam, teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "So uhhh, why not?"
msgstr "Yani, neden olmasın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid ""
"In short, we had a problem when a sick refugee died and turned into a "
"zombie.  We had to expel the refugees and most of our surviving group now "
"stays to the basement to prevent it from happening again.  Unless you really"
" prove your worth I don't foresee any exceptions to that rule."
msgstr ""
"Kısacası, hasta bir mülteci öldüğünde ve zombi haline geldiğinde bir problem"
" yaşadık. Mültecileri kovmak zorunda kaldık ve hayatta kalan grubumuzun çoğu"
" şimdi tekrar olmasını önlemek için bodrumda kalıyor. Gerçekten değerini "
"kanıtlamadıkça bu kuralda herhangi bir istisna görmüyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid ""
"Most are scavengers like you.  They now make a living by looting the cities "
"in search for anything useful: food, weapons, tools, gasoline.  In exchange "
"for their findings we offer them a temporary place to rest and the services "
"of our shop.  I bet some of them would be willing to organize resource runs "
"with you if you ask."
msgstr ""
"Çoğu senin gibi hurda toplayıcı. Artık şehirleri yağmalayarak yiyecek, "
"silah, alet, benzin gibi faydalı şeyler arayarak geçim sağlıyorlar. "
"Buldukları karşılığında onlara dinlenmeleri için geçici bir yer ve "
"dükkanımızın hizmetlerini sunuyoruz. Eğer istersen, bazıları seninle kaynak "
"toplama organizasyonu yapmaya istekli olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid "Thanks for the heads-up."
msgstr "Bilgilendirme için teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard2.json
msgid ""
"You are asking the wrong person, should look for our merchant by the main "
"entrance.  Perhaps one of the scavengers is also interested."
msgstr ""
"Yanlış kişiye soruyorsun, ana girişteki tüccarımızı aramalısın. Belki de "
"hurda toplayıcılardan biri de ilgileniyordur."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Keep to yourself and you won't find any problems."
msgstr "Kendine dikkat et, sorun yaşamazsın."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "What do you do around here?"
msgstr "Burada ne yapıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Got tips for avoiding trouble?"
msgstr "Sorunlardan kaçınmak için ipuçların var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Have you seen anyone who might be hiding something?"
msgstr "Bir şeyleri saklayabilecek birini gördün mü?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Bye…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid ""
"I haven't been here for long but I do my best to watch who comes and goes.  "
"You can't always predict who will bring trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Keep your head down and stay out of my way."
msgstr "Başını eğik tut ve yolumdan çekil."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "OK…"
msgstr "Tamam…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr "Ne gibi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "I'm not sure…"
msgstr "Emin değilim…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Like they could be working for someone else?"
msgstr "Başka birisi için çalışıyor olabilirler mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "You're new here, who the hell put you up to this crap?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Get bent, traitor!"
msgstr "Sıvan git, hain!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Got something to hide?"
msgstr "Gizleyecek bir şeyin mi var?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean to offend you…"
msgstr "Üzgünüm, seni kırmak istemedim…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid ""
"If you don't get on with your business I'm going to have to ask you to leave"
" and not come back."
msgstr ""
"Eğer işine dönmezsen, seni buradan göndermek zorunda kalacağım ve bir daha "
"geri gelmemen gerektiğini söyleyeceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Üzgünüm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "That's it, you're dead!"
msgstr "İşte bu kadar, öldün!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "I didn't mean it!"
msgstr "Bunu kastetmedim!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid "You must really have a death wish!"
msgstr "Gerçekten bir intihar isteğiniz olmalı!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
msgid ""
"We don't put-up with garbage like you, finish your business and get the hell"
" out."
msgstr "Sizin gibi çöplere tahammül etmiyoruz, işinizi bitirin ve defolun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "I'm not in charge here, you're looking for someone else…"
msgstr "Burada ben sorumlu değilim, başka birini arıyorsun..."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Keep civil or I'll bring the pain."
msgstr "Nazik olun yoksa acıyı getiririm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Just on watch, move along."
msgstr "Sadece gözetimdeyim, devam edin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Don't distract me.  I'm on watch."
msgstr "Beni rahatsız etme. Görevdeyim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Hello.  Welcome to our safe zone."
msgstr "Merhaba. Güvenli bölgemize hoş geldiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Good evening.  Welcome to our safe zone."
msgstr "İyi akşamlar. Güvenli bölgemize hoş geldiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Rough out there, isn't it?"
msgstr "Dışarıda zor, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Ma'am, you really shouldn't be traveling out there."
msgstr "Hanımefendi, dışarıda seyahat etmemelisiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "How did you get saddled with guard duty?"
msgstr "Nöbet tutma görevi size nasıl verildi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Nothing too fancy.  We have a rota of anyone able bodied that can handle "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"Çok özel bir şey yok. Kendini idare edebilen herkes için bir rota "
"oluşturduk."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "None of your business really, is it."
msgstr "Gerçekten senin işin değil, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Gotta earn my keep."
msgstr "Geçimimi kazanmalıyım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "It's honest work, and now and then I get to take a zombie down."
msgstr "Bu dürüst bir iş ve ara sıra bir zombiyi devirmeyi başarıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Talk to one of the bosses about that.  You'd have to pay me to go back there"
" though, that's gonna be a hell of a job."
msgstr ""
"Bununla ilgili patronlardan biriyle konuş. Ama oraya geri dönmek için bana "
"para vermen gerekecek, bu gerçekten zor bir iş olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I don't have a lot of free time for that sort of thing.  Maybe talk to the "
"shopkeep, they know more about scheduling and stuff."
msgstr ""
"Bunun gibi şeyler için pek fazla boş zamanım yok. Belki dükkân sahibine sor,"
" programlama ve benzeri konularda daha fazla bilgiye sahipler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Nah."
msgstr "Hayır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I'd rather stand around looking threatening than scrub gore out of the "
"tiles."
msgstr ""
"Korkutucu görünmek için etrafta durmayı tercih ederim, karoların arasındaki "
"kanı temizlemektense."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Not unless you pay me.  Try the shopkeep, they can sell our services just "
"like anything else."
msgstr ""
"Beni ödemezsen yapmam. Dükkan sahibine sor, hizmetlerimizi diğer her şey "
"gibi satabilirler."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Merchant"
msgstr "Tüccar"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Can I talk to you about that fellow over there in the dinosaur suit?"
msgstr "Oradaki dinozor kostümlü adam hakkında seninle konuşabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I heard this place was a refugee center…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your group?"
msgstr "Grubunuza katılmanın bir yolu var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "What's with these beggars?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I took care of your beggar problem."
msgstr "Dilencinle ilgili sorunu hallettim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Can I do anything for the center?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "When will you have new stuff in stock?"
msgstr "Yeni ürünler ne zaman stokta olacak?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "What's with these 'free merchant certified notes'?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Well, I'd better be going.  Bye."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Next shipment should arrive in around <interval>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Stick around for <interval>, there will surely be something you'd like."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Actually, I wanted to ask…"
msgstr "Aslında, sormak istedim…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Thanks, I will make sure to check back.  Farewell."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Welcome marshal…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Welcome…"
msgstr "Hoş geldin…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Before you say anything else, we're full.  We don't have the space, nor the "
"food, to take in more refugees.  We do desperately need supplies and are "
"willing to trade what we can for it.  Pay top dollar for jerky if you have "
"any; just talk to the broker in the back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"To be honest, we started out with six buses full of office workers and "
"soccer moms… we did what we could to sort through the masses, take the "
"people with the best chance of survival first.  It sounds harsh but it was "
"the only option.  The only thing we want now is to run enough trade through "
"here to keep us alive… with our address in the evac shelter computers, "
"people keep coming here and we have to turn them away, but we've found we "
"can trade their salvage for what we've got.  We plan to turn that into a "
"business model.  Don't care who your goods come from or how you got them, "
"just don't bring trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "It's just as bad out there, if not worse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but the only way we're going to make it is if we keep our gates "
"buttoned fast.  The guards in the basement have orders to shoot on sight, if"
" you so much as peep your head in the lower levels.  I don't know what made "
"the scavengers out there so ruthless but some of us have had to kill our own"
" bloody kids… don't even think about strong arming us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"[INT 10] Wait, six buses and refugees… how many people do you still have "
"crammed in here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Downstairs, a few dozen.  Seventeen more living up here, until we can figure"
" out a way to make space for them.  There used to be quite a few more, but "
"things were handled poorly in the chaos, and we lost a few, and their loss "
"triggered a few more.  It wasn't a good time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Well, like many, I'd rather not get into my life before this.  That's all "
"gone, dead, risen, dead again.  I used to own a little store though, that's "
"why they've got me up here doing this… and that's all I'm going to say about"
" myself.  I'm on the clock, after all."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Had one guy pop in here a while back saying he had tried to drive into "
"Syracuse after the outbreak.  Didn't even make it downtown before he ran "
"into a wall of the living dead that could stop a tank.  He hightailed it out"
" but claims there were several thousand at least.  Guess when you get a "
"bunch of them together they end up making enough noise to attract everyone "
"in the neighborhood.  Luckily we haven't had a mob like that pass by here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Well, there is a party of about a dozen 'scavengers' that found some sort of"
" government facility.  They bring us a literal truck load of jumpsuits, "
"m4's, and canned food every week or so.  Since some of those guys got family"
" here, we've been doing alright.  As to where it is, I don't have the "
"foggiest of ideas."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Thanks, I'll keep an eye out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"We had an odd group came by two days after the power grid went off, two "
"armed guards wearing brown uniforms, escorting what seemed to be a gov' "
"doctor of some sort, had a hazmat suit and mask they never took off.  They "
"looked rather organized, probably military remnant from somewhere close by."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I was hoping for something more substantial than that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Just that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"They surely didn't seem the nice talkative type.  Doctor paid us in advance "
"to get some old FEMA info from our computers here, told us to deliver the "
"data to some remote locale afterwards.  Still haven't done that however, "
"we're half thinking it must have been some sort of strange trap."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Think you could share that meeting location?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Seems like you are right to be suspicious."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"I could share the drop off location if you agree to deliver the data for us."
"  But I'm certain that you won't find whatever you seek in there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Seems like a deal to me."
msgstr "Bana bir anlaşma gibi geliyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "That seems rather dangerous, I think I'll pass."
msgstr "Bu oldukça tehlikeli görünüyor, sanırım geçeceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Location should be an old isolated building not far from here, you should "
"probably just leave the hdd to the persons there and be off your way.  And "
"as I said, be careful approaching the place, I wouldn't like leading you "
"straight into your death."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'll be careful."
msgstr "Endişelenmeyin, dikkatli olacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Pretty sure I'll manage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I'm sorry, not a risk we are willing to take right now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Fine…"
msgstr "Tamam…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"There isn't a chance in hell!  We had one guy come in here with bloody fur "
"all over his body… well I guess that isn't all that strange but I'm pretty "
"sure whatever toxic waste is still out there is bound to mutate more than "
"just his hair."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Fine… *coughupyourscough*"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, last thing we need is another mouth to feed.  Most of us lack any "
"real survival skills so keeping our group small enough to survive on the "
"food random scavengers bring to trade with us is important."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I'm sure I can do something to change your mind *wink*"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I can pull my own weight!"
msgstr "Kendi yükümü kaldırabilirim!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"[INT 11] I'm sure I can organize salvage operations to increase the bounty "
"scavengers bring in!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "[STR 11] I punch things in face real good!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I guess I'll look somewhere else…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Can't say we've heard much.  Most these shelters seemed to have been "
"designed to make people feel safer… not actually aid in their survival.  Our"
" radio equipment is utter garbage that someone convinced the government to "
"buy, with no intention of it ever being used.  From the passing scavengers "
"I've heard nothing but prime loot'n spots and rumors of hordes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Hordes?"
msgstr "Sürüler mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Heard of anything better than the odd gun cache?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Any other settlements nearby?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Was hoping for something more…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"They're folks that wanted to come down to our shelter, but we're too full "
"and have neither space nor supplies to share.  Most like them have turned "
"and gone seeking their own place, but these ones… these ones didn't.  We've "
"been trying to find them a safe place, but there's a shortage of safety "
"going around.  Until then we're letting them crash here so long as they "
"don't mess the place up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"[SPEECH] I don't suppose there'd be some kind of reward if I could clear "
"them out of here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"We don't have much to share, but I'm sure we could pay you in our own "
"currency if you could clean up our burgeoning health hazard without anyone "
"getting hurt, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"It was a fine thing you did, taking those poor souls somewhere safe.  I "
"assume that's what you did.  If you have other plans, I still appreciate "
"having the lobby clear, but please let me live in my happy imaginings.  I'm "
"sure they're out frolicking in a nice field somewhere.  It's a shame that "
"cardboard fellow didn't go too, but he's relatively easy to handle alone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I do believe we discussed a reward?"
msgstr "Bir ödül hakkında konuştuğumuzu düşünüyorum?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Just glad to help."
msgstr "Sadece yardımcı olmaktan mutluyum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"And so we did.  You didn't do the full job, but we're fair people here.  "
"Here's five merch a head for the folks you found a new home for."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"One of the people that got evacuated here was actually on a charter bus "
"taking him back to his ranch, 'til it was commandeered to be an evacuation "
"vehicle and brought him here.  Once the dust shook out we made a deal to get"
" him home and provide him with labor in return for making the ranch into a "
"subsidiary of our dealings here.  It worked out pretty well for everyone, "
"most of the people with skills for that kind of work are already out there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Didn't that free up some space for the beggars and people stuck upstairs?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Thanks for the story."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, no.  Most of the people who left were already stuck upstairs,"
" they were taking on less risk than those with a safe bed already.  We only "
"got a few people out of the basement, and it was already overcrowded when we"
" started.  We're kind of hoping more folk will head out to the ranch for "
"sun, fresh air, and hard work… but people are a bit afraid of getting "
"attacked by zombie hordes, as you might guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Oh, they're just what we're using for local cash.  We started out paying "
"each other in regular cash, but there's so much paper money out there that "
"it's just useless now.  For our internal use, we started certifying bills "
"that represent food and labour in the center here.  Pretty quickly we "
"started trading them among ourselves, and from there, others started "
"adopting them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Hmm.  Most of the people downstairs aren't willing to come up for things "
"like that.  If you sweeten the pot a bit, we could get a few folks I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "How about five Merch to do it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "How about ten Merch to do it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Sure.  Five Merch is definitely enough to get someone off guard duty to help"
" you out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Woah, you're really intent hey?  Okay, if you feel so strongly, ten Merch is"
" enough to get a couple people out of guard duty to help, and you know what?"
"  If you feel that strongly about it, I'll come help out in my down time "
"too.  I respect someone putting their money where their mouth is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Clear Back Bay"
msgstr "Back Bay'ı temizle"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Clear Back Bay'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Clear out the barricaded back area in the refugee center and lay the former "
"leader of the Free Merchants to rest, in exchange for the local currency: "
"Free Merchant certified notes."
msgstr ""
"Mülteci merkezindeki barikatlı arka alanı temizle ve Özgür Tüccarların eski "
"liderini yerleştir, yerel para birimi karşılığında: Özgür Tüccar sertifikalı"
" notlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"If you really want to lend a hand we could use your help clearing out the "
"dead in the back bay.  Fearful of going outside during the first days of the"
" Cataclysm we ended up throwing our dead and the zombies we managed to kill "
"in the sealed back bay.  Our promising leader at the time even fell… he "
"turned into something different.  Kill all of them and make sure they won't "
"bother us again.  We can't pay much, besides some of our own internal money "
"which isn't good for that much yet, but it would help us to reclaim the bay."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Please be careful, we don't need any more deaths."
msgstr "Lütfen dikkatli ol, daha fazla ölüme ihtiyacımız yok."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"Come back when you get a chance, we really need to start reclaiming the "
"region."
msgstr ""
"Bir fırsat bulduğunda geri gel, gerçekten bölgeyi geri kazanmaya başlamamız "
"gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "If you can, get a friend or two to help you."
msgstr "Eğer yapabiliyorsan, sana yardım etmesi için bir veya iki arkadaş al."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Will they be bothering us any longer?"
msgstr "Bize daha fazla rahatsızlık verecekler mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, having that big of a threat close to home was nerve wracking.  "
"Here's some of our local certified notes, we've been paying these to our "
"workers in exchange for supplies.  They're getting some value in the center "
"as a trade item, I'm afraid they're all we have to spare at the moment."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim, evime bu kadar büyük bir tehditin yakın olması sinir "
"bozucuydu. İşte yerel sertifikalı notlarımızdan bazıları, bunları tedarik "
"karşılığında işçilerimize ödüyorduk. Merkezde ticaret öğesi olarak bir değer"
" kazanıyorlar, korkarım şu anda elimizde fazladan olan tek şey bunlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Missing Caravan"
msgstr "Kayıp Kervan"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Missing Caravan'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Investigate the last known location of a disappeared scavenger trading "
"party, and eliminate any bandits or raiders in the vicinity in exchange for "
"<reward_count:FMCNote> certified notes."
msgstr ""
"Kaybolan bir hurda ticaret partisinin en son bilinen konumunu araştırın ve "
"çevredeki herhangi bir haydut veya akıncıyı <reward_count:FMCNote> onaylı "
"not karşılığında ortadan kaldırın."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"This is a bit more involved than the last request, we recently lost a "
"scavenger party coming to trade with us and would like you to investigate.  "
"We strongly suspect a raider band or horde caught them off-guard.  I can "
"give you the coordinates of their last radio message but little else.  In "
"either case, deal with the threat so that the scavengers can continue to "
"pass through in relative safety.  The best reward I can offer is a claim to "
"the supplies they were carrying, plus thirty certified notes - that's our "
"own internal money, good for trading and such."
msgstr ""
"Bu, son isteğe göre biraz daha karmaşık, bizimle ticaret yapmak için gelen "
"bir hurda partisinin kaybolduğunu yeni öğrendik ve araştırmanızı istiyoruz. "
"Bir akıncı çetesi veya ordusunun onları hazırlıksız yakaladığından "
"şüpheleniyoruz. Son radyo mesajlarının koordinatlarını verebilirim ama başka"
" pek bir şey yok. Her durumda, tehdit ile ilgilenin ki hurda toplayıcıları "
"görece daha güvenli bir şekilde geçiş yapabilsin. Size sunabileceğim en iyi "
"ödül, taşıdıkları malzemelere sahip olma hakkı ve artı otuz Merch - bu bizim"
" kendi iç paramız, ticaret için geçerli."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Our community survives on trade, we appreciate it."
msgstr "Topluluğumuz ticaretle hayatta kalıyor, bunu takdir ediyoruz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Have you dealt with them?"
msgstr "Onlarla başa çıktın mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, the world is a better place without them.  Two of our more "
"skilled individuals accepted the assistance of the Old Guard in setting up "
"an outpost while you were out.  We didn't have many other options, refugees "
"are still streaming in and we don't know what else to do with our limited "
"food supply.  If you get a chance, you should see if they need your "
"assistance in the future…"
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim, dünya onların olmadığı bir yer. Daha yetenekli iki "
"bireyimiz, siz dışarıdayken bir karakol kurmak için Eski Muhafızların "
"yardımını kabul etti. Başka pek seçeneğimiz yoktu, mülteciler hala akın akın"
" geliyor ve sınırlı gıda kaynağımızla ne yapacağımızı bilmiyoruz. Bir fırsat"
" bulursanız, gelecekte onlara yardım edip edemeyeceğinizi görmelisiniz…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Retrieve Prospectus"
msgstr "Prospektüsü Al"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Retrieve Prospectus'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Visit the farming commune and bring the foreman's prospectus back to the "
"refugee center, for <reward_count:FMCNote> certified notes."
msgstr ""
"Tarım komününe gidin ve ustabaşının prospektüsünü mülteci merkezine geri "
"getirin, karşılığında <reward_count:FMCNote> Merch alacaksınız."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"We recently set out some skilled people to start an outpost, to secure us "
"some food supplies in a safer location.  The new outpost that we've started "
"could use your assistance.  I need you to get the foreman's prospectus "
"before we begin to send additional refugees to the farming commune.  Consult"
" with the foreman to get more detailed tasks.  We've got 50 Certified Notes "
"for you if you can do this for us."
msgstr ""
"Son zamanlarda, daha güvenli bir yerde gıda kaynakları sağlamak için bir "
"karakol kurmak üzere yetenekli insanları görevlendirdik. Başlattığımız yeni "
"karakol sizin yardımınıza ihtiyaç duyuyor. Tarım komününe ek mülteciler "
"göndermeye başlamadan önce ustabaşının prospektüsünü almanızı istiyorum. "
"Daha ayrıntılı görevler almak için ustabaş ile görüşün. Eğer bunu bizim için"
" yapabilirseniz size 50 Merch vereceğiz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "I'm sure the outpost will expand quickly with your assistance."
msgstr "Eminim karakol sizin yardımınızla hızla genişleyecek."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Just follow your map."
msgstr "Haritanızı takip edin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Do you have the prospectus?"
msgstr "Prospektüsü aldınız mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"With this we'll be able to convince others to invest in the commune.  Thank "
"you, here's your money.  We also managed to get a manual crank hooked up to "
"the garage in the back, so feel free to make use of that - you've been a "
"great help to us."
msgstr ""
"Bununla diğerlerini komüne yatırım yapmaya ikna edebileceğiz. Teşekkür "
"ederim, işte paranız. Ayrıca arka taraftaki garaja bir manuel krank "
"bağlamayı başardık, bu yüzden onu kullanmaktan çekinmeyin - bize büyük bir "
"yardımda bulundunuz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Solar Power"
msgstr "Güneş Enerjisi"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Solar Power'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Deliver 10 solar panels to help the Free Merchants set up a renewable power "
"grid, in exchange for a handsome reward."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"We are starting to build new infrastructure here and would like to get a few"
" new electrical systems online… unfortunately our existing system relies on "
"an array of something called RTGs.  Running generators isn't a viable option"
" underground, of course.  We have a big flat roof up top, and if we had a "
"few solar panels we could use them to top up our usage.  We could pay you "
"pretty handsomely to bring us, say, ten solar panels?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "If you can do this for us our survival options would vastly increase."
msgstr ""
"Eğer bunu bizim için yapabilirseniz, hayatta kalma seçeneklerimiz büyük "
"ölçüde artar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Solar panels are pretty common on electric cars and on rooftops."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Great, I know it isn't much but we hope to continue to expand thanks to your"
" help."
msgstr ""
"Harika, çok fazla değil ama umarım yardımınız sayesinde genişlemeye devam "
"edebiliriz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "In a Pickle"
msgstr "Bir Dertte"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'In a Pickle'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Deliver twenty-five half-liter glass canning jars to the Free Merchants to "
"kickstart their food storage plans."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"While we've managed to secure day to day food supplies, it's very much hand "
"to mouth.  Our reserves would barely last a few days if something kept our "
"people locked in.  We need a stockpile to avoid that.  Thanks to our outpost"
" we have a bit of meat and vegetables coming in, but we need a better way to"
" preserve them.  Some of our people know enough about food canning that if "
"we had a good stock of canning jars, we could make pickles and canned meats "
"to get us set for the winter.  I'll pay you a premium rate if you can bring "
"us twenty-five glass jars to get us started."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"It'll take a load off my shoulders if I can finally stop worrying about "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Bundan sonunda endişelenmeyi bırakabilirsem, omuzlarımdan bir yük kalkacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"We'll hold for the moment, but I'll get an ulcer if I have to keep worrying."
"  If you reconsider let me know."
msgstr ""
"Şu an için bekleyeceğiz, ama endişelenmeye devam etmem gerekirse bir ülserim"
" olacak. Eğer yeniden düşünürseniz, bana haber verin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"That's one less thing to worry about.  Glad to have someone like you on our "
"side.  Here's 250 merch, and the broker will buy any further glass jars you "
"can find - at a reduced price, we can't keep up the premium rate.  Actually,"
" the broker was saying they had some jobs like this for you, and that it "
"might be easier to just go straight through their office if you want more "
"work."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Unknown Recipient"
msgstr "Bilinmeyen Alıcı"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Unknown Recipient'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Deliver the hdd to the military remnant.  Return to the Evacuation Center "
"when the trade is complete."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Have you finished the delivery already?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Good, that's one less thing to worry about."
msgstr "İyi, bu endişelenecek bir şey daha az."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "At least you came back with your life…"
msgstr "En azından hayatınla geri döndün…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"*looks at you cautiously.  \"He hasn't been bothering you, has he?  Dave's "
"usually pretty harmless.\""
msgstr ""
"*size temkinli bir şekilde bakar. \"Sana rahatsızlık vermedi, değil mi? Dave"
" genellikle pek zararsızdır.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"He wants permission to build himself a little shelter outside of your lobby,"
" somewhere out of the way.  He'd need access to your washrooms and things, "
"but you could clear him out of this space."
msgstr ""
"Kendisine lobinizin dışında, bir yere küçük bir barınak inşa etme izni "
"istiyor. Tuvaletlerinize ve diğer şeylere erişim ihtiyacı olacak, ama bu "
"alanı ondan temizleyebilirsiniz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Forget I said anything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Sure, sounds great on paper, but *where*?  We aren't swimming in real estate"
" here, the place is seriously overcrowded.  And I won't have him living out "
"of a soggy cardboard box on the doorstep, it's an even worse look than the "
"lobby."
msgstr ""
"Tabii, kağıt üzerinde harika görünüyor, ama *nerede*? Burada gayrimenkul "
"içinde yüzmüyoruz, yer ciddi şekilde kalabalık. Ve onu kapının önünde ıslak "
"bir karton kutudan yaşamaya zorlayamam, bu lobiden daha kötü bir görünüm."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"What about the rooftop?  There's a stair access there, I can see it from "
"outside, and he'd probably be able to do a bit of a lookout job."
msgstr ""
"Çatı hakkında ne dersin? Orada bir merdiven erişimi var, dışarıdan "
"görebiliyorum ve muhtemelen biraz gözcülük yapabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"*rubs his chin.  \"It's probably technically a fire hazard, but there's not "
"much to light up there besides what Dave brings.  And a few of the guards "
"are pretty attached to him, so we could maybe send folks up to keep an eye "
"on him and make sure he's doing okay.  That wouldn't interfere with comings "
"and goings, either.\"  He pauses a moment, looking at his ledger as if it "
"contains answers.  \"You know what?  Sure.  If Dave is okay with it, I can "
"talk the others into letting him have rooftop access to build himself a "
"little shelter, as long as he continues to keep it clean up there like he "
"has in here.\""
msgstr ""
"*çenesini ovuşturur. \"Muhtemelen teknik olarak bir yangın tehlikesi, ama "
"orada Dave'in getirdiği şeyler dışında pek bir şey yok. Ve bazı güvenlik "
"görevlileri ona oldukça bağlı, bu yüzden belki de insanları yukarı "
"gönderebiliriz, ona göz kulak olmaları ve iyi olduğundan emin olmaları için."
" Bu, giriş çıkışları da etkilemez.\" Bir an durur, defterine bakar sanki "
"cevaplar içeriyor gibi. \"Biliyor musun? Tabii. Eğer Dave buna razıysa, "
"diğerlerini ona çatı erişimi vermesi için ikna edebilirim, yeter ki orayı "
"burada olduğu gibi temiz tutmaya devam etsin.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll go let him know."
msgstr "Teşekkürler. Ona haber vereceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Are you interested in buying any processed lumber?"
msgstr "İşlenmiş kereste satın almakla ilgileniyor musunuz?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Does this center need any metal?"
msgstr "Bu merkez metal gerektiriyor mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Are you interested in any chemical supplies?"
msgstr "Herhangi bir kimyasal malzeme ile ilgileniyor musunuz?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Sure, we could use some around here for repairs and whatnot.  What are the "
"terms?"
msgstr ""
"Tabii, burada tamirler ve diğer şeyler için bazılarına ihtiyacımız olabilir."
" Şartlar neler?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Well, how about 250 merch for 50 kilos of…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Well, how about 500 merch for a dozen board feet of…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid ""
"Chemicals?  I'm sure we could find some use for them, and we are in need of "
"medical supplies.  What's the offer?"
msgstr ""
"Kimyasallar mı? Onlardan bir şekilde faydalanabileceğimizi düşünüyorum ve "
"tıbbi malzemelere ihtiyacımız var. Teklif nedir?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
msgid "Well, how about 300 merch for 10 liters of…"
msgstr "Peki, 10 litre için 300 ticaret nasıl?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Marshal..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Citizen..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Can I trade for supplies?"
msgstr "Malzeme takası yapabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I'm a doctor, one of the several at the outpost.  We were the lucky ones.  "
"Came here right went things started to go wrong, never left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "So what are you doing right now?"
msgstr "Peki şu anda ne yapıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Never mind…"
msgstr "Boşver…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The Old Guard--that's what's left of the feds--set me up here to screen any "
"new arrivals for infection risks.  Can't be too paranoid these days.  Sad to"
" have to turn people away, but I like the assignment for the chance to get "
"news about the outside world."
msgstr ""
"Eski Muhafızlar - federal hükümetin geriye kalan kısmı - beni buraya yeni "
"gelenleri enfeksiyon riskleri için taramak üzere yerleştirdi. Bu günlerde "
"fazla paranoyak olamazsın. İnsanları geri çevirmek zorunda kalmak üzücü, ama"
" dış dünyaya dair haber alma şansı için bu görevi seviyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "What kind of news?"
msgstr "Ne tür haberler?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Sightings of unusual living dead or new mutations.  The more we know about "
"what's happening, the closer we can get to a treatment or maybe even a cure."
"  It's a long shot, but you have hope to survive."
msgstr ""
"Sıradışı yaşayan ölülerin veya yeni mutasyonların görülmesi. Ne olup "
"bittiğini ne kadar çok bilirsek, bir tedaviye veya belki de bir çağa o kadar"
" yaklaşabiliriz. Uzun bir ihtimal, ama hayatta kalma umudun var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Good luck with that…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"This is no classic zombie outbreak.  The dead seem to be getting stronger as"
" the days go on.  Some survivors too, come in here with… adaptations.  Maybe"
" they're related."
msgstr ""
"Bu klasik bir zombi salgını değil. Ölüler gün geçtikçe daha güçlü hale "
"geliyor gibi görünüyor. Bazı hayatta kalanlar da buraya… adaptasyonlarla "
"geliyor. Belki de birbirleriyle bağlantılılar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"We can't.  There's nothing we can spare to sell and I've got no budget to "
"buy from you.  I don't suppose you want to donate?"
msgstr ""
"Yapamayız. Satacak hiçbir şeyimiz yok ve senden satın almak için bütçem yok."
" Bağış yapmak istemezsin, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"We don't have the equipment for real analysis here so it'll need to be done "
"in the field.  I need you to get a fresh sample of zombie blood, take it to "
"a hospital, and perform a centrifuge analysis of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Excellent.  Take this blood draw kit; once you've found a zombie corpse, use"
" it to extract blood from the body, then take it to a hospital for analysis."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Download Workstation Data"
msgstr "İş İstasyonu Verilerini İndir"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The medical software didn't just analyze the blood, it triggered a "
"government alert.  Medical staff was under orders to immediately drive any "
"matching samples to the nearest laboratory.  That must mean the government "
"knew!  We have the destination address.  Go there, get in, and bring back "
"any records you can download off a computer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Great!  I've mapped out a route to the address."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Can't blame you, but come back if you change your mind."
msgstr "Seni suçlayamam, ama fikrini değiştirirsen geri dön."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"If the laboratory is locked, maybe you can find an id card from employees "
"who died in the evacuation.  Also brush up on your computer skills, any "
"computers will have some security on them.  Bring back anything you find on "
"a USB drive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Have you completed your mission?"
msgstr "Görevini tamamladın mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Thanks!  This data looks damaged, but maybe I can make something out of it."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkürler! Bu veri hasar görmüş gibi görünüyor, ama belki ondan bir şeyler"
" çıkarabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Download Encryption Codes"
msgstr "Şifreleme Kodlarını İndir"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Unfortunately the data you got was incomplete and mostly encrypted.  There "
"may be a way to get encryption codes, though.  I found a complaint by the "
"infosec team that they were unable to deliver critical security updates to "
"one research site.  It was some kind of more restricted secondary site "
"hidden beneath a town, they weren't allowed in.  That means it should have "
"unsecured computers we can get the codes from."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Great!  I've mapped out a route, it should look like a normal house.  Bring "
"back anything you find on a USB drive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Expect the lab to be locked as usual."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Wonderful!  Now I just need to get an undamaged, complete archive, and we "
"can really figure out what happened."
msgstr ""
"Harika! Şimdi sadece hasar görmemiş, eksiksiz bir arşiv almam gerekiyor ve "
"gerçekten ne olduğunu anlayabiliriz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Download Research Archives"
msgstr "Araştırma Arşivlerini İndir"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"So there looks to be months, maybe years of experiments, and that data set "
"must be huge.  Database servers massive enough to house it would overheat "
"running on emergency power.  But I did found communications from a lab that "
"had some kind of freezing portal open during the Cataclysm, sending "
"everything to subzero temperatures.  I bet the archives inside that lab are "
"still working."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Great!  I've mapped out a route.  Bundle up, it gets colder the deeper you "
"go and it looks like the archives were on the fourth basement level."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"That lab is going to start freezing and just get colder the deeper you go.  "
"You'll really need special equipment to survive that far down.  Bring back "
"anything you find on a USB drive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Thanks!  This is a lot of data to go through."
msgstr "Teşekkürler! Gözden geçirilecek çok fazla veri var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Find Lab Tunnels"
msgstr "Laboratuvar Tünellerini Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"In the data we found a major contract for tunneling and train equipment, "
"ordered a long time ago.  It's the best lead we have.  Here's the address of"
" the government lab where the equipment was delivered.  I want you to go "
"there, find the tunnels that they dug, and download everything you can about"
" the train network."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "So glad for your help."
msgstr "Yardımın için çok sevindim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The equipment was rated for 50 feet underground, so that tunnel entrance is "
"going to be deeper inside a lab than a normal subway.  Fifty feet would mean"
" maybe four stories down.  Bring back anything you find on a USB drive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  I should be able to reconstruct what cargo moved between which "
"labs.  I wonder what was really going on down there."
msgstr ""
"Harika! Hangi yüklerin hangi laboratuvarlar arasında hareket ettiğini "
"yeniden oluşturabilmeliyim. Aşağıda gerçekten neler olduğunu merak ediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Arsonist"
msgstr "Ateş yakıcı"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Makayla Sanchez"
msgstr "Makayla Sanchez"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "I'm just watching the world burn."
msgstr "Dünyanın yanışını izliyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "That sure is a shiny badge you got there!"
msgstr "Gerçekten de parlak bir rozetin var!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Heh, you look important."
msgstr "Heh, önemli görünüyorsun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "I'm actually new."
msgstr "Aslında yeniyim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Do you have any jobs for me?"
msgstr "Bana verebileceğin bir iş var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "What's with your ears?"
msgstr "Kulaklarınla ne işin var?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "How are you doing these days?"
msgstr "Bu günlerde nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Guess that makes two of us.  Well, kind of.  I don't think we're open, "
"though.  Full up as hell; it's almost a crowd downstairs.  Did you see the "
"trader at the entrance?  There's the one to ask."
msgstr ""
"Sanırım bu bizi iki yapıyor.  Neyse, bir nevi.  Ama açık olduğumuzu "
"sanmıyorum.  Aşırı kalabalık; aşağıda neredeyse bir kalabalık var.  "
"Girişteki tüccarı gördün mü?  Sorulacak kişi o."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Sucks…"
msgstr "Berbat…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Well, there's a guy downstairs who got a working pneumatic cannon.  It "
"shoots metal like… like a cannon without the bang.  Cost-efficient as hell."
"  And there's no shortage of improvised weapons you can make.  The big thing"
" though, seems to be continuing construction of fortifications.  Very few of"
" those monsters seem to be able to break through a fence or wall constructed"
" with the stuff."
msgstr ""
"Aşağıda çalışan bir pnömatik topu olan bir adam var.  Metal fırlatıyor, "
"hani… patlama olmadan bir top gibi.  Son derece maliyet etkin.  "
"Yapabileceğin el yapımı silahların da eksiği yok.  Ama büyük mesele, "
"görünüşe göre tahkimat inşaatına devam etmek.  O canavarlardan çok azı, bu "
"malzemelerle yapılmış bir çit veya duvarı aşabiliyor gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Nothing optimistic, at least.  Had a pal on the road with a ham radio, but "
"she's gone and so is that thing.  Kaput."
msgstr ""
"En azından iyimser bir şey yok.  Yolda bir arkadaşım vardı, bir ham radyo "
"ile, ama o gitti ve o şey de gitti.  Kaput."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Nothing optimistic?"
msgstr "İyimser bir şey yok mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Most of the emergency camps have dissolved by now.  The cities are mobbed, "
"the forests crawling with glowing eyes and zombies.  Some insane shit out "
"there, and everyone with a radio seems to feel like documenting their last "
"awful moments."
msgstr ""
"Acil durum kamplarının çoğu şimdiye kadar dağılmış durumda.  Şehirler "
"kalabalık, ormanlar parlayan gözler ve zombilerle dolu.  Dışarıda bazı deli "
"şeyler var ve radyo sahibi herkes, son korkunç anlarını belgelemek istiyor "
"gibi görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "I feel bad for asking."
msgstr "Sormak için kötü hissediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"I don't know.  I mean, if you can make yourself useful.  But that's become a"
" real hazy thing nowadays.  It depends who you ask.  The merchant definitely"
" doesn't want me here when I'm not selling, but… some people get away with "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Bilmiyorum.  Yani, kendini faydalı kılabilirsen.  Ama bu günlerde gerçekten "
"belirsiz bir şey haline geldi.  Kime sorduğuna bağlı.  Tüccar kesinlikle "
"burada olmadığımda beni istemiyor, ama… bazı insanlar bununla başa "
"çıkabiliyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Same way you got yours, I bet.  Keep quiet about it, some people here look "
"down on people like us."
msgstr ""
"Senin gibi, senin de aldığın şekilde.  Bu konuda sessiz kal, burada bazı "
"insanlar bizim gibi insanlara küçümseyerek bakıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Ssh.  Some people in here hate… mutations.  This was an accident."
msgstr ""
"Ssh.  Burada bazı insanlar… mutasyonlardan nefret ediyor.  Bu bir kazaydı."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Sorry to ask"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"I burn down buildings and sell the Free Merchants the materials.  No, "
"seriously.  If you've seen burned wreckage in place of suburbs or even see "
"the pile of rebar for sale, that's probably me.  They've kept me well off in"
" exchange, I guess."
msgstr ""
"Binaları yakıyorum ve Malı Özgür Tüccarlara malzemeleri satıyorum.  Hayır, "
"cidden.  Eğer banliyölerin yerinde yanmış enkaz gördüyseniz ya da satılık "
"demir çubuk yığını görüyorsanız, muhtemelen o benim.  Karşılığında beni iyi "
"bir durumda tuttular, sanırım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "I'll buy."
msgstr "Alırım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "When will you have more materials in?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Who needs rebar?"
msgstr "Kim demir çubuğa ihtiyaç duyar?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Supply the arsonist."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Supply the arsonist.'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Bring the arsonist 42 kg of commercial fertilizer"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "I could use some help getting some materials."
msgstr "Bana bazı malzemeleri temin etmemde yardım edebilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"I could use some help getting some materials.  Molotovs are nice for burning"
" down buildings but aren't all that for keeping yourself safe.  If you could"
" get me two bags of commercial fertilizer I could make something a lot more "
"potent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Oh man, thanks so much friend.  You won't regret it."
msgstr "Ah dostum, çok teşekkür ederim.  Pişman olmayacaksın."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Think it over."
msgstr "Üzerinde düşün."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Commercial fertilizer tends to be made from ammonium nitrate, which is also "
"usable as an explosive.  Try looking for some around the abandoned farms."
msgstr ""
"Ticari gübre genellikle amonyum nitratından yapılır, bu da patlayıcı olarak "
"kullanılabilir.  Terkedilmiş çiftliklerde biraz aramayı dene."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Did you find any fertilizer?  Are you sure this is the ammonium nitrate "
"kind?"
msgstr ""
"Fertilizör bulabildin mi? Bu amonyum nitrat türü olduğundan emin misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"This is great!  I'll get to work making something of this.  You can have "
"some of my Molotovs, I won't need quite so many now."
msgstr ""
"Bu harika! Bununla bir şeyler yapmaya başlayacağım. Bazı Molotov'larımı "
"alabilirsin, şimdi bu kadarına ihtiyacım olmayacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "I guess I could convince the shelter to sell me some."
msgstr "Sanırım barınağı bana biraz satmaya ikna edebilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Damn.  Perhaps I wasn't the only one who thought of this."
msgstr "Lan! Belki de bunu düşünen tek kişi ben değildim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"I made some nice things with that ammonium nitrate you got me.  Want to "
"trade?"
msgstr ""
"Bana verdiğin amonyum nitratla güzel şeyler yaptım. Takas yapmak ister "
"misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "As if you're one to talk.  Screw You."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Screw You!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "I thought I smelled a pig.  I jest… please don't arrest me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Huh, thought I smelled someone new.  Can I help you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "You… smelled me?"
msgstr "Sen… beni mi kokladın?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Got anything for sale?"
msgstr "Satılık bir şeyin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Got any survival advice?"
msgstr "Hayatta kalma tavsiyen var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "Hoşça kal."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"Oh, I didn't mean that in a bad way.  Been out in the wilderness so long, I "
"find myself noticing things by scent before sight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "O..kay..?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"I trade food here in exchange for a place to crash and general supplies.  "
"Well, more specifically I trade food that isn't stale chips and flat cola."
msgstr ""
"Burada yiyecek takası yapıyorum, bir yere sığınmak ve genel malzemeler için."
" Daha spesifik olarak, bayat cips ve düz kola olmayan yiyecekleri takas "
"ediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Oh, so you hunt?"
msgstr "Oh, av mı yapıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Not really, just trying to lead my life."
msgstr "Pek sayılmaz, sadece hayatımı sürdürmeye çalışıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"Yep.  Whatever game I spot, I bag and sell the meat and other parts here.  "
"Got the occasional fish and basket full of wild fruit, but nothing comes "
"close to a freshly-cooked moose steak for supper!"
msgstr ""
"Evet. Gözlemlediğim her oyunu avlıyorum, etini ve diğer parçalarını burada "
"satıyorum. Ara sıra balık ve dolu bir sepet yaban meyvesi buluyorum ama taze"
" pişirilmiş bir geyik bifteği akşam yemeği için hiçbir şey buna yaklaşamaz!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Great, now my mouth is watering…"
msgstr "Harika, şimdi ağzım sulanıyor…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"Sure, just bagged a fresh batch of meat.  You may want to grill it up before"
" it gets too, uh… 'tender'."
msgstr ""
"Tabii, taze bir et partisi aldım. Belki de çok, şey… 'yumuşak' olmadan önce "
"ızgara yapmayı düşünebilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Know when you'll get more?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Thanks for the info, bye."
msgstr "Bilgi için teşekkürler, hoşça kal."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"Feed a man a fish, he's full for a day.  Feed a man a bullet, he's full for "
"the rest of his life."
msgstr ""
"Bir adama bir balık ver, bir gün doyar. Bir adama bir mermi ver, hayatının "
"geri kalanında doyar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Spot your prey before something nastier spots you."
msgstr "Avını, daha kötü bir şey seni görmeden önce gör."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "I've heard that cougars sometimes leap.  Maybe it's just a myth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"The Jabberwock is real, don't listen to what anybody else says.  If you see "
"it, RUN."
msgstr ""
"Jabberwock gerçektir, başkalarının ne dediğine kulak asma. Eğer onu "
"görürsen, KAÇ!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"Zombie animal meat isn't good for eating, but sometimes you, might find "
"usable fur on 'em."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"A steady diet of cooked meat and clean water will keep you alive forever, "
"but your taste buds and your colon may start to get angry at you.  Eat a "
"piece of fruit every once in a while."
msgstr ""
"Pişirilmiş et ve temiz su ile dengeli bir diyet seni sonsuza dek hayatta "
"tutar, ama tat tomurcukların ve bağırsağın sana kızmaya başlayabilir.  Ara "
"sıra bir parça meyve ye."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Smoke crack to get more shit done."
msgstr "Daha fazla iş yapmak için crack iç."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Watch your back out there."
msgstr "Dışarıda arkanı kollamayı unutma."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Representative"
msgstr "Temsilci"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Marshal…"
msgstr "Marshal…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Citizen…"
msgstr "Vatandaş…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join the 'Old Guard'?"
msgstr "'Eski Muhafızlar'a katılmanın bir yolu var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Does the Old Guard need anything?"
msgstr "Eski Muhafızlar'ın bir şeye ihtiyacı var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I'm the region's federal liaison.  Most people here call us the 'Old Guard' "
"and I rather like the sound of it.  Despite how things currently appear, the"
" federal government was not entirely destroyed.  After the outbreak I was "
"chosen to coordinate civilian and militia efforts in support of military "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Ben bölgenin federal irtibatıyım.  Buradaki çoğu insan bize 'Eski "
"Muhafızlar' diyor ve bu ismi sevmekteyim.  Şu anki durum ne olursa olsun, "
"federal hükümet tamamen yok edilmedi.  Salgın sonrası, askeri operasyonlara "
"destek vermek için sivil ve milis çabalarını koordine etmek üzere seçildim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "So what are you actually doing here?"
msgstr "Peki burada gerçekten ne yapıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I ensure that the citizens here have what they need to survive and protect "
"themselves from raiders.  Keeping some form of law is going to be the most "
"important element in rebuilding the world.  We do what we can to keep the "
"'Free Merchants' here prospering and in return they have provided us with "
"spare men and supplies when they can."
msgstr ""
"Buradaki vatandaşların hayatta kalmaları ve kendilerini yağmacılardan "
"korumaları için ihtiyaç duydukları şeyleri sağladığımdan eminim. Dünyayı "
"yeniden inşa etmenin en önemli unsuru, bir tür hukukun sürdürülmesi olacak. "
"Buradaki 'Özgür Tüccarlar'ın refahını sağlamak için elimizden geleni "
"yapıyoruz ve karşılığında, mümkün olduğunda bize yedek adamlar ve malzemeler"
" sağlıyorlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Is there a catch?"
msgstr "Bir tuzak mı var?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Anything more to it?"
msgstr "Başka bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it"
" to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are "
"stretched impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain "
"order.  They don't care much about looters since they understand most "
"everyone is dead, but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to "
"them.  Since most survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed "
"as champions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Hmmm…"
msgstr "Hmmm…"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"There isn't much pushed out by public relations that I'd actually believe.  "
"From what I gather, communication between the regional force commands is "
"almost non-existent.  What I do know is that the 'Old Guard' is currently "
"based out of the 2nd Fleet and patrols the Atlantic coast trying to provide "
"support to the remaining footholds."
msgstr ""
"Halkla ilişkiler tarafından yayılan çok fazla şeyin gerçekten inanabileceğim"
" bir yanı yok. Anladığım kadarıyla, bölgesel güç komutanları arasındaki "
"iletişim neredeyse yok. Bildiğim tek şey, 'Eski Muhafızlar'ın şu anda 2. "
"Filoya bağlı olduğu ve kalan tutunma noktalarına destek sağlamaya çalışarak "
"Atlantik kıyısını devriye gezdiği."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The 2nd Fleet?"
msgstr "2. Filo mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Tell me about the footholds."
msgstr "Tutunma noktaları hakkında bana bilgi ver."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I don't know much about how it formed but it is the armada of military and "
"commercial ships that's floating off the coast.  They have everything from "
"supertankers and carriers to fishing trawlers… even a few NATO ships.  Most "
"civilians are offered a cabin on one of the liners to retire to if they "
"serve as a federal employee for a few years."
msgstr ""
"Nasıl oluştuğu hakkında pek bir şey bilmiyorum ama kıyıda yüzen askeri ve "
"ticari gemilerin armadası. Süper tankerlerden ve uçak gemilerinden balıkçı "
"teknelerine kadar her şeye sahipler… hatta birkaç NATO gemisi bile var. Çoğu"
" sivil, birkaç yıl federal çalışan olarak hizmet ederlerse, bir yolcu "
"gemisinde emekli olmak için bir kabin teklif ediliyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"They may just be propaganda but apparently one or two cities were successful"
" in 'walling themselves off.'  Around here I was told that there were a few "
"places like this one but I couldn't tell you where."
msgstr ""
"Sadece propaganda olabilir ama görünüşe göre bir veya iki şehir 'kendilerini"
" dışarıda tutmayı' başardı. Burada bana böyle birkaç yer olduğunu söylediler"
" ama nerede olduğunu söyleyemem."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"You can't actually join unless you go through a recruiter.  We can usually "
"use help though, ask me from time to time if there is any work available.  "
"Completing missions as a contractor is a great way to make a name for "
"yourself among the most powerful men left in the world."
msgstr ""
"Gerçekten bir işe katılmak istiyorsan, bir işe alımcıdan geçmen gerekiyor. "
"Yine de genellikle yardıma ihtiyacımız var, zaman zaman bana mevcut bir iş "
"olup olmadığını sorabilirsin. Bir yüklenici olarak görevleri tamamlamak, "
"dünyada kalan en güçlü adamlar arasında kendine bir isim yapmak için harika "
"bir yoldur."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I can't leave my post here, and I just don't have the human "
"resources even for a project like that."
msgstr ""
"Üzgünüm, ama burada görevimi terk edemem ve böyle bir proje için bile insan "
"kaynaklarım yok."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Well, thanks anyway…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"It's your lucky day: I just made contact with a couple volunteers like "
"yourself, and that's exactly the sort of project I can put them to."
msgstr ""
"Bugün şanslı günün: Senin gibi birkaç gönüllüyle iletişime geçtim ve onları "
"kullanabileceğim tam da böyle bir proje var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thanks, that's great news!"
msgstr "Teşekkürler, bu harika bir haber!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Kill Bandits"
msgstr "Haydutları öldür"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Kill Bandits'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"A pair of bandits have been preying on locals, based out of a nearby cabin."
"  Ensure they meet a bitter end along with any associates, but watch out for"
" traps around their hideout."
msgstr ""
"Bir çift haydut, yakındaki bir kulübede yaşayan yerel halkı avlıyor. Onların"
" ve herhangi bir ortaklarının acı bir sona ulaşmasını sağla, ama saklanma "
"yerlerindeki tuzaklara dikkat et."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I don't like sending untested men into the field but if you have stayed "
"alive so far you might have some skills.  There are at least a pair of "
"bandits squatting in a local cabin, anyone who preys upon civilians meets a "
"quick end… execute both of them for their crimes.  Complete this and the Old"
" Guard will consider you an asset in the region."
msgstr ""
"Test edilmemiş adamları sahaya göndermeyi sevmiyorum ama şimdiye kadar "
"hayatta kaldıysan bazı becerilerin olabilir. Yerel bir kulübede en az bir "
"çift haydut var, sivilleri avlayan herkes hızlı bir sona ulaşır… suçları "
"için ikisini de infaz et. Bunu tamamla ve Eski Muhafızlar seni bölgede bir "
"varlık olarak düşünecek."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Contractor, I welcome you aboard."
msgstr "Yüklenici, seni aramızda görmekten mutluluk duyuyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "The States will remain a wasteland unless good men choose to save it."
msgstr ""
"Eyaletler, iyi adamlar onu kurtarmayı seçmediği sürece bir harabe olarak "
"kalacak."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "They might suspect you are coming, keep an eye out for traps."
msgstr "Gelişini şüphelenebilirler, tuzaklara dikkat et."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"The Old Guard thanks you for eliminating the criminals.  You won't be "
"forgotten."
msgstr ""
"Eski Muhafızlar, suçluları ortadan kaldırdığın için sana teşekkür eder. "
"Unutulmayacaksın."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Deal with Informant"
msgstr "Muhbir ile anlaş"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Deal with Informant'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"The Hell's Raiders bandit group may have an informant working inside the "
"Refugee Center.  Investigate and bring them to justice without arousing any "
"suspicions."
msgstr ""
"Cehennem Akıncıları adlı haydut grubu, Mülteci Merkezi içinde çalışan bir "
"Muhbiri olabilir. Araştır ve onları şüphe uyandırmadan adalete teslim et."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"This task is going to require a little more persuasive skill.  I believe the"
" Hell's Raiders have an informant here to monitor who comes and goes.  I "
"need you to find out who it is and deal with them without letting anyone "
"else know of my suspicions.  We normally allow the Free Merchants to govern "
"themselves so I would hate to offend them."
msgstr ""
"Bu görev biraz daha ikna edici beceri gerektirecek. Cehennem Akıncılar'ın "
"kimlerin gelip gittiğini izlemek için burada bir Muhbiri olduğuna "
"inanıyorum. Onun kim olduğunu bulmanı ve başkalarına benim şüphelerimden "
"haberdar etmeden onunla ilgilenmeni istiyorum. Genellikle Serbest "
"Tüccarların kendilerini yönetmelerine izin veriyoruz, bu yüzden onları "
"rahatsız etmek istemem."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thank you, please keep this discreet."
msgstr "Teşekkür ederim, lütfen bunu gizli tut."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance, we could use a few good men."
msgstr "Fırsat bulduğunda geri gel, birkaç iyi adama ihtiyacımız var."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "If they draw first blood their friends are less likely to blame you…"
msgstr ""
"Eğer ilk kanı dökerlerse, arkadaşları seni suçlamaya daha az eğilimli "
"olacak..."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You deal with the rat?"
msgstr "Fareyle mi uğraşıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Thank you, I'll do the explaining if anyone else asks about it."
msgstr ""
"Teşekkür ederim, eğer başka biri bunun hakkında sorarsa açıklamayı ben "
"yaparım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Secure Trade Route"
msgstr "Güvenli Ticaret Yolu"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Secure Trade Route'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"One of the Free Merchants silently disappeared while escorting a trade "
"caravan.  Whoever or whatever is responsible must be quick and quiet - "
"investigate the trade route and eliminate the threat."
msgstr ""
"Özgür Tüccarları korurken sessizce kaybolan bir Özgür Tüccar var. Sorumlu "
"olan kim veya neyse hızlı ve sessiz olmalı - ticaret yolunu araştır ve "
"tehdidi ortadan kaldır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"There is another monster troubling the merchants but this time it isn't "
"human… at least I don't think.  Guy just disappeared while walking behind a "
"packed caravan.  They didn't hear any shots but I suppose some raider may "
"have been real sneaky.  Check out the area and report anything you find."
msgstr ""
"Tüccarları rahatsız eden başka bir canavar var ama bu sefer insan değil… en "
"azından öyle düşündüğümü sanmıyorum. Adam, dolu bir kervanın arkasında "
"yürürken kayboldu. Hiçbir ateş sesi duymadılar ama sanırım bazı akıncılar "
"gerçekten sinsi olabilir. Bölgeyi kontrol et ve bulduğun her şeyi rapor et."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Thanks, keeping the people safe is what we try and do."
msgstr "Teşekkürler, insanları güvende tutmak bizim yapmaya çalıştığımız şey."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid ""
"Search the bushes for any trace?  I'm not an expert tracker but you should "
"be able to find something."
msgstr ""
"Buşlarda herhangi bir iz aramak mı? Ben bir uzman iz sürücü değilim ama bir "
"şey bulabilmelisin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
msgid "Great work, wasn't sure what I was sending you after."
msgstr "Harika bir iş, sana ne göndereceğimden emin değildim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Assassinate Raider Leader"
msgstr "Akıncı Liderini Suikast"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Assassinate Raider Leader'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"The Old Guard have located a Hell's Raiders encampment that is coordinating "
"attacks on the Free Merchants.  Pay them a visit and execute the area "
"leadership."
msgstr ""
"Eski Muhafızlar, Özgür Tüccarların saldırılarını koordine eden bir Cehennem "
"Akıncıları kampını buldu. Onları ziyaret et ve bölge liderliğini ortadan "
"kaldır."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I've located a Hell's Raiders encampment in the region that appears to be "
"coordinating operations against the Free Merchants.  We know almost nothing "
"about the command structure in the 'gang' so I need to send someone in to "
"decapitate the leadership.  The raid will be held under orders of the U.S. "
"Marshals Service and by agreeing to the mission you will become a marshal, "
"swearing to assist the federal government in regaining order."
msgstr ""
"Özgür Tüccarlara karşı operasyonları koordine eden bir Cehennem Akıncıları "
"kampını bölgede buldum. 'Çete'deki komuta yapısı hakkında neredeyse hiçbir "
"şey bilmiyoruz, bu yüzden liderliği ortadan kaldırmak için birini göndermem "
"gerekiyor. Akın, ABD Marshals Servisi'nin emirleri altında "
"gerçekleştirilecek ve bu görevi kabul ederek bir marshal olacaksın, federal "
"hükümete düzeni yeniden sağlama konusunda yardım etmeye yemin edeceksin."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Now repeat after me…  I do solemnly swear that I will support and defend the"
" Constitution of the United States against all enemies, foreign and "
"domestic…… that I will bear true faith and allegiance to the same…… that I "
"take this obligation freely, without any mental reservation or purpose of "
"evasion…… and that I will well and faithfully discharge the duties of the "
"office on which I am about to enter.  To establish justice, insure domestic "
"tranquility, provide for the common defense, promote the general welfare and"
" secure the blessings of liberty.  So help me God.  Congratulations Marshal,"
" don't forget your badge and gun.  As a marshal all men or women assisting "
"you are considered deputy marshals so keep them in line."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"I'd recommend having two deputies… it would be a death trap if a single man "
"got surrounded."
msgstr ""
"İki yardımcı bulundurmanızı öneririm… tek bir adamın kuşatılması durumunda "
"bu bir ölüm tuzağı olur."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Has the leadership been dealt with?"
msgstr "Liderlik meselesi halledildi mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Marshal, you continue to impress us.  With their leadership broken it will "
"be easier to establish a foothold in the area, secure resources for "
"rebuilding.  I've been keeping Command informed and while there is certainly"
" a lot you could do to help here, they might have missions for me to offer "
"you that will take you farther afield.  In any case, thank you once again "
"marshal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Link Up With Vault Expedition"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Link Up With Vault Expedition'}'
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Find the team securing an installation under a city, return with the "
"captain's report on the location."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"If you are interested, I recently received a message that a unit was "
"deploying into our AO.  I've been informed of an underground facility "
"they're attempting to secure, and they may require assistance.  The bird "
"dropped them off next to a pump station.  Not much more I can tell you.  "
"We've had difficulty keeping in contact with them, so command has requested "
"you give us a status report when you return.  If you could locate the "
"captain in charge, I'm sure he could use your skills."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"It's a small urban center with a fortified vault underneath it.  The sewage "
"network most likely contains access tunnels to enter the facility itself, "
"and if they're going to actually get any use out of the place they'll likely"
" focus their efforts on any communications hub or command-and-control "
"systems inside.  We last heard contact from them shortly before they "
"ventured underground, if they are still alive the lack of radio silence "
"means they probably got tied up trying to get comms online.  If you can, get"
" a full sit-rep from their commanding officer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Come back when you get a chance, we need someone with experience like you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"That place had to have been staffed when this started, so if they had to try"
" and re-take it you should expect trouble of some sort.  They last reports "
"also mentioned damage from what might be artillery or some other ordinance, "
"so infrastructure on the surface might be damaged.  Might even be "
"contaminated, the conditions are currently an unknown at present."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "What do you have for me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Great, I'll work on sending word to my superiors about this.  I'm going to "
"guess it was a mess down there, but hopefully their report will tell us more"
" about what's still functional and could be brought back online."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Merc"
msgstr "Merc"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Mercenary"
msgstr "Müteahhit"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Fighting for the all-mighty dollar."
msgstr "Her şeyin gücü için savaşıyor."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I haven't done anything wrong…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Any tips for surviving?"
msgstr "Hayatta kalmak için herhangi bir ipucu var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "What would it cost to hire you?"
msgstr "Seni işe almanın maliyeti ne olur?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a hired hand.  Someone pays me and I do what needs to be done."
msgstr ""
"Ben sadece bir kiralık işçiyim. Birisi bana ödeme yapar ve ben yapılması "
"gerekeni yaparım."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"If you have to fight your way out of an ambush, the only thing that is going"
" to save you is having a party that can return fire.  People who work alone "
"are easy pickings for monsters and bandits."
msgstr ""
"Eğer bir pusudan çıkmak için savaşmak zorundaysanız, sizi kurtaracak tek "
"şey, karşılık verebilen bir partinin olmasıdır. Tek başına çalışan insanlar,"
" canavarlara ve haydutlara kolay hedef olurlar."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I suppose I should hire a party then?"
msgstr "O zaman bir parti kiralamam gerektiğini varsayıyorum?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"I'm currently waiting for a customer to return… I'll make you a deal though,"
" 750 Merch will cover my expenses if I get a small cut of the loot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "What the heck is a Merch?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I might be back."
msgstr "Geri dönebilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "[750 Merch] You have a deal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"Merchs are what they call dollar bills around here.  Free Merchant Credit "
"Notes or something.  If you want to buy stuff around here and you don't want"
" to barter away your guns, you need Merch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I see.  Let's try this again from the start."
msgstr "Anladım. Hadi bunu baştan deneyelim."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Okay, how much Merch do I need?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Well, thanks for the info.  Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I guess you're the boss."
msgstr "Sanırım sen patronsun."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Glad to have you aboard."
msgstr "Seni aramızda görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "the intercom"
msgstr "interkom"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Reading this line is a bug"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Return Field Data"
msgstr "Alan Verilerini Geri Dön"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Return Field Data'}'
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Investigate a nearby field and return with Dr. Prado and the robot prototype"
" she was testing.  Failing that, retrieve the I/O recorder stored within the"
" robot.  If the robot remains operational, avoid direct confrontation and "
"use EMP grenades to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Yakındaki bir alanı araştırın ve Dr. Prado ile test ettiği robot "
"prototipiyle geri dönün.  Bunu başaramazsanız, robotun içinde saklanan I/O "
"kaydedicisini alın.  Robot çalışır durumda kalırsa, doğrudan çatışmadan "
"kaçının ve onu devre dışı bırakmak için EMP el bombaları kullanın."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"One of our scientists recently left the lab to perform a field test on a "
"prototype robot, but failed to return, and has not been heard of since.  "
"Investigate the test and return with her and the prototype.  Failing that, "
"return with the data recorder that was attached to our prototype."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "We appreciate your help, good luck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Don't expect our help then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"If the robot remains operational don’t try to fight it head on, because it "
"WILL kill you.  Dr. Prado left the Hub with a handful of EMP grenades, use "
"those to disable the robot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Don't you have a job to do?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Unfortunate only the data was salvageable, but you have our thanks for "
"returning it nonetheless."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Simply useless…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Steal a dead man's mind"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': "Steal a dead man's mind"}'
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Find the corpse of a Hub 01's AI researcher and use the mind splicer kit to "
"recover the memories stored inside their memory implant."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"When the portal storms started, the Government issued an evacuation order "
"for critical XEDRA personnel and sent convoys to retrieve them, with our "
"head of AI research among the recalled.  We recently discovered that he died"
" when the convoy transferring him was ambushed in the initial chaos, but his"
" corpse and memory bionic might remain intact enough for us to extract "
"valuable knowledge.  We want you to travel to the location, make a copy of "
"his Bionic Memory Unit, and return it to us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Remember, perform the extraction /exactly/ as specified, otherwise the "
"bionic will self-destruct."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Yes, we recognize that our request is exceptional.  Return if you change "
"your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"You do know what a memory unit looks like, right?  Matte gray, pill-sized, "
"right in front of the corpus callosum.  We suggest a forceps through the eye"
" socket, shaking slightly, then slowly and carefully…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Do you have the scan?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "You have our thanks and payment."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Light retrieval"
msgstr "Işık alma"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Light retrieval'}'
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Reach the collapsed tower basement, and search the ruins for a photonic "
"circuitry template.  The intercom warned you about heavy enemy presence, and"
" of the existence of a hazardous environment."
msgstr ""
"Çökmüş kule bodrumuna ulaşın ve kalıntılarda fotonik devre şablonu arayın. "
"İletişim cihazı, yoğun düşman varlığı ve tehlikeli bir ortamın varlığı "
"hakkında sizi uyardı."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Our facility once sourced advanced photonic circuitry from a nearby robotics manufacturer.  Their building suffered major damage during the portal storms, and collapsed almost entirely.  However, preliminary scouting reveals that the basement prototyping lab likely remains intact.\n"
"\n"
"the intercom: We ask you to investigate the ruins, and if possible, retrieve a template for the fabrication of said photonic circuitry."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "We expect your success, mercenary."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Return if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"The scout drone also revealed extensive heat signatures and high "
"concentrations of toxic compounds within the ruins, plan accordingly.  We "
"are willing to sell you some protective gear at a discount, if you require "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Have you retrieved the blueprints?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "So, do you need something?"
msgstr "Yani, bir şeye mi ihtiyacın var?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Yes, mercenary?"
msgstr "Evet, paralı asker?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Mercenary."
msgstr "Paralı asker."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Don't you have a mission to do?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "Peki?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Say it."
msgstr "Söyle."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Get with it."
msgstr "Devam et."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "Hızlı ol."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Don't loiter."
msgstr "Acelen yok."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Don't do anything stupid."
msgstr "Aptalca bir şey yapma."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Ugh I hate intercom duty…  Wait is the speaker still on?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Please don't bother us senselessly."
msgstr "Lütfen bizi anlamsızca rahatsız etme."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "[Silence]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "[Crackles On]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "[A red LED blinks on]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "[Unintelligible]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "What's up with the interference in this thing?"
msgstr "Bu şeydeki parazit neyin nesi?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Speak slowly and clearly.  Please."
msgstr "Yavaş ve net konuşun. Lütfen."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Say again?"
msgstr "Tekrar söyler misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "If/you speak to/understand… you/me. Yes?"
msgstr "Eğer/sen konuşursan/anlıyorsan… sen/beni. Evet mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "We haven't changed our mind.  Go away."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Hold there.  I don't care how you got access to this location, but you are "
"coming no further.  Go away."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"I was sent here by the traders at the refugee center.  They told me to "
"deliver this hard drive to you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "The traders also mentioned you were looking for help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Wait!  What??"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "You do realize that the front door is just open?"
msgstr "Ön kapının açık olduğunu fark ediyorsunuz, değil mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Lets trade."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Know when you'll get another shipment?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "It's the apocalypse out here!  Please let me in!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I was just looking for valuables, maybe I can trade with you instead?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "What the hell were you testing out there?"
msgstr "Dışarıda neyi test ediyordun?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "So, about that protective gear?"
msgstr "Peki, o koruyucu ekipman hakkında?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Alright, I'm leaving."
msgstr "Tamam, gidiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Understood.  Please drop the drive on the box embedded beneath the intercom."
"  You are welcome to leave afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "[Do as the Intercom Says]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Didn't bring the hard drive now, let me return with it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "No.  Now leave."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I guess the lab can do without some of this stuff."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Around <interval>, if the caravan doesn't run into trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"It was a modified Wraitheon chassis, with a custom AI.  We hoped it would "
"interact with the outside world for us, but you know how well it went…  "
"Shame about what happened, with the evisceration and all…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"Given the current context, we are willing to sell you a set of our protective gear: gas mask, suit and gear, at a considerable discount.  We will sell it for two of our coins.\n"
"\n"
"the intercom: Hmm wait, we might not have your size..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "[ 2 HGC ] Deal!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I have to give it a thought."
msgstr "Bunu düşünmem gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Just leave."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Wait!  Maybe I can help you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Alright, I'll leave"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid ""
"There's nothing you could do for us, now leave before I'm forced to…\n"
"[You hear a short, muffled conversation from across the intercom]\n"
"\n"
"the intercom: Well, it seems we do have some use for you.  It's a dangerous task, but if you complete it we will allow you limited trading access."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Tell me about it."
msgstr "Bana bundan bahset."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I'm not risking myself for a deal that bad."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "You know the deal, good luck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Anladım."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Hub Mercenary"
msgstr "Merkez Paralı Asker"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Better keep our eyes on the road."
msgstr "Yolda gözlerimizi daha iyi tutalım."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Better be careful around here."
msgstr "Burada dikkatli olsan iyi olur."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "Evet?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Something to say?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "I charge hourly, so be quick…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Merhaba."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "Seni görmek güzel."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "About those jobs…"
msgstr "O işler hakkında…"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Good to see you around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Want help with something else?"
msgstr "Başka bir konuda yardım ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Lets set a combat strategy"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"Same as you.  Some nobody doing dirty work for scraps, I mean, no offense."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "I guess that makes two of us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well, never mind."
msgstr "Neyse, umursama."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"Good.  I could do with some company between jobs.  Feel free to stay around,"
" if you want."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Guess I could stay for a while"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Actually, I have some places to be right now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Rough out there isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Good to have some company, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Have something to say?"
msgstr "Söylemek istediğin bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Didn't you want something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Anything interesting going on?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr "Aklında bir şey var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Want help with something?"
msgstr "Bir konuda yardım ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "What do you know about our employers?"
msgstr "Patronlarımız hakkında ne biliyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well, I should get going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"Not much really.  They made me track and destroy some government documents a while back, of course I gave them a read first but there wasn't much.\n"
"\n"
" As far as I know, this place held some experimental computer network before everything went to shit.  What's going on now is anybody's guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well, I was hoping for more."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Just came back from a job.  Trying to rest for a short while."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"Have you noticed they pay us in tiny little gold coins, it's bizarre I say."
"  One would think they have a gold mine in there, but no, they don't, so "
"they make me cross the damned world grabbing gold bars. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "I guess I could help with that…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Now that you mention it, it does seem rather strange."
msgstr "Bunu söylediğine göre, gerçekten tuhaf görünüyor."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Thinking I should go hunt something soon..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Wondering if things will get better someday..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Hmm? Nothing, I guess I just like resting in this place."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"I heard some strange dimensional resonance caused all this, do you think it "
"has happened to other places?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"You noticed this place has working WI-FI?  Well not the rest of the net "
"works anyways."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"I can offer you the whole of my payment for every bar or equivalent you "
"bring.  But keep silent about this, it's supposed to be my job."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "We have a deal then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Actually, I don't think I have time for that, sorry."
msgstr "Aslında, bunun için zamanım olduğunu düşünmüyorum, üzgünüm."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Retrieve chunks of gold"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Retrieve chunks of gold'}'
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Find 200 units of gold."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "I could do with some help…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm still supposed to scavenge for gold, I can offer you the same deal as "
"last time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Wonderful."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well I'll look for the gold myself."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Try searching banks and security vans."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "You got that gold yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "I appreciate it, here's your pay."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr "Evet, tabii."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well I'll have to scavenge the gold myself, thanks for nothing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Active Noise Control"
msgstr "Aktif Gürültü Kontrolü"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Active Noise Control'
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"Investigate Hub 01's radio tower, discover the source of the interference, "
"and fix the problem."
msgstr ""
"Hub 01'in radyo kulesini araştır, parazitin kaynağını bul ve sorunu çöz."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"A few days ago, I installed a radio transmitter in the nearby tower, but it "
"stopped working recently.  If you are willing to be my back up while I check"
" it out, I'll owe you a favor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Alright, lets be off.  You don't mind taking point, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well thanks for offering, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure we'll figure it out once there.  In any case, make sure to shoot "
"first."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "You think we killed the culprit?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Sure seems like it.  Lets go back to the hub."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Sure, thanks for nothing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Return to Hub 01"
msgstr "Hub 01'e geri dön"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Return to Hub 01'
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Return to Hub 01."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Lets go back to the Hub"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Well…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "You keep a map around don't you?  I do, and you probably should too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "We there yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Thanks for having my back.  As I said, I owe you one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Are you lost or something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Can't believe we got lost…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Hub Security"
msgstr "Merkez Güvenliği"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "I'm part of the Hub security team."
msgstr "Ben Merkez güvenlik ekibinin bir parçasıyım."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Keep it civil, merc."
msgstr "Nazik ol, merc."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Free Merchant"
msgstr "Özgür Tüccar"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Caravaneer"
msgstr "Kervancı"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "I'm the owner of a trade caravan."
msgstr "Ben bir ticaret kervanının sahibiyim."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"Still plenty of outlaws in the roads, perhaps you should tend to your job, "
"marshal..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "You see anything you want, marshal?"
msgstr "İstediğin bir şey görüyor musun, marshal?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Oh, a U.S. marshal, how quaint."
msgstr "Ah, bir ABD marshal'ı, ne hoş."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Welcome..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Here to trade, I hope?"
msgstr "Ticaret yapmak için buradasın, umarım?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Safe travels, scavenger."
msgstr "Güvenli yolculuklar, toplayıcı."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "When is the next shipment?"
msgstr "Sonraki sevkiyat ne zaman?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"I keep to my own business, and you keep to yours, marshal.  Seems like a "
"fair deal?"
msgstr ""
"Ben kendi işime bakarım, sen de kendi işine bak, marshal. Adil bir anlaşma "
"gibi görünüyor mu?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"We have been supplying this lab here with food from a few hunting and "
"farming communities nearby.  The roads are though and dangerous, but it "
"makes good money, and beats scavenging the cities for scraps."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Keep safe, then."
msgstr "O zaman güvende kal."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "scrapper"
msgstr "parçacı"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Haven't seen another face in quite a while.  Not a living one, at least.  "
"State your business.  Maybe you got some use for some of this scrap metal?"
msgstr ""
"Uzun zamandır başka bir yüz görmedim. En azından yaşayan bir yüz. İşinizi "
"belirtin. Belki bu hurda metalden birine ihtiyacınız vardır?"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Pleasure to see you again, <name_g>."
msgstr "Seni tekrar görmek bir zevk, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Why stay here of all places?"
msgstr "Neden tüm yerler arasında burada kalıyorsun?"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Can I buy anything?"
msgstr "Bir şey satın alabilir miyim?"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Well, I held a modest job here as a scrap yard worker.  Business was fair "
"most days, but when <the_cataclysm> hit, I was on a solo shift.  With all "
"the craziness going on in the cities and whatnot, I decided to just stay "
"here for while.  I figure someone might find a use for the leftover metal "
"lying around, so I started selling it to anyone who passed by."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, I was already here when the dead got pissed off.  This place "
"had some barbed wire, metalworking tools, and plenty of stuff to make "
"weapons out of.  Even the walls are my own making."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Think I could stay here?"
msgstr "Burada kalabileceğimi düşünüyor musun?"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I'm fine with it.  There's a spare bed over there for anyone who needs"
" it.  Just don't hog it.  Someone else might come along."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>."
msgstr "Teşekkürler, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Sure thing.  I've got a few things on hand, sold in batches of 10-piece "
"each.  What'll ya have?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Find anything good?"
msgstr "İyi bir şey bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "I'd like some specialty metals."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[2$]  I'll buy some scrap fragments."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[5$]  I'll buy some small sheet metal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[10$]  I'll buy some steel chunks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[30$]  I'll buy some steel lumps."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some sheet metal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Anything else you need?"
msgstr "Başka bir şeye ihtiyacınız var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"I've got freshly sorted metals in some small containers ready to go.  What "
"do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[10$]  I'll buy some bismuth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[10$]  I'll buy some zinc."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[12$]  I'll buy some lead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[14$]  I'll buy some copper."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[18$]  I'll buy some tin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[20$]  I'll buy some magnesium."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[28$]  I'll buy some silver."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[100$]  I'll buy some gold."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "[150$]  I'll buy some platinum."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Nope, although I have a really good claim by the river.  Gonna go fetch them"
" soon, be right back in <interval>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Well, good luck."
msgstr "Peki, iyi şanslar."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Find 5 Microwaves"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Find 5 Microwaves'
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 5 microwaves in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "I need help…"
msgstr "Yardıma ihtiyacım var…"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since business is increasing around here, I've decided to start selling more"
" specialized metal.  Problem is, I can't separate the metal out.  "
"Fortunately, I found some old schematics on a machine for this sort of "
"thing.  If you could get me 5 microwaves, I can melt down the sorted stuff "
"into bars.  I can quickly pay you in raw materials."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Microwaves were found in almost every home.  An apartment block should have "
"tons of them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the microwaves?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  I'll start the smelting as soon as possible."
msgstr "Harika! Mümkün olan en kısa sürede eritmeye başlayacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll do it myself."
msgstr "Bu talihsiz. Sanırım bunu kendim yapacağım."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 75 Charcoal"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Obtain 75 Charcoal'
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Obtain 75 lumps of charcoal in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That machine I put together is working wonderfully, but the generator is "
"nearly out of juice.  If you could get me 75 lumps of charcoal, I'll pay you"
" however I can."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Its fairly simple to make some.  I don't know where you could find any, "
"though."
msgstr "Biraz yapmak oldukça basit. Ama nerede bulabileceğini bilmiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal?"
msgstr "Kömürün var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  This should do for a while."
msgstr "Harika! Bu bir süre iş görür."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 Solder"
msgstr "100 Lehim elde et"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Obtain 100 Solder'
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 solder in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr "Kömür tüccarı ile kredi karşılığında 100 lehim elde et."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That machine I put together needs some repairs on it, but I'm out of "
"soldering wire.  If you could get me about 100 spools, I'll pay you for it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "An electronics store might have some."
msgstr "Bir elektronik mağazasında bulabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the solder?"
msgstr "Lehim var mı?"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Establish A Trade Route'
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the scrapper and a refugee center, and "
"bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Tüccar ile bir mülteci merkezi arasında ticari ilişkiler kur ve anlaşmanın "
"bir yazısını geri getir."

#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  "
"Turns out the computer was still on and had an address for a refugee center."
"  I figure they might want some spare metal, so I need you to go over there "
"and strike a deal with them."
msgstr ""
"Son zamanlarda hurda toplarken, o eski tahliye sığınaklarından birini "
"buldum. Bilgisayarın hala açık olduğunu ve bir mülteci merkezi için bir "
"adresi olduğunu öğrendim. Onların biraz yedek metal isteyebileceğini "
"düşünüyorum, bu yüzden oraya gidip onlarla bir anlaşma yapmanı istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Barber"
msgstr "Berber"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid ""
"Can I interest you in a trim?  It'll cost you 6 merch for a haircut or 3 for"
" a beard trim.  I can do color and styling too."
msgstr ""
"Saç kesimiyle ilgilenir misin? Saç kesimi 6 merch, sakal kesimi ise 3 merch."
" Renk ve şekillendirme de yapabilirim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "What is your job here?"
msgstr "Buradaki işin nedir?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "[3 Merch] I'll have a shave"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "[6 Merch] I'll get a haircut"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Maybe another time…"
msgstr "Belki başka bir zaman…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid ""
"What?  I'm a barber… I cut hair.  There's demand for cheap cuts and a shave "
"out here."
msgstr ""
"Ne? Ben bir berberim… Saç kesiyorum. Burada ucuz kesimlere ve sakal tıraşına"
" talep var."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "I can't imagine what I'd need your assistance with."
msgstr "Senin yardımına ne için ihtiyacım olabileceğini hayal edemiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Stand still while I get my clippers..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Thanks…"
msgstr "Teşekkürler…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Want a drink?"
msgstr "Bir içecek ister misin?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'm looking for information."
msgstr "Bilgi arıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Let me see what you keep behind the counter."
msgstr "Bana tezgahın arkasında ne sakladığını göster."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'll be going…"
msgstr "Gidiyorum…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"If it isn't obvious, I oversee the bar here.  The scavengers bring in old "
"world alcohol that we sell for special occasions.  For most that come "
"through here though, the drinks we brew ourselves are the only thing they "
"can afford."
msgstr ""
"Burada barı ben yönetiyorum, eğer belli değilse.  Kaşifler, özel günler için"
" sattığımız eski dünya alkolünü getiriyor.  Buradan geçenlerin çoğu için "
"ise, kendi yaptığımız içecekler tek uygun fiyatlı seçenek."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"We have a policy of keeping information to ourselves.  Ask the patrons if "
"you want to hear rumors or news."
msgstr ""
"Bilgileri kendimize saklama politikamız var.  Dedikoduları veya haberleri "
"duymak isterseniz, müşterilere sorun."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Thanks for nothing."
msgstr "Hiçbir şey için teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Make 2 Stills"
msgstr "2 Damıtıcı Yap"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"The wine and beer we can brew are sufficient to attract most patrons but we "
"need something a bit stronger to get them to forget their misery.  Could you"
" build me a pair of stills?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"This should let us start producing whiskey, rum, and brandy when we get "
"access to the ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Bu, malzemelere erişim sağladığımızda viski, rom ve brendi üretmeye "
"başlamamızı sağlamalı."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance.  We need skilled survivors."
msgstr ""
"Bir fırsat bulduğunda geri gel. Yetenekli hayatta kalanlara ihtiyacımız var."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure you could find the design for the stills in home brewing books."
msgstr ""
"Damıtıcıların tasarımını evde bira yapma kitaplarında bulabileceğinden "
"eminim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Do you have the stills?"
msgstr "Damıtıcıların var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Thank you for the delivery."
msgstr "Teslimat için teşekkür ederim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Find 20 Yeast"
msgstr "20 Maya Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"The last batch that I brewed was terrible, I'm fairly sure something "
"contaminated the yeast we have been using.  Could you locate a source of "
"fresh yeast for us to use?  I'd need about 20 teaspoons of dry yeast to get "
"started."
msgstr ""
"Son yaptığım parti korkunçtu, kullandığımız mayanın bir şey tarafından "
"kontamine olduğundan oldukça eminim.  Kullanabileceğimiz taze maya kaynağını"
" bulabilir misin?  Başlamak için yaklaşık 20 tatlı kaşığı kuru maya "
"ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Thank you for your assistance."
msgstr "Yardımın için teşekkür ederim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Yeast should be common in homes or bakeries."
msgstr "Mayanın evlerde veya fırınlarda yaygın olması gerekir."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Do you have the yeast?"
msgstr "Mayan var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Find 10 Sugar Beet Seeds"
msgstr "10 Şeker Pancar Tohumu Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"Sugar and molasses remains in short supply.  I've put in a request for more "
"but it is unlikely that I'm going to see a reliable source for some time.  "
"If you are interested, we are going to need sugar beet seeds to meet future "
"demand regardless of what the scavengers can find.  Could you bring me at "
"least enough seeds to plant a small 10 meter long patch?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Farms or supply stores might have a few seeds…"
msgstr "Çiftlikler veya tedarik mağazalarında birkaç tohum olabilir…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Do you have the sugar beet seeds?"
msgstr "Şeker pancarı tohumların var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Find 12 Metal Tanks"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"The drinks we brew here have become a major draw for visitors and the "
"occasional trader.  Our batches have become larger but we are still running "
"out of storage space between trading runs.  I've been able to get a few "
"volunteers to help me build a set of standing tanks but I still need 12 "
"metal tanks to build them.  I've talked with the scrappers but we are a low "
"priority at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Scrapping vehicles might be your best bet."
msgstr "Araçları hurdaya çıkarmak en iyi seçeneğin olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Do you have the metal tanks?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Find 2 200-Liter Drums"
msgstr "2 adet 200 litrelik varil bul."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid ""
"The other survivor outposts that we have contact with have been more than "
"eager to trade for beer or other drinks.  Transporting the drinks to them "
"has presented a number of challenges though.  If you could locate a pair of "
"200-liter drums we should be able to keep them supplied while turning a "
"significant profit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Factories or junk yards are the only places I know where to look."
msgstr "Bakabileceğim tek yerler fabrikalar veya hurda depoları."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Do you have the 200-liter drums?"
msgstr "200 litrelik varilleriniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
msgid "Carpenter"
msgstr "Marangoz"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter1.json
msgid ""
"My partner is in charge of fortifying this place, you should ask him about "
"what needs to be done."
msgstr ""
"Orayı güçlendirmekle görevli olan ortağım, ne yapılması gerektiği hakkında "
"ona sormalısın."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter1.json
msgid "I'll talk to him then…"
msgstr "Ona o zaman konuşacağım…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
msgid ""
"I was among one of the first groups of immigrants sent here to fortify the "
"outpost.  I might have exaggerated my construction skills to get the hell "
"out of the refugee center.  Unless you are a trader there isn't much work "
"there and food was really becoming scarce when I left."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Crop Overseer"
msgstr "Ürün Gözetmeni"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I hope you are here to do business."
msgstr "Burada iş yapmak için olduğunuzu umuyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"My job is to manage our outpost's agricultural production.  I'm constantly "
"searching for trade partners and investors to increase our capacity.  If you"
" are interested I typically have tasks that I need assistance with."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't have time to see you at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "For the right price could I borrow your services?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I imagine we might be able to work something out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I was wondering if you could install a cybernetic implant…"
msgstr "Siber implant takıp takamayacağınızı merak ediyordum…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I need help removing an implant…"
msgstr "Bir implantı çıkarmak için yardıma ihtiyacım var…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "I'd like to hire your services."
msgstr "Hizmetlerinizi kiralamak istiyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
msgid ""
"I was sent here to assist in setting-up the farm.  Most of us have no real "
"skills that transfer from before the Cataclysm so things are a bit of trial "
"and error."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I don't have anything to trade.  The work program here splits "
"what we produce between the refugee center, the farm, and ourselves.  If you"
" are a skilled laborer then you can trade your time for a bit of extra "
"income on the side.  Not much I can do to assist you as a farmer though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "Oh."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid "You mind?"
msgstr "Sakıncalı mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a lucky guy that went from being chased by the undead to the noble "
"life of a dirt farmer.  We get room and board but won't see a share of our "
"labor unless the crop is a success."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid "It could be worse…"
msgstr "Daha kötü olabilirdi…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid ""
"I've got no time for you.  If you want to make a trade or need a job look "
"for the foreman or crop overseer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid "I'll talk with them then…"
msgstr "O zaman onlarla konuşacağım…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Foreman"
msgstr "İşçi Şefi"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Can I help you, marshal?"
msgstr "Size yardımcı olabilir miyim, mareşal?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Morning sir, how can I help you?"
msgstr "Günaydın efendim, size nasıl yardımcı olabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Morning ma'am, how can I help you?"
msgstr "Günaydın hanımefendi, size nasıl yardımcı olabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"[MISSION] The merchant at the Refugee Center sent me to get a prospectus "
"from you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I heard you were setting up an outpost out here."
msgstr "Burada bir karakol kurduğunuzu duydum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "What's your job here?"
msgstr "Buradaki işiniz nedir?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Hey, are you looking for workers here?  I know a couple people back at the "
"refugee center that might be willing to come."
msgstr ""
"Hey, burada işçi mi arıyorsunuz? Mülteci merkezinde gelmek isteyebilecek "
"birkaç kişi tanıyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Ya, that representative from the Old Guard asked the two of us to come out "
"here and begin fortifying this place as a refugee camp.  I'm not sure how "
"fast he expects the two of us to get setup but we were assured additional "
"men were coming out here to assist us. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "How many refugees are you expecting?"
msgstr "Kaç mülteci bekliyorsunuz?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of"
" its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as "
"much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the "
"materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something but the "
"lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us to"
" build from scratch.  The refugee center I came from is constantly facing "
"starvation and undead assaults."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Hopefully moving out here was worth it…"
msgstr "Umarım buraya taşınmak buna değmiştir…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I'm the engineer in charge of turning this place into a working camp.  This "
"is going to be an uphill battle, we used most of our initial supplies "
"getting here and boarding up the windows.  I've got a huge list of tasks "
"that need to get done so if you could help us keep supplied I'd appreciate "
"it.  If you have material to drop off you can just back your vehicle into "
"here and dump it on the ground, we'll sort it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"we're still in early stages of getting set up, but we're not overly flush "
"for hands, that's for sure.  If they're willing to put in a hard day's work,"
" we can get them busy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll tell them that, but they seemed good for a bit of hard labor."
msgstr "Bunu onlara söyleyeceğim, ama biraz ağır iş için iyi görünüyorlardı."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Cut 200 planks"
msgstr "200 tahtayı kes"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Our first project is to enclose the barn so that new refugees have a safe "
"place to sleep.  Before we can begin serious improvements we need lumber to "
"work with.  Enclosing the four barn entrances will take nearly 400 planks… "
"if you could provide half of that we should be able to take care of the "
"other half and construction.  If you don't have a truck, I'd make finding "
"one your first priority."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The more men we can bring to the camp the quicker improvements can be made."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Avoid destroying the furniture, we'll be needing it."
msgstr "Mobilyaları yok etmekten kaçının, ona ihtiyacımız olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have them?"
msgstr "Onları bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Great, I'll send word that we could use another set of hands or two to help "
"out here."
msgstr ""
"Harika, burada yardım edecek bir veya iki set daha eleman bulabileceğimizi "
"bildireceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Find 25 Blankets"
msgstr "25 Battaniye bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"With the barn entrances enclosed the refugees moving into there should feel "
"safer but the weather can be bitter here.  We're going to need to build "
"makeshift beds in the stalls to ward off disease and frostbite.  We can take"
" care of the frames but will need your help looting blankets.  We'd need 25 "
"blankets to provide the most basic sleeping accommodations."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I'd start with looting hotels or you could sew them together… but that would"
" be a last resort."
msgstr ""
"Otelleri yağmalamaya başlayabilirsin ya da onları bir araya dikebilirsin… "
"ama bu son çare olur."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Avoid destroying the furniture here, we'll be needing it."
msgstr "Buradaki mobilyaları yok etmekten kaçının, ona ihtiyacımız olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Your assistance is always appreciated."
msgstr "Yardımın her zaman takdir ediliyor."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 2500 Nails"
msgstr "2500 Çivi topla"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Our supply of nails has been depleted.  I'm going to have to ask you to get "
"us a few more boxes.  Hardware stores should have a few if they haven't been"
" looted.  I suppose you may be able to find handfuls of them in building "
"rubble.  We'd need 2500 to have enough that we won't be sending you back out"
" too soon."
msgstr ""
"Çivilerimizin stoğu tükendi. Sizden birkaç kutu daha almamız için yardım "
"etmenizi isteyeceğim. Donanım mağazalarında birkaç kutu olmalı, eğer "
"yağmalanmamışlarsa. Binaların molozlarında bir avuç bulabileceğinizi "
"düşünüyorum. Size çok fazla geri göndermeyecek kadar yeterli olması için "
"2500 tane ihtiyacımız var."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Deconstructing furniture isn't going to be efficient, try looking for boxes "
"or grabbing any sitting on top of rubble piles."
msgstr ""
"Mobilyaları sökmek verimli olmayacak, kutular aramayı veya moloz "
"yığınlarının üstünde duranları almayı deneyin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 300 Salt"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure you've noticed the new workers that have started trickling in.  The"
" Free Merchant counsel is demanding that we immediately begin projects to "
"become self-sufficient due to limited supplies.  We are going to need to "
"rapidly setup an agricultural industry before winter and starvation catches "
"us unprepared and unsupported.  In order to get a half dozen shovels and a "
"couple of bags of seeds, we are going to have to trade for it.  I've already"
" got the deal lined up but the only thing they are willing to trade it for "
"is salt.  I negotiated them down from 500 units to 300… we were hoping you "
"might have access to a source."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Salt is key to preserving meat and other perishables… without any excess "
"food it wouldn't do us much good now but I imagine we'll need to send you "
"out to get more in the future.  "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"If you can find a source of salt water you should be able to boil it down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the salt?"
msgstr "Tuzunuz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "We are going to begin preparing our fields immediately."
msgstr "Tarlalarımızı hemen hazırlamaya başlayacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "30 Liquid Fertilizer"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Well, our first crop will be planted shortly but I'm starting to suspect "
"that our profit margin is going to be much smaller than we expect.  With "
"limited seed for our original crop our next course of action is to increase "
"the soil's fertility.  Is there any way you could find or produce a basic "
"liquid fertilizer for us?  We'd need at least 30 units to make a significant"
" improvement in our output. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I don't know the exact recipe but I'm sure you could make it from a "
"commercial fertilizer or produce it from bonemeal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'd look through a few basic chemistry books to find a simple recipe."
msgstr "Basit bir tarif bulmak için birkaç temel kimya kitabına göz atardım."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the liquid fertilizer?"
msgstr "Sıvı gübre var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "This really should make the first winter easier to survive."
msgstr "Bu gerçekten ilk kışın hayatta kalmasını kolaylaştırmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 75 Rocks"
msgstr "75 Taş topla"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Our current assessment for survivability has increased significantly thanks "
"to your efforts.  The next priority issue is securing a cleaner water "
"source.  Drinking from the pond on the back end of the ranch has led to an "
"outbreak of dysentery.  As quickly as possible we need to improve the "
"sanitary conditions in the camp.  To do so the first step is to dig a well "
"and construct stone fireplaces in the barn for the migrants to boil water.  "
"We are going to need at least 75 rocks from you if we hope to accomplish the"
" task before we all get sick.  After we have them installed you will have "
"free access to them, guaranteed. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"If you take a shovel to a pile of rubble you should be able to pull out "
"structural grade stone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I appreciate the work you do."
msgstr "Yaptığınız işi takdir ediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 50 Pipes"
msgstr "50 Boru topla"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"To fabricate the well's hand pump and construct components for several other"
" projects we are going to need to find or fabricate a number of steel pipes."
"  Plumbing is a distant possibility for now but some form of irrigation will"
" eventually become desirable.  You could assist us with procuring 50 steel "
"pipes, if you so have the chance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Hopefully we will be able to assign new migrants to help fulfill our needs "
"in the future."
msgstr ""
"Umarım gelecekte ihtiyaçlarımızı karşılamak için yeni göçmenler "
"atayabiliriz."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Pipes are used in numerous metal constructions.  Smashing abandoned "
"furniture may provide the material we need."
msgstr ""
"Borular, birçok metal yapıda kullanılır.  Terkedilmiş mobilyaları kırmak, "
"ihtiyacımız olan malzemeyi sağlayabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the pipes?"
msgstr "Borularınız var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
msgstr "2 Elektrik Motoru Topla"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"With the well's completion we are rapidly closing the sustainability gap.  "
"In order to expand from here we will need massive quantities of lumber to "
"construct fortifications and new buildings.  We have already begun work on a"
" manually operated sawmill but we will need two motors to control the actual"
" blades.  We were hoping you might be able to secure the motors for us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Power for the motors will be provided by a salvaged truck battery, you need "
"not bring additional mechanical components.  "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Motors of this kind are pretty commonplace in industrial machinery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the motors?"
msgstr "Motorlar var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 150 Bleach"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Disease and infection remains a persistent problem among the refugees.  "
"Without dedicated medical personnel and facilities I doubt everyone will be "
"willing to stick around when the next outbreak happens.  Until we can get a "
"former medic or nurse I'm just going to have to improvise.  Sterilization "
"would be the first step I imagine.  Bring me 5 gallon jugs of bleach so we "
"can get started."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'm sure you can find bleach in most homes…"
msgstr "Eminim çoğu evde çamaşır suyu bulabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find a large supply I'd recommend checking hospitals or "
"research labs."
msgstr ""
"Eğer çok bulamazsan sana önerim hastahanelere ve araştırma laboratuvarlarına"
" bakman"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the bleach?"
msgstr "Çamaşır suyun var mı"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I appreciate it."
msgstr "Bunu takdir ediyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 6 First Aid Kits"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We've started planning a medical clinic but we are going to need a lot more "
"supplies if we hope to warrant sending one of the few people with medical "
"experience from the refugee center to our outpost.  I know first aid kits "
"are rare but they have all the basic supplies that I'm uncertain of.  If you"
" could bring in 6 full kits I'm sure we could supplement them to make them "
"last a bit longer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "We'll do our best to make them last…"
msgstr "Onların dayanmasını sağlamak için elimizden geleni yapacağız…"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Homes, hospitals, labs, and doctor offices would be where I'd check."
msgstr ""
"Evler, hastaneler, laboratuvarlar ve doktor ofisleri kontrol edeceğim "
"yerlerdir."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the first aid kits?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Find 2 Arc Welders"
msgstr "2 Arc Welder bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The work you have done has swayed the leaders at the refugee center to send "
"someone out to assist with our medical needs.  The next step is for us to "
"get a sort of chop-shop setup so that we can begin using scrap metal to "
"build fortifications and equipment.  We are going to need a pair of arc "
"welders for our mechanics to use."
msgstr ""
"Yaptığın işler, mülteci merkezindeki liderleri tıbbi ihtiyaçlarımızla "
"yardımcı olması için birini göndermeye ikna etti. Bir sonraki adım, hurda "
"metal kullanarak tahkimatlar ve ekipman inşa etmeye başlayabilmemiz için bir"
" tür atölye kurmak. Mekaniklerimizin kullanması için bir çift arc welder'a "
"ihtiyacımız olacak."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "With two, we should be able to repair one if it breaks."
msgstr "İkisiyle, biri bozulursa tamir edebilmeliyiz."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The only place I've seen them is garages but I imagine you could find them "
"in some stores."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the welders?"
msgstr "Kaynak makinelerin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Find 12 Car Batteries"
msgstr "12 Araç Aküsü bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We have the basic equipment that we need but without a functioning power "
"grid we are forced to rely on the readily available vehicle batteries.  This"
" is going to be a chore but I'll need twelve car batteries to swap between "
"charging and powering our equipment.  The good news is that they don't need "
"to be charged, we can take care of that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "I'm counting on you."
msgstr "Sana güveniyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Cars can be found in traffic jams along roads or in parking lots…  I'm sure "
"you can find a few."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the car batteries?"
msgstr "Araç akülerinin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'm impressed with your abilities."
msgstr "Yeteneklerinle etkilenmiş durumdayım."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
msgstr "2 İki Yönlü Radyo Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Check with the nurse when you get a chance, I know she will need help "
"setting up our clinic.  On the construction front, we are going to need to "
"get dedicated scavenger teams setup to bring in the miscellaneous supplies "
"that we use in small quantities.  We are going to start setting up a junk "
"shop for them in the North end of the outpost so we could use your help with"
" that.  Communication is the biggest obstacle for the teams… could you bring"
" in a pair of two-way radios?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Organizing the scavenging missions is difficult enough without "
"communication."
msgstr ""
"İhtiyaç malzemeleri görevlerini organize etmek iletişim olmadan yeterince "
"zor."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"You should be able to find them in electronics stores or at a police "
"station."
msgstr ""
"Onları elektronik mağazalarda veya bir polis karakolunda bulabilmelisin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the two-way radios?"
msgstr "İki yönlü radyoların var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'm sure the scavengers will find these useful."
msgstr "Hurdacılar bunları faydalı bulacaklarından eminim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 5 Backpacks"
msgstr "5 Sırt Çantası Topla"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The volunteers for the scavenging teams will need to be issued some basic "
"equipment.  When the boss sets up shop in the junk shed you should ask him "
"what else he needs for his teams.  In the meantime we can provide a few "
"backpacks to get them started.  Could you find five backpacks to give to the"
" initial team?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "It may be easier to make them if you can't find a school or something."
msgstr ""
"Bir okul veya benzeri bir şey bulamazsan, onları yapmak daha kolay olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the backpacks?"
msgstr "Sırt çantaların var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Having at least basic equipment greatly increases survivability.  Thanks."
msgstr ""
"En azından temel ekipmana sahip olmak hayatta kalma şansını büyük ölçüde "
"artırıyor. Teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Find Homebrewer's Bible"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Growth has lately begun to stall, we have individuals passing through the "
"outpost but the prospect of hard labor just to eke out an existence is "
"driving them away.  We've asked around and decided that, despite our "
"pressing needs, building a bar ought to draw some of the less committed "
"individuals to the outpost.  Unlike other settlements, the more hands we "
"have to more food we can produce… at least in the long term.  Unfortunately,"
" no one here has brewed alcoholic drinks before so we are going to need you "
"to find a book called the 'Homebrewer's Bible' or something along those "
"lines."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I guess you should search homes or libraries?"
msgstr "Evleri veya kütüphaneleri aramalısınız sanırım?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I guarantee we will toast to your name when the bar is finished."
msgstr "Bar tamamlandığında adınıza kadeh kaldıracağımıza garanti veriyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Gather 80 Sugar"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Just flipping through the book I can tell that one ingredient in most of the"
" alcoholic drinks that we don't have a large supply of is sugar.  What "
"alcohol we have been able to loot isn't going to last us long so starting "
"our first large batch is a priority.  Could you bring in 80 units of sugar?"
"  That should last us until we can start producing our own supply."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"You might get lucky finding it but you could always boil it out of fruit if "
"you are familiar with the process."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the sugar?"
msgstr "Şekeriniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"There is a large group of thirsty individuals in our outpost that are truly "
"thankful for your work."
msgstr ""
"Karakolda, yaptığın iş için sana minnettar susamış büyük bir grup var."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
msgstr "30 Cam Levha toplayın."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Although we are an agricultural outpost, we are restricted to growing plants"
" that are compatible with the New England climate during the warmer months."
"  The easiest way to work around that is to build green houses to supplement"
" our external fields.  There isn't going to be an easy way to build these, "
"we are going to need a massive number of glass sheets to enclose the frames."
"  The first house will need 30 sheets of glass if you are still interested."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Deconstructing existing windows is the only way I know of to keep the sheets"
" intact."
msgstr ""
"Mevcut pencereleri sökmek, levhaları sağlam tutmanın tek yolunu biliyorum."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the glass sheets?"
msgstr "Cam levhalarınız var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We'll begin planting our first seeds as soon as we can get these installed."
msgstr "İlk tohumlarımızı ekmeye, bunları kurabildiğimiz anda başlayacağız."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "I'm not in charge here, you're looking for someone else..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Nurse"
msgstr "Hemşire"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "Size nasıl yardımcı olabilirim?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "I could use your medical assistance."
msgstr "Tıbbi yardımınıza ihtiyacım var."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I was a practicing nurse so I've taken over the medical responsibilities of "
"the outpost till we can locate a physician."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay a premium for medical supplies that you might be able to "
"scavenge up.  I also have a few miscellaneous jobs from time to time."
msgstr ""
"Bulabileceğin tıbbi malzemeler için ekstra ödeme yapmaya hazırım. Ayrıca "
"zaman zaman birkaç çeşitli işim var."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "What kind of jobs do you have for me?"
msgstr "Bana ne tür işler var?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Not now."
msgstr "Şu an değil."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I can take a look at you or your companions if you are injured.  Supplies "
"are in shortage, so unfortunately I'll have to ask you for 200 Merch, or 80 "
"if it's just you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Come back later, I need to take care of a few things first."
msgstr "Sonra geri gel, önce birkaç şeyle ilgilenmem gerekiyor."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "[80 Merch, 30m] I need you to patch me up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "[200 Merch, 1h] I need you to patch up me and my companions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "On second thought, I should be fine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hold still then.  It's the best I can do on short notice."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgstr "100 Aspirin Topla."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I've got a handful of bandages and a few first aid kits to work with at the "
"moment… in other words I'm completely unable to treat most serious medical "
"emergencies.  I'm supposed to have priority on any medical supplies that the"
" scavengers bring in but I imagine the black market for the stuff will "
"prevent me from ever seeing it.  I could use your help getting a few bottles"
" of aspirin to start with."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Aspirin is pretty common in homes and convenience stores."
msgstr "Aspirin evlerde ve marketlerde oldukça yaygındır."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the aspirin?"
msgstr "Aspirin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "We'll go through this pretty quickly but it does help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 3 Hotplates"
msgstr "3 Tava topla"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I was given a few bottles of bleach when I arrived but I need a number of "
"hotplates to actually sterilize equipment.  I'm sure you can find them in "
"any old house or appliance store.  Three should be enough for now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "It should be a fairly common item, don't know what else to say."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the hotplates?"
msgstr "Sıcak tabaklarınız var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 100 Multivitamin Pills"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Disease is spreading rapidly due to poor nutrition and there is little that "
"I can do about it.  With food being scarce, people are willing to survive on"
" whatever they can.  I need to start supplementing the outpost's diet with "
"vitamins to prevent potential deaths indirectly attributable to nutrition.  "
"I know it is a lot but if you could bring me 100 multivitamin pills I'd be "
"able to treat the most vulnerable before they spread anything to the rest of"
" us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the vitamins?"
msgstr "Vitaminleriniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
msgstr "4 Kömür Filtreleyici yapın"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Despite my recommendations, we continue to have travelers come in with "
"illnesses I've been able to trace back to contaminated drinking water.  When"
" boiling water isn't an option they need some form of charcoal water filter "
"that they can use.  If you could build me four charcoal water filters I'll "
"distribute them to groups as they pass through."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"With some basic survival and crafting skills you should be able to make them"
" with little effort."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal water filters?"
msgstr "Kömür su filtreleriniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find a Chemistry Set"
msgstr "Bir Kimya Seti bulun"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I've been working on producing some of our own medical supplies but I'm "
"going to need a chemistry set to get everything that I need in order.  Is "
"there any way you could go through one of the school chemistry labs and "
"steal me a chemistry set?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"You might be able to find one in a pharmacy if you can't find a school."
msgstr "Bir okul bulamazsan bir eczanede bir tane bulabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the chemistry set?"
msgstr "Kimya setiniz var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 10 Filter Masks"
msgstr "10 Filtre Maskesi Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"The number of airway infections that I've encountered in the past week has "
"depleted my supply of masks.  Could you find me 10 filter masks?  I tend to "
"only distribute them in severe cases so I'll be sure to make them last."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "You may be able to make one if you had the right guide."
msgstr "Doğru kılavuzun olursa bir tane yapabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the filter masks?"
msgstr "Filtre maskelerin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
msgstr "4 Çift Kauçuk Eldiven Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"The bodily fluids that I often have to clean up and the caustic chemicals I "
"deal with have done a number on my current pair of gloves.  Could you find "
"me four pairs of heavy rubber gloves?  That should be enough that I can task"
" a few laborers with cleanup details in the event of an outbreak."
msgstr ""
"Sıklıkla temizlemek zorunda kaldığım bedensel sıvılar ve uğraştığım "
"aşındırıcı kimyasallar mevcut eldivenlerimi mahvetti.  Bana dört çift ağır "
"kauçuk eldiven bulabilir misin?  Bu, bir salgın durumunda birkaç işçiyi "
"temizlik görevleriyle görevlendirebilmem için yeterli olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "You should be able to find them in cleaning closets."
msgstr "Onları temizlik dolaplarında bulabilirsin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the rubber gloves?"
msgstr "Kauçuk eldivenlerin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 2 Scalpels"
msgstr "2 Bıçak Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I heard that we may have a physician on his way here.  The workers have "
"already begun expanding the clinic but I need you to locate a pair of "
"scalpels to use in surgery when he arrives.  I'm sure you should be able to "
"find them in a hospital or craft shop."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hospitals and crafting stores should have a few."
msgstr "Hastanelerde ve zanaat dükkanlarında birkaç tane olmalı."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the scalpels?"
msgstr "Bıçakların var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
msgstr "Gelişmiş Acil Bakım'ı Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Have you heard of a book called the 'Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?'  I "
"really need a copy.  The doctor is requesting a lot of supplies that I'm not"
" familiar with but I believe I could make if I could get a copy of the book."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Libraries are the only place I'd think to look."
msgstr "Kütüphaneler, bakmayı düşündüğüm tek yer."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?"
msgstr "Gelişmiş Acil Bakım Rehberi'ni bulabildin mi?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 10 Syringes"
msgstr "10 Şırınga Bul"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"We are starting to isolate a few natural antibiotic serums but we don't have"
" the supplies to administer the cocktails.  I need you to bring me 10 empty "
"syringes to use.  I'll take care of cleaning them to prevent transferring "
"infections."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have a few sitting around."
msgstr "Hastanelerde veya kliniklerde birkaç tane olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the empty syringes?"
msgstr "Boş şırıngaların var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Scavenger Boss"
msgstr "Çöplük Patronu"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Welcome to the junk shop."
msgstr "Hurda dükkanına hoş geldin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Let's see what you've managed to find."
msgstr "Ne bulduğunu görelim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Any lucky find?"
msgstr "Şanslı bir buluş var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"I organize scavenging runs to bring in supplies that we can't produce "
"ourselves.  I try and provide incentives to get migrants to join one of the "
"teams… its dangerous work but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything we "
"can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop off "
"a companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "Bunu düşüneceğim."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Are you interested in the scavenging runs or one of the other tasks that I "
"might have for you?"
msgstr ""
"Hurda toplama seferleriyle mi ilgileniyorsun yoksa senin için başka bir "
"görevim mi var?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "What kind of tasks do you have for me?"
msgstr "Bana ne tür görevlerin var?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "Hayır, teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Nope, current run hasn't returned yet.  Come back in <interval>.  You might "
"find something you like."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Alright, thanks."
msgstr "Tamam, teşekkürler."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 12 Knife Spears"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"I can usually use additional survival gear to kit-out the new recruits.  The"
" most basic weapon that everyone gets is the knife spear… it provides a good"
" mix of range, power, and ease of use when engaging the more common "
"monsters.  Could you make me a dozen of them?  I may need more later but "
"that should help the first few teams."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "You should be able to make them with the most basic of skills."
msgstr "Onları en temel becerilerle yapabilmelisin."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the knife spears?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 5 Wearable Flashlights"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Night is the ideal time for my team to go on raids but they are going to "
"need better light sources to speed up their missions.  Could you craft a set"
" of five headlamps for them?  Keeping both hands free greatly helps during "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the wearable flashlights?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
msgstr "3 Deri Vücut Zırhı Yap"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Clothing that can withstand the wear and tear of climbing through windows "
"and fighting back wild animals is in high demand.  The best that we have "
"been able to field is leather body armor but it is difficult to make with "
"our limited resources.  Could you craft us three pairs of leather body "
"armor?  The life-expectancy of my scavengers would drastically increase if "
"you did."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Finding the leather might be easier in town rather than making it yourself."
msgstr "Deriyi bulmak, kendin yapmaktan daha kolay olabilir."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the leather armor?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgstr "12 Molotof Kokteyli Yap"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"When outnumbered or forced to pull back my scavengers have been taught to "
"throw Molotov cocktails to keep monsters from chasing them.  We go through "
"one or two on every mission so we can always use a few more.  Would you be "
"willing to make us a dozen?  I'm willing to pay you what I can for your "
"assistance. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Alcohol or lamp oil is probably easier to refine rather than find in large "
"quantities."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the Molotov cocktails?"
msgstr "Molotof kokteyllerin var mı?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Scrapper"
msgstr "Scrapper"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Don't mind me."
msgstr "Beni umursama."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid ""
"I chop up useless vehicles for spare parts and raw materials.  If we can't "
"use a vehicle immediately we haul it into the ring we are building to "
"surround the outpost.  It provides a measure of defense in the event that we"
" get attacked."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid ""
"I don't personally, the teams we send out to recover the vehicles usually "
"need a hand but can be hard to catch since they spend most of their time "
"outside the outpost."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid "Laborer"
msgstr "İşçi"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid "Please leave me alone..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Nasılsın?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid ""
"I was just a laborer till they could find me something a bit more permanent "
"but being constantly sick has prevented me from doing much of anything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid "That's sad."
msgstr "Bu üzücü."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what you could do.  I've tried everything.  Just give me "
"time..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid ""
"I keep getting sick!  At first I thought it was something I ate but now it "
"seems like I can't keep anything down..."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
msgid "Uhm."
msgstr "Ehm."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "You need something?"
msgstr "Bir şeye mi ihtiyacın var?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid ""
"I'm one of the migrants that got diverted to this outpost when I arrived at "
"the refugee center.  They said I was big enough to swing an ax so my "
"profession became lumberjack… didn't have any say in it.  If I want to eat "
"then I'll be cutting wood from now till kingdom come."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid ""
"The rate is a bit steep but I still have my quotas that I need to fulfill.  "
"The logs will be dropped off in the garage at the entrance to the camp.  "
"I'll need a bit of time before I can deliver another load.  I'll give you 10"
" logs for 200 Merch, or 100 logs for 1000."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "[800 Merch, 1d] 10 logs"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "[4800 Merch, 7d] 100 logs"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "Woodworker"
msgstr "Ahşap işçisi"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "Don't have much time to talk."
msgstr "Konuşmak için fazla zamanım yok."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid ""
"I turn the logs that laborers bring in into lumber to expand the outpost.  "
"Maintaining the saw is a chore but breaks the monotony."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid ""
"Bringing in logs is one of the few tasks we can give to the unskilled so I'd"
" be hurting them if I outsourced it.  Ask around though, I'm sure most "
"people could use a hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/bionics.json
msgid "Directional EMP"
